(no- 2651 ka)
(title- gautamatantram) 
(extent- 80 patra) 
(age- 1948)
(subject- tantra) 

<pṛ0 1a> oṃ namaḥ śrīkṛṣṇāya || 
praṇamya dvārakānāthaṃ gopījana manoharam | 
likhyate gautamitaṃtraṃ sarvataṃtrottamottamam || 
siddhāśrame vasan dhīmān kadācidgautamo muniḥ |
tapaḥ svādhyāya nirato bhaktimān puruṣottamaḥ ||
namasthan śirasā viṣṇuṃ stavan vācā janārddanam | 
japana karābhyāṃ yajñeśaṃ hṛdādhyayana tatparaḥ | 
samasta śruti tattvajña itihāsapurāṇavit | 
maṃtrauṣadhi kriyā vaśya yogasiddhāṃta tattavit | 
dharmmārthakāmamokṣārthī nāradaṃ praṇipatya ca | 
vinayāvanato bhūtvā paryyapṛcchaddvijottamaḥ | 
bhagavan kāmadā maṃtrāḥ śūdrastryāhyadhikārakāḥ | 
vibhinnaphaladāste tu naikatra phaladā bhatāḥ | 
etat samaphalāḥ sarve na maṃtrā iti na śrutam | 
yena sarvaphalāvāptiḥ sarveṣāṃ baṃdhureva yaḥ | 
sarvavarṇādhikāraśca nārīṇāṃ yogya eva ca | 
taṃ bruhi bhagavanmaṃtraṃ bhama sarvārthasiddhaye | 
tavanā viditaṃ kiṃcidvihyate sa carācare | 
iti śrutvā muniśreṣṭo natvā viṣṇumuvācaha | 
sādhupṛṣṭaṃ mayāpyekaṃ pṛṣṭaḥ provāca padmajaḥ | 
tathā te kathayiṣyāmi yathāproktaṃ svayambhuvā | 
sarve kāmāḥ prasiddhyaṃti kṛṣṇamaṃtra japādvija | 
sarveṣu maṃtravargeṣu vaiṣṇavaṃ śreṣṭamucyate | 
gāṇapatyeṣu śaiveṣu tathā śākteṣu suvrata | 
vaiṣṇaveṣu samasteṣu kṛṣṇamaṃtrāḥ phalāptaye | 
viśeṣato daśārṇo'yaṃ japamātreṇa siddhidaḥ | 
maṃtrastha jñānamātreṇa labhenmuktiṃ caturvidhām | 
samasta pāparāśīnāṃ jvalano'yaṃ munīśvara | 
anena sadṛśo maṃtro jagatasvapi na vidyate | 

<pṛ0 1ba> anenārādhitaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ prasīdatyeva tatkṣaṇāt | 
tasya saṃkṣepato vakṣye sarvaṃ samyak śṛṇu svame | 
padmayonikhāyāgryaṃ daivarājyaṃ śacīpatiḥ | 
avāpustvidaśāḥ svargaṃ vāgīśatvaṃ vṛhaspatiḥ | 
pakṣiṇāmadhipaḥ so'bhūdgaruḍo'pi dvijottama | 
kaścit kṛṣṇaṃ samārādhya dhaneśatvamavāptavān |
maṃtreṇa kṛṣṇamārādhya candraḥ sarvajana priyaḥ | 
karoti svavaśe kāmaḥ sarvān kāmānamena ca | 
maṃtraṇāṃ paramo maṃtro guhyānāṃ guhyamuttamam | 
maṃtrarājamimaṃ jñātvā kṛtārtho jāyate naraḥ | 
putravān dhanavān vāśmī lakṣmīvān paśuvān bhavet | 
subhagaḥ sasmataḥ ślāghyo yaśasvī kīrttimān bhavet | 
sarvalokābhirāmaḥ syāt sarvajñaśca bhavennaraḥ | 
anena triṣu lokeṣu gatā muktiṃ mumukṣavaḥ | 
maṃtreṇānena maṃtrajño bhaktiḥ syāt premalakṣaṇā | 
samastatīrthapūtaśca samasta kṣetrapāvanaḥ | 
raverivadurādharṣaḥ ṣyuceriva śuciḥ sadā | 
śaṃkarasyeva siddhīśo viṣṇoriva samāṣprayaḥ | 
bahunā kimihoktena rahasyaṃ śrṛṇu gautama | 
nirvāṇa phalado maṃtraḥ kimanyairbahujalpitaiḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye mahātaṃtrarāje sarvataṃtrottamottame daśāṃkṣara phalādhyāyaḥ] || 1 ||

gautama uvāca 
samasta vedatattvajña sarvāgamaviśārada | 
adhunā bruhi me brahman maṃtrarājaṃ daśākṣaram | 

nārada uvāca 
adhunā saṃpravakṣyāmi vidhānaṃ muni nirmmitam | 
yāvanmaṃtra ṛṣichando devatādīnyanukramāt | 
khāṃtākṣaraṃ samuddhṛtya trayodaśasvara(rā)nvitam | 
pārṇatūryyasvarayutaṃ chāṃtaṃ dhāṃtaṃ tathā dvayam | 

<pṛ0 2a> amṛtākṣaramuddhṛtya caikato māṃsayugmakam | 
patūryyaṃ mukhavṛttena pavanaḥ svāhayānvitam | 
daśākṣara manuḥ proktī dṛṣṭādṛṣṭaphalapradaḥ | 
tena gopījanavallabhāya svāhā | 
bījaṃ śaktiṃ ca vakṣyāmi brahmacicca parātparaḥ | 
brahmāṇaṃ māyayā sārddhaṃ māṃsārṇaṃ nādabindukam | 
etadbījaṃ samākhyātaṃ kṛṣṇatattvaṃ parātparam | 
śukrārṇa mamṛtārṇena (*) khavṛttena saṃyutam | 
gaganaṃ mukhavṛttena proktā śaktiḥ parātparā | 
eṣā śaktiḥ parāsūkṣmā nityā samvit pradāyinī | 
īśvaro jagatāṃ bījaṃ śaktirguṇamayī tathā | 
paramātmā tathā buddhirvvāyuḥ kuṃḍalinīti ca | 
caturvidhe bījaśaktī sarvamaṃtreṣu ciṃtayet | 
tritayaṃ tatra sāmānyaṃ tadidānīṃ nirupyate | 
īśvaro jagatāṃ bījaṃ ādyaṃ brahma taducyate | 
tasya māyā samākhyātā śaktirguṇamayī tathā | 
prakṛtiḥ puruṣaścaiva nityaḥ kālaśca sattama | 
tatvāni ceśvaraścaiva brahmeti paṃcamaṃ smṛtam | 
sargāṃtaḥ puruṣaśceti tūryyākhyā prakṛtiḥ parā | 
tatvāni māṃsarupāṇi kālaśca tattvarupakaḥ | 
īśvarākhyā bhavennādo binduścaitanya cinmayaḥ | 
etadvijñānamātreṇa jīvanmukto mahīṃ caret | 
nāsyakālakalāpe jñāna tīrthāyatanāni ca | 
klīṃkārādasṛjadviśvamiti prāhaḥ śrutergiraḥ | 
lakārāt pṛthivījātā kakārājjalasambhavaḥ | 
īkārādagnirutpanno nādādvāyurajāyataṃ | 
bindīrākāśasambhūtiriti bhūtārthako manuḥ |

<pṛ0 2ba> svaśabdena ca kṣetrajñaḥ heti cit prakṛtiḥ parā | 
tayoraikyasamudbhūtimukaveṣṭana kārṇakaḥ | 
ateva hi viśvasya layaḥ svāhārṇake bhavet | 
gopīti prakṛtiṃ vindyājjanastattvasamūhakam | 
anayorāśrayavyātthā kāraṇatvena ceśvaraḥ | 
sāndrānandaḥ paraṃjyotirvalabhena ca kathyate | 
tripādūrddha udait puruṣa ityāhuḥ |
prathamāgiraḥ |
bījoccāraṇamātreṇa citsvabhāvaḥ prajāyate | 
vallabhena ca tādātmyaṃ svāhayā jñānadāyakam | 
ityevaṃ kathitaṃ tatvaṃ mune vai brahmasanmatam | 
athavā gopīprakṛtirjjanastadaṃśamaṃḍalam | 
anayorvalabhaḥ svāmī kṛṣṇākhya īśvaraḥ smṛtaḥ | 
kāryyakāraṇayorīśaḥ śrutibhistena gīyate | 
aneka janma siddhānāṃ gopīnāṃ patireva vā |
nandanandana | ityuktastailokyānandavarddhanaḥ 
cintayedvirajo maṃtrī sarvasampati hetave | 
daśānāmapi tatvānāṃ sākṣī vettā tathākṣaraṃ | 
daśākṣara iti khyāto maṃtrarājaḥ parātpara |
luptabījasvabhāvatvāt daśārṇa iti kathyate |
bīja pūrvo japaścāsya rahasyaṃ kathitaṃ mune |
nārado'sya muniḥ proktaśchando virāḍiti smṛtam | 
śrīkṛṣṇa devatā cāstha durgādhiṣṭhātṛ devatā | 
maheśvara mukhāja jñātvā yaḥ sākṣāttapasāmanum | 
saṃsādhayati śuddhātmā sa tasya ṛṣirīritaḥ | 
gurutvātmastake cāsya puruṣārtha catuṣṭaye | 
ṛṣiśchando'parijñānānna maṃtraḥ phalabhāg bhavet | 
daurbalyaṃ yāti maṃtrāṇāṃ viniyogamajānatām | 
maṃtranyāsamatho vakṣye dṛṣṭādṛṣṭa phalapradaṃ | 
praṇavābhyāṃ puṭaṃ kṛtvā namo'ntāddaśavarṇakān | 

<pṛ0 3a> dakṣāṃguṣṭhādi vāmāṃtaṃ nyāsaḥ syāt sṛṣṭirīritā | 
vāmāṃguṣṭhādi dakṣāṃtaṃ saṃhṛtiḥ parikīrttitā | 
ubhayoḥ karayorjyeṣṭhā pūrvikā sthiti rucyate |
saṃhṛtiḥ parikīrtitā | 
ubhayoḥ karayorjyeṣṭhā pūrvikā sthiti rucyate | 
saṃhṛtirdeva saṃghānāṃ hāriṇī parikīrttitā | 
vidyāpradā ca sṛṣṭyaṃtā varṇānāṃ śuddha cetasāṃ | 
sthityaṃtaṃsthādagṛhasthānāṃ trayaṃ kāmānurupataḥ | 
sahājine vānaprasthe sthityaṃtaṃ kaścidicchati | 
saṃhārāṃto munīnāṃ ca viviktasya ca sarvaśaḥ | 
nyāsatrayaṃ sadā kāryyamaśaktāvekameva hi |
varnanyāsāṃstathā maṃtrī dehe ca parivinyaset | 
hastamule kūrparake maṇibandhe'ṅgulimūle | 
aṃgulyagre ca vinyasya pādayorupari nyaset | 
hastamulādi sṛṣṭiḥ sthānmaṇibaṃdhāt sthitiḥ smṛtvā | 
aṃgulyagrāt saṃhṛtiḥ sthātasthityaṃtaṃ tritayaṃ nyaset | 
tataḥ karāṃgayornyāsāstathaiva parikīrtitāḥ | 
ācakrāya tathā syāhā aṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ namo bhavet |
vicakrāya svāheti ca tarjanībhyāṃ tathoccaret | 
sucakrāya tathā svāhā madhyamābhyāṃ tathoccaret | 
trailokyarakṣaṇacakrāya svāhetyanāmike tathā | 
asurāṃtacakrāya svāhā kaniṣṭayornamaḥ |
rukmiṇī prakṛtirvāmā sākṣādamṛtavigrahā | 
dakṣiṇaḥ puruṣaḥ prokto jyotistu viṣavigrahaḥ |
saṃyogāt karayorevaṃ parātatvaṃ prajāyate | 
ateva samastānāṃ vastūnāṃ śodhanaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
paṃcagāni tataḥ kuryyādaṃgamaṃtreṇa deśikaḥ | 
paṃcāṃgāni manoryatra tatra netraṃ vivarjayet | 
ācakrāya tathā svāhā hṛdayāya namo vadet | 
aṃguṣṭarahite naiva karāgreṇa hṛdaṃ spṛśet | 
vicakrāya tathā svāhā śirase svāheti saṃvadet |

<pṛ0 3ba> śirasi vinyasettadvat tathaiva karaśākhayā | 
śucakrāya tathā svāhā śikhāyai vaṣaḍuccaret | 
tathādho'ṅguṣṭhamuṣṭyā tu śikhāyāṃ parivinyaset | 
trailokyarakṣaṇacakrāya svāheti kavacāya huṃ | 
hastābhyāṃ śira ālabhya pādāṃtaṃ saṃspṛśedyatiḥ | 
asurāṃtakacakrāya svāhā svāya phaḍuccaret | 
jarddhorddha tālatritayachoṭikābhirddhiśodaśa | 
bandhayemmuni śārdūla nitya nyāso'yamīritaḥ | 
ikṣyamāṇo hṛdātmānāṃ hṛdaye syāccidātmakaḥ | 
kriyate tat parātmā ca hṛnmaṃtreṇa ca deśikaḥ | 
sarvajñādi guṇāttuṃrī saṃvidrupe parātmani | 
kriyate viṣayāhāraḥ śiromaṃtreṇa dhīmatā | 
hṛchirorupacinnāmamayatābhāva cetanā | 
kriyate nijadevasya śiromaṃtreṇa sādaram | 
maṃtrātmakasya devasya maṃtravācyena tejasā | 
sarvato varmmamaṃtreṇa kriyate'nanya saṃbhṛtiḥ | 
yaddadāti paraṃjñānaṃ saṃvidrupe parātmani | 
hṛdayādi mayaṃ tejaḥ sthādetannetra saṃjñakam | 
ādhyātmikādirupaṃ yat sādhakasya vināśayet | 
avidyāyā tu maṃtraṃ tat paraṃ dhāma samīritam | 

gautama uvāca 
brahman brahmavidāṃ śreṣṭa sarvabhūtahiterataḥ | 
tvameva kṛṣṇadevasya aṃtaryāmī nirāmayaḥ | 
avidyā doṣanirmuktaḥ sumaṃtra vratasaṃyataḥ | 
sarvalokaikagamanaḥ sarvalokaika tatvavit | 
sarvānubhava sākṣītvaṃ sarvadeva namaskṛtaḥ | 
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi maṃtrarājaṃ parātparam | 
aṣṭādaśorṇamaṃtrastu guhyādguhyātaraḥ smṛtaḥ | 
taṃ maṃtraṃ śrotumicchāmi yadi yogyosmi sattama | 
bhavārṇava nimagnaṃ māṃ tvamuddharttu mihārhasi | 
ityādi stutibhiḥ stutvā praṇamya ca punaḥ punaḥ |

<pṛ0 4a> pārśvamāsādyatadvakvamatirāsīnmunīśvaraḥ | 

nārada uvāca 
sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ tvayā brahman mayāpi brahmaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
maṃtrarājo muniśreṣṭa sarvavedāgamānugaḥ | 
tataḥ prabhṛti vipraṣeṃ haritāmāptacānahaṃ | 
tava srehāt pravakṣyāmi yatastvaṃ puruṣa priyaḥ | 
klīṃkāraṃ pūrvamucāryya kṛṣṇaṃ tūryyapadānvitaṃ | 
govindaṃ ca tathoktā tu daśākṣaraṃ tathoccaret | 
bhaktyā te praṇipatyā ca kathito maṃtranāyakaḥ | 
guhyādguhyataro hyeṣa vāṃchā ciṃtāmaṇiḥ smṛtaḥ | 
śaunakādyāśca munayastapyānye deva mukhyakāḥ | 
maṃtrarāja parijñānāt sadyastat sāmyatāṃ gatāḥ | 
kṛṣṇa śabdaśca sattārtho naśca nandasvarupakaḥ | 
sukharupo bhavedātmā bhāvānandamayastataḥ | 
gośabdena jñānamuktiṃ tena vindeta tat prabhuṃ | 
go śabdādveda ityuktaste narā labhate vibhuṃ | 
evaṃ te kathitā maṃtra vāsanā munisattama | 
etajña jñānānubhāvena jīvan kṛṣṇo na cānyathā | 
kimanyena bahūktena smaraṇāccāsya maṃtravit | 
jīvanmukto na sandeho viṣṇureva na saṃśayaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ prokto gāyatrīchanda ucyate | 
kṛṣṇaḥ prakṛtiretasya durgādhiṣṭhātṛ devatā | 
vāsudevaḥ saṃkarṣaṇaḥ pradyumnaścāniruddhakaḥ | 
nārāyaṇa iti khyātaḥ pada paṃcātmakaḥ paraḥ | 
akṣarārthastu kathitaḥ padanāma itīritaḥ | 
tasmādvijñāya vai maṃtrī puruṣārtha catuṣṭayaṃ |
labhate nātra saṃdehaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ hi gautama || 

<pṛ0 4ba> bījaśaktī purā prokto viniyogaśca pūrvavat | 
paṃcāṃgāni manīrasya padapaṃcaka yojanāt | 
brahmarandhre bhruvormmadhye jihvā kūpe tathā punaḥ | 
kaṃṭhadeśe hṛdi tathā nābhau liṃge ca mūlake | 
ghrāṇadvaye cakṣuṣośca karṇayorvinyasediti | 
brahmarandhre punaḥ sarvaṃ vyāpaka trayamācaret | 
mūddhiṇ vaktre hṛdi nābhau mūle ca pada paṃcakam | 
rohāvarohato nyasya keśavādyānathī nyaset | 
varṇanyāsaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā keśavādyāṃstato nyaset | 
bhūtaśuddhiṃ lipinyāsaṃ vinā yastu prapūjayet | 
viparīta phalaṃ dadyādabhaktyā pūjanaṃ yāthā | 
mātṛkā dvividhā proktā parā cāpya parā tathā | 
suṣumnāṃtaḥ parā nyāsyā aparā bāhyadeśake | 
athāṃtarmmātṛkānyāso mūlādhāre caturddale | 
svarnnābhevaśaṣasa caturvarṇā vibhūṣite | 
ṣaḍdale vaidyutanibhe svādhiṣṭhāne'nalatviṣi | 
vabhamairyaralairyuktairbindūdbhāsita mastakaiḥ | 
anāhate dvādaśāre pravāla ruci sannibhe | 
kādiṭhāṃtadalairyukte yogināṃ hṛdayaṃgame | 
viśuddhe ṣoḍaśadine dhūmnābhe svarabhūṣite | 
ājñācakre tu caṃdrābhe dvidale hakṣaraṃjite | 
sahasrāre maṇinibhe sarvavarṇavibhūṣite | 
akathādi trirekhātmahalakṣatrayabhūṣite | 
tanmadhye paribinduṃ ca sṛṣṭi sthiti layātmakaṃ | 
evaṃ samāhita manādhyāyennyāso'yamāṃtaraḥ | 
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ viṣṇuṃ dhyāyeccidātmakaṃ | 
binduśruta sudhāsāraistarpayenmātṛkāṃ nyaset | 
ekaikaṃ varṇamuccāryya mūlādhārādbhruvāṃtakaṃ | 
namonaṃtamiti nyāsa ācāṃtaḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 

<pṛ0 5a> bāhyaṃ vai mātṛkānyāsaṃ śṛṇuṣvāvahito mama | 
lalāṭa mukha vṛttākṣi śruti ghrāṇeṣu gaṃḍayoḥ | 
oṣṭha daṃtottamāṃgāsyedoḥ yat saṃdhyagrakeṣu ca | 
pāśvayoḥ pṛṣṭato nābhau jaṭhare hṛdayaṃ'śake | 
kakudyaṃśe ca hṛtapūrva pāṇipādayuge tathā | 
jaṭharānanayornasyenmātṛkārṇān yathā kramāt | 
caturddhā mātṛkā proktā kevalā bindusaṃyutā | 
savisargāsobhayā ca rahasyaṃ śṛṇu kathyate | 
vidyākarī kevalā ca sobhayā bhaktidāyikā | 
savisargā putrapradā sabindurvittadāyinī | 
keśavādi tato nyāsaṃ kuryyāt sādhakasattamaḥ | 
ṛṣiḥ prajāpaticchaṃdo gāyatrī devatā punaḥ | 
arddhalakṣmī hariḥ proktaḥ śrībījena ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ | 
karaśuddhividhānaṃ ca vidhāya dhyāna mācaret | 
udyadādityaśaṃkāśaṃ taptajāmbūnadaprabhaṃ | 
kamalā vasudhā śobhi pārśvadvandvaṃ parāt paraṃ | 
vicitraratnavihita nānālaṃkārabhūṣitaṃ | 
pītavastraparīdhānaṃ śaṃkha kaumodakīkaraṃ | 
vāmataścakrapadme ca dhyātvaivaṃ vinyasettataḥ | 
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccāryya śrībījaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ | 
mātṛkārṇaṃ tatonyasyedvakṣyāmi tat prakārakaṃ | 
keśavaṃ vinyaset kīrtyā kāṃtyā nārāyaṇaṃ nyaset | 
mādhavaṃ tuṣṭi sahitaṃ govindaṃ puṣṭisaṃyutaṃ | 
dhṛtyā viṣṇuṃ śāṃtiyutaṃ madhusūdanameva ca | 
trivikramaṃ ca kriyayā vāmanaṃdayayā nyaset | 
śrīdharaṃ medhayā hṛṣīkeśaṃ harṣayutaṃ nyaset | 
śraddhayāṃbujanābhaṃ ca lajjā dāmodarau tataḥ |
vāsudevaṃ tato nyasyellakṣmyā saṃkarṣaṇaṃ tataḥ |

<pṛ0 5ba> sarasvatyā tataḥ prītyā pradyumnaṃ cāniruddhakaṃ | 
ratyācakri jaye durgā gadinau śāṃrgiṇā prabhā | 
khaḍgisatye śaṃkhi caṃḍe vāṇyā cahālinaṃ nyaset | 
vilāsinyā mūṣalinaṃ śūlinaṃ vijayāyutaṃ | 
pāśinaṃ virajāyuktaṃ viśvayāṃkuśinaṃ nyaset | 
mukundaśca vinadayā sunadānaṃdajau nyaset | 
smṛtyā ca nandinaṃ ṛddhyā naraṃ narakajit samṛddhayā | 
hariśuddhī kṛṣṇabhaktī buddhi satyau ca sātvataṃ | 
matpāśaurīkṣame śūrarame tathomā janārddanau ca | 
kledinyā bhūdharaṃ viśvamūrtiṃ klinyā tato nyaset | 
vaikuṃṭha vasudhe caiva vasudhā puruṣottamau | 
balī ca parayāyukto balānujaparāyaṇe | 
bālaśca sūkṣmayā yukto vṛṣaghnaḥ saṃdhyayāyutaḥ | 
vṛṣaśca prajñayāyukto haṃsaścaiva prabhāyutaḥ | 
varāho niśayāyukto vimalo'modyayāyutaḥ | 
vidyutā narasiṃhena kathitāḥ śivaśaktayaḥ | 
evamaṃgeṣu vinyasya dhyātvā pūrvaṃ samāhitaḥ | 
bhaktyā tu pūja (*)(ye) ddevaṃ so'bhīṣṭaṃ phalamāpnuyāt | 
keśavādirayaṃ nyāsī nyāsamātreṇa dehināṃ | 
acyutatvaṃ dadātyeva satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ | 
keśavādyā ime śyāmāḥ sarve nārāyaṇāḥ smṛtāḥ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma lasadbhujacatuṣṭayāḥ | 
śacegīpīśagīpīcaśapacaṃgaṃśapāṃga ca | 
śaṃgaṃ camyaṃ śapaṃgaṃ ca dakṣiṇorddhaṃ karaṃ kramāt | 
namontārṇaṃ samuccāryya nārāyaṇa manuṃ vadet | 
prāṇātmānaṃ tathoccāryya keśavāya iti smaret | 
kītyai ca manasāyukta ityādi nyāsamācaret | 
mumukṣavaśca yatayaśca reyurnyāsamuttamaṃ | 
evaṃ vā vinyasennyāsaṃ lakṣmī bīja puraḥsaraṃ | 

<pṛ0 6a> smṛtirdhṛtirmmahālakṣmīḥ prāpyāṃte haritāṃ vrajet | 
vāgbhavādyaṃ nyasennyāsaṃ vāgīśatvamavāpnuyāt | 
yadyadādyaṃ nyasennyāsaṃ tadbījairaṃgakalpanaṃ | 
tatvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryyāt sādhakaḥ siddhihetave | 
kṛtena yena śrīdevarupatāmeva yānyasau | 
mādikāṃtāmathārṇāṃśca bījānyekaikaśoccaret | 
namaḥ parāyenyucāryya tatastatvātmane namaḥ | 
jīvaṃ prāṇadvayaṃ coktā sarvāṃgeṣu pravinyaset | 
tato hṛdayamadhye ca tatvatrayaṃ ca vinyaset | 
vaṃ bījaṃ matitatvaṃ ca phamahaṃkārameva ca | 
paṃ bījaṃ ca manastatvamityevaṃ tritayaṃ nyaset | 
naṃ bījaṃ śabdatatvaṃ ca nyasenmaulau tataḥ paraṃ | 
vaṃ bījaṃ sparśatatvaṃ ca vinyasedānane sudhīḥ | 
daṃ bījaṃ rupatatvaṃ ca hṛdaye vinyasettataḥ | 
thaṃ bījaṃ rasatatvaṃ ca vinyasedatha guhyake | 
taṃ bījaṃ gaṃdhatatvaṃ ca pādayoratha vinyaset | 
ṇaṃ bījaṃ śrītratatvaṃ ca śrītrayoreva vinyaset | 
ṭaṃ bījaṃ tvaktatvaṃ ca vinyasettvaci sādhakaḥ | 
ḍaṃ bījaṃ netratatvaṃ ca netrayoreva vinyaset | 
ṭhaṃ bījaṃ rasanātatvaṃ rasanāyāmatho nyaset | 
ḍhaṃ bījaṃ ghrāṇatatvaṃ ca nāsikāyāṃ pravinyaset | 
ñaṃ bījaṃ vākyatatvaṃ ca vinyasedvāci sādhakaḥ | 
jhaṃ bījaṃ pāṇitatvaṃ ca pāṇyoreva pravinyaset | 
jaṃ bījaṃ pādatatvaṃ ca pādayoreva vinyaset | 
chaṃ bījaṃ pāyutatvaṃ ca pāyau nyaset samāhitaḥ | 
caṃ bījaṃ liṃgatatvaṃ ca vinyasedatha śiśnake | 
ṅaṃ bījaṃ tatvamākāśaṃ punarmmaulau pravinyaset | 
ghaṃ bījaṃ vāyutatvaṃ ca vadane vinyaset punaḥ | 
gaṃ bījaṃ tejastatvaṃ ca vinyaset hṛdaye sudhīḥ |

<pṛ0 6ba> khaṃ bījaṃ jalatatvaṃ ca punaḥ śiśne pravinyaset | 
kaṃ bījaṃ pṛthivītatvaṃ vinyaset pādayoḥ punaḥ | 
śaṃ bījaṃ hṛtpuṇḍarīkatatvaṃ hṛdi pravinyaset | 
haṃ bījaṃ sūryyamaṃḍalatatvaṃ hṛdi pravinyaset | 
saṃ bījaṃ candramaṇḍalatatvantatra pravinyaset | 
vaṃ bījaṃ vahnimaṇḍalatatvaṃ tatraiva vinyaset | 
ṣaṃ parameṣṭhītatvaṃ ca vāsudevaṃ ca mūrddhani | 
yaṃ bījamatha puṃstattvaṃ saṃkarṣaṇamatho mukhe | 
laṃ bījaṃ viśvatatvaṃ ca pradyumnaṃ hṛdi vinyaset | 
vaṃ bījaṃ nivṛttitattvaṃ aniruddhamupasthake | 
laṃ bījaṃ sarvatattvaṃ ca pāde nārāyaṇaṃ nyaset | 
kṣrauṃ bījaṃ kopatattvaṃ ca nṛsiṃhaṃ sarvagātrake | 
evaṃ tattvāni vinyasya prāṇāyāmaṃ samācaret | 
daśākṣareṇa cettatra aṣṭāviṃśati recayet | 
pūrayedvāmayā tadvadvārayettat pramāṇataḥ | 
prāṇāyāmo bhavedeko recaka pūraka kumbhakaiḥ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇaṃ cettadvadvāśaivaṃ samācaret | 
ekena recayet kāmabījenaiva pṛthak pṛthak | 
pūrayet saptajaptena viṃśatyā tena dhārayet | 
sarveṣu kṛṣṇamaṃtreṣu bījenānena cācaret | 
athavā sarvamaṃtreṣu varṇānukramato japan | 
prāṇāyāmaṃ carenmaṃtrī recakapūraka kuṃbhakaiḥ | 
maṃtra prāṇāyāmaḥ prokto yaugikaṃ kathayāmite | 
recayeddakṣayā vidvāna mātrā ṣoḍaśakena ca | 
dvātriṃśanmātrayāpūryya catuḥṣaṣṭyā tu dhārayet | 
ekaśvāsaścaika mātrā mātrāyāṃ niyamo mataḥ | 
vāma ānuni hastasya bhramaṇaṃ yāvatā bhavet | 
kālena mātrā sā jñeyā munibhirvvedapāragaiḥ | 
prāṇāyāmī dvidhā proktaḥ sagarbhaśca nigarbhakaḥ | 
sagarbho maṃtra jāpena mātrayā saṃkhyayā bhavet | 

<pṛ0 7a> prāṇāyāmāt paraṃtatvaṃ prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ tapaḥ | 
prāṇāyāmāt paraṃjñānaṃ prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ padam | 
prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ yogaṃ yogaḥ prāṇāyāmāt paraṃ dhanaṃ | 
nāsti nāsti punarnāsti kathitaṃ tava suvrata | 
vatsarābhyāsayogena brahmasākṣādbhaveddhruvam | 
caitanyāvaraṇaṃ yadyat kṣīyate nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
prāṇāyāmaṃ vinā mukti mārgo nāsti mayoditaṃ | 
prāṇāyāmaṃ vinā yacca sādhanaṃ tada phalaṃ bhavet | 
prāṇāyāmeṇa munayaḥ siddhimāpurna cānyathā | 
prāṇāyāmaparo yogī na yogī śiva eva saḥ | 
gamanāgamanaṃ vāyoḥ prāṇasya dhāraṇaṃ tathā | 
prāṇāyāma iti prokto yogaśāstra viśāradaḥ | 
prāṇo vāyuriti khyāta āyāmaṃtannirodhanaṃ | 
prāṇāyāma iti prokto yogināṃ yogasādhanaṃ | 
ādyattayorvidhīyaṃte nāsikāpuṭacāriṇaḥ | 
recayeddakṣayā nāsā pūrayedvāmatastataḥ | 
dvātriṃśadabhyasan maṃtraṃ prāṇāyāmaḥ sa ucyate | 
brahmahatyā surāpānamagasyāgamanaṃ tathā | 
sarvamāśudahatyeva prāṇāyāmena vai dvija | 
bhruṇahatyādipāpāni nāśayenmāsamātrake | 
prātaḥ sāyaṃ carennityaṃ ṣoḍaśa prāṇa saṃyamaṃ |
nāśayet sarvapāpāni tūlarāśi mivānalaḥ | 
sarveṣāmeva pāpānāṃ prāyaścittamidaṃ smṛtam | 
svadehasthaṃ yathā saṃcavarmmotsṛjya nirāmayaḥ | 
prāṇāyāmāttathādhakṣatya vidyāṃ kāmakarmmajāṃ | 
athavā kiṃ bahuktena śṛṇu gautamamadvacaḥ | 
prāṇāyāmānna hi paroyogināṃ muktisiddhaye | 
prāṇāyāmaṃ vidhāyeścaṃ dehe pīṭhāni vinyaset | 
ādhāraśaktiṃ prakṛtiṃ kūrmmaṃ śūkarameva ca | 

<pṛ0 7ba> pṛthivīṃ kṣīrasindhuṃ ca śvetadvīpaṃ ca madhyataḥ | 
tanmadhye ratnagehaṃ ca sarvābhīṣṭa phalapradaṃ | 
gehamadhye kalpavṛkṣaṃ sarvaratna mahojjvalaṃ | 
dakṣāṃśe dakṣiṇakaṭau tathā vāmadvaye punaḥ | 
dharmmaṃ jñānaṃ ca vairāgyaṃ vinyasedaiśvaraṃ tathā | 
mukhapārśve nābhipārśve na ña pūrvāṃstu vinyaset | 
vinyasyaivaṃ punarhṛdi padmaṃ viśvamayaṃ nyaset | 
prakṛtyaṣṭalasatpatraṃ vikāramayakeśaraṃ | 
tanmadhye vinyasenmaṃtrī paṃcāśadvarṇa kārṇikāṃ | 
praṇavasya tribhirmmaṃtrairvinyasenmaṇḍalatrayaṃ | 
kalābhiḥ sahitaṃ tadvaddaśa dvādaśa ṣoḍaśaiḥ | 
ākārokāramaparāḥ praṇavāṃśodbhavākṣarāḥ | 
brahmaviṣṇumaheśākhyāḥ samaṣṭi vyaṣṭirupakāḥ | 
samaṣṭyā kevalaṃ brahma saccidānandalakṣaṇaṃ | 
svabījapūrvakāṃstatra sattvadīnatha vinyaset | 
tadaṃśe naivamatimān nyasedātma catuṣṭayaṃ | 
ātmāṃtarātma paramātma jñānātmānaśca te matāḥ | 
ātmāsau jagavastūlo viśvātmā viśvarupakaḥ | 
nāmādyabījasahitaṃ hṛnmadhye ca vyavasthitaṃ | 
ateva hṛdi nyasyedvāgvṛttirhṛdaye sthitā | 
aṃtaraṃgatayā cāyaṃ aṃtarātmā hṛdaṃtare | 
manomayastaijasākhyaścāṃtarindriya vṛtti dhṛk | 
ateva mune cāyaṃ aṃtarātmeti kīrtyate | 
aṃ bījāṃ cāsya gaditaṃ tat pūrvaṃ vinyaset sudhīḥ | 
ramādyātmasuṣuptyākhyo manovyāvṛttihārakaḥ | 
vilaye cendriye tatra sumukhaḥ kevala sthitaḥ | 
yaṃ bījāt paramātmānaṃ yajet sarvārthasiddhaye | 
saṃkarṣaṇaścāniruddhaḥ pradyumnaścetitatrayaṃ | 
jñānātmāsau vāsudevaḥ svayambhū prājñarupakaḥ | 
vṛttitraye vilīneti kevalaṃ sukha cit kalaḥ | 

<pṛ0 8a> sukhātmā vāsudevo'sau citakalā prakṛtiḥ parā | 
bījaṃ tasya pravakṣyāmi kevalaṃ sukha cinmayaṃ | 
vedatrayoddhṛtaṃ sāraṃ sarve kāraṇa kāraṇaṃ | 
keśaveṣṭa pṛśaktīśca cāṣṭaprakṛti rupiṇī | 
madhyaśaktiḥ parākhyā ca cidānandasvarupiṇī | 
vimalot karṣiṇī jñānā kriyāyogā ca śaktayaḥ | 
prahvī satyā tatheśānānugrahā navamī smṛtā | 
navaśaktīḥ pravinyasya nyasettatra mahāmanuṃ | 
namo bhagavate proktā sarvabhūtātmane padaṃ | 
vāsudevapadaṃ ṅentaṃ sarvātmayogasaṃyutaṃ | 
vijñeyaṃ ca tato yoga padmapīṭhātmane namaḥ | 
ayaṃ pīṭha manuḥ proktaḥ sarvabhūtātmakaḥ paraḥ | 
śyāmalaṃ komalaṃ dhāma tatropari viciṃtiyet | 

[iti śrīgautamīyataṃtre sarvataṃtrottamottame dvitīyo'dhyāyaḥ] || 2 ||

athākhilaṃ nyāsajālaṃ śṛṇuṣvāvahito nadya | 
nitya nyāsāḥ purā proktāyairvinā viphalā bhavet | 
maṃtrataṃtrātmanā sarvāḥ prakāreṇāpyanuṣṭhitāḥ | 
phalādhikyechyānyāsān samasta puruṣārtha dān | 
śṛṇu vakṣyāmi viprendayet viṣṇumayo bhavet | 
svaraṣaṭkaṃ yathā pūrvaṃ paścātyaṃ svaraṣaṭkakaṃ | 
mūrtti dvādaśakaṃ tadvadvāsudevena saṃyutaṃ | 
kalāpe vinyaseddātrā keśavaṃ susamāhitaḥ | 
nārāyaṇaṃ ca jaṭhare aryyamnā sahasaṃyutaṃ | 
hṛdaye mādhavaṃ caiva maṃtreṇa sahasaṃyutam | 
govindaṃ galakūpe ca varuṇena pravinyaset | 
bhujāṃte dakṣiṇe nyased bhargeṇa madhusūdanaṃ | 
padmanābhaṃ dakṣagale nyaseddhindhyasutāyutaṃ | 
dāmodaramakhendreṇa vāmapārśve nyaset sudhīḥ | 
bhujāṃte vāsudevaṃ ca puṣṇā saha pravinyaset || 

<pṛ0 8ba> vābhagale saṃkarṣaṇaṃ paryyanyena ca vinyaset | 
pṛṣṭadeśe ca pradyumnaṃ tvaṣṭrā saha pravinyaset | 
kakṣadeśe'niruddhaṃtaṃ viṣṇunā saha vinyaset | 
dvādaśākṣaraṃ maṃtravaraṃ vinyasedbrahmarandhrake | 
vāsudevo bhavet sākṣādvyāptitastasya tejasā | 
trimātrikaṃ samuddhṛtya namo bhagavate likhet | 
vāsudevaṃ caturthyā ca maṃtro'yaṃ surāpādayaḥ | 
asya vijñānamātreṇa vāsudevaḥ prajāyate | 
manu saṃpuṭitāṃ nyasenmātṛkāṃ viśyāmātaram | 
tenaiva maṃtraṃ siddhiḥ syāddoṣasaṃghāta nāśanāt | 
daśārṇagolaka nyāsaṃ vakṣye saṃbhūtidāyakam | 
maṃtradaśāvṛttimayaṃ gopanīyaṃ prajāyate | 
ādhāreṇa dhvaje nābhau hṛdi gala mukhāṃśake |
ūrudvaye kandharāyāṃ nābhyāṃ kukṣau stanadvaye |
pārśvadvaye tathā śroṇyormastakāsye ca netrayoḥ | 
karṇanāsikayostadvat kapolo karasandhiṣu |
tadagre pādayoḥ sandhau tadagreṣvapi cādarāt | 
mastake tat pratīcyādi diśāsu vyāpakaṃ nyaset | 
doṣṇostathorudvaye maṃtrī śirokṣāsya kaṃṭhadeśake | 
akṣi hṛddaṃtakaṃ vāmajānu prayat suvinyaset | 
śrotragaṇḍāṃśayornasyedvakṣojapārśvasphi gurau | 
jānujaṃghāṃghriyugale icchaṃ varṇān pravinyaset | 
vibhūti paṃjara nyāsaḥ sarvabhūti pravarttakaḥ | 
daśatatvaṃ tato nyaseddarśaṇaṃ śīghra siddhaye | 
pṛthivyapatejomarudvayadvipaṃcatattvakam | 
ahaṃkāro mahattatvaṃ tathā prakṛti puruṣau | 
para (+imāni) imāni tatvāni yathā vadavadhāraya |
pādāndhu hṛdaye vaktre mūrddhiṇyaṃ ca nyasettataḥ | 
hṛdi 

<pṛ0 9a> dvayaṃ trayaṃ vyātthā sarvāṃge vinyaset sudhīḥ | 
mastakādi tato nyasyed yāvat padāvasānakam | 
ayaṃ nyāso guptatamomaṃtrāṇāṃ śīghrasiddhidaḥ | 
karyyaunyeṣvapi gopālamaṃtreṣvapi viśāladhīḥ | 
daśākṣarasyavarṇāṃśca saṃhārakramato nyaset | 
sṛṣṭinyāse manorasya varṇān viparītānnyaset | 
ekaikākṣaramuccāryya namo'naṃtaṃ tataḥ paṭhet | 
parāyeti ca tattvāni tadaṃte namasā saha |
manasā vā nyasennyāsān puṣpe naivātha vā mune | 
aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ vā anyathā viphalaṃ bhavet || 

[iti śrīgautamīye mahātaṃtraṃ sarvataṃtre sarvataṃtrottamottame kāmyanyāso nāma tṛtīyo'dhyāyaḥ] || 3 ||

atha vṛndāvanaṃ dhyāyet sarvadeva namaskṛtam | 
sarvarttu kusumopetaṃ patatrigaṇanāditaṃ | 
bhramad bhramara jhaṃkāra mukharīkṛta diṃmukham | 
kālindījala kallola śītalā nilasevitam | 
nānāpuṣpalatāvaddavṛkṣaṣaṇḍaiśca maṇḍitam | 
samānodita candrārka tejodīpa na dīpitam | 
kamalotpala kahlāra dhūlīdhūṣaritāṃtaram | 
śākhāmṛga gaṇākīrṇaṃ nānāmṛga niṣevitam | 
dvātriṃśadvanasaṃvītaṃ vaikuṃṭhādatisaukhyadam | 
purandaramukhairddevaiḥ sarvataḥ samadhiṣṭhitam | 
tanmadhye ratnabhūmiṃ ca sūryyāyuta samaprabhām | 
tatra kalpatarudyānaṃ niyataṃ ratnavarṣaṇam | 
māṇikyaśikharollāsi tanmadhye maṇimaṇḍapam | 
nānāratnagaṇaiścitraṃ sarvatejo virājitam | 
phalabhāgullasaccitravitānairupaśobhitam | 
ratnatoraṇa gopūra māṇikyavedikāvitam | 
divyaghaṃṭāyukta muktāmaṇi śreṇī virājitam | 

<pṛ0 9ba> koṭisūryya samābhāsaṃ nirmmuktaṃ ṣaṭkaraṃgakaiḥ | 
vubhukṣā ca pipāsā ca prāṇamanasastathā | 
śokamohau śarīrasya jarāmṛtyu ṣaḍūrmmayaḥ | 
caturdvārasamāyuktaṃ kapāṭāṣṭakaśobhitam | 
tatra kalpataruṃ dhyāyet sthaviṣṭhaṃ ratnavarṣiṇam | 
sevitaṃ ṛtubhiḥ sarvaiḥ sudhāśīkara varṣiṇam | 
gārutmatalasatpatraṃ pravāla ratnapallavam | 
muktāratnaprasaritaṃ padmarāga phalījjvalam | 
saṃsāratāpavicchedi kuśalacchāyamadbhutam | 
tanmūle ciṃtayenmaṃtrī ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ śubham | 
tatra sūryyasamābhāsaṃ paṃkajaṃ coṣṭapatrakam | 
sarvatatvamayaṃ tatra ciṃtayejjagadīśvaram | 
saṃsārasāgarāttīrṇaṃ dharmmakāmārtha siddhaye | 
pītāmbaradharaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ puṇḍarīka nibhekṣaṇam | 
raktanetrādharaṃ rakta pāṇipādatalaṃ śubham | 
kaustubhīdbhāsitoraskaṃ nānāratnavibhūṣitam | 
uddāmavilasanmuktā ratnahāropaśobhitam | 
nānāratnaprabhodamāsi mukuṭaṃ dīptatejasam | 
hārakeyūrakaṭakakuṇḍalairupaśobhitam | 
śrīvatsavakṣasaṃcāru nūpurādyupaśobhitam | 
ratnairnānāvirdhaṃryuktaṃ kadisūtrāṃgurīkaiḥ | 
gorocanā kuṃkumena lalāṭa tilakāvitam | 
alakāśobhisaṃyuktaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtam | 
bimbādhara puṭodbhāsi vaṃśyāmṛtarasānvitam | 
varhipatra kṛtā pīḍaṃ vanyapuṣpairalaṃkṛtam | 
kadambakusumodvadva cārumālā virājitam | 
koṭikandarpalāvaṇyaṃ vilasadbandhurodaram | 
veṇuṃ gṛhītvā hastābhyāṃ mukhe saṃyojya vādinam | 
gāyaṃtaṃ divyagānaiśca vṛndāvana gataṃ harim | 

<pṛ0 10a> svargādivapariṣṭa kanyakāśatamaṇḍitam | 
go go vatsa gaṇākīrṇaṃ vṛhat ṣaṇḍaiśca maṇḍitam | 
gopakanyāsahasraistu padmapatrāpate kṣaṇaiḥ | 
arccitaṃ bhāva kusumaistrailokyaika guruṃ vibhum | 
tumbururnāradaścaiva hāhā hūhūstathaiva ca | 
kinnarī mithunaṃ cāpi śrutvā gītaṃ tathā hareḥ | 
vīṇādi sādhanaṃ tyaktā vismayāviṣṭa catasaḥ | 
te stuvaṃti mahātmānaṃ gāyavāvirati sthitāḥ |
siddhagaṃdharvayakṣaiśva apsarobhirvihaṃgamaiḥ |
sthāvaraiḥ pannagaiścāpi siddhaurvidyādharaistathā | 
śākhāmṛgairmanuṣyaiśca vīkṣyamāṇaiḥ suvismitaiḥ |
sarvalakṣaṇasampannaṃ saundaryyeṇābhiśobhitam |
mohanaṃ sarvaṃ gopīnāṃ lokānāṃ patimavyayam | 
nāradena ca siddhena viśvāmitreṇa dhīmatā | 
parāśareṇa vyāsena bhṛguṇāṃgirasena ca | 
dakṣena sanakādyaiśca siddhena kapilena ca | 
vāstu vāgīśahārīta yājñavalkyośanaḥkratuḥ | 
mārkaṇḍeya bharadvāja pulasya pulahādibhiḥ | 
vaśiṣṭhādyairmunīndraiśca stūyamānaṃ surāsuraiḥ | 
brahmalokagataiḥ siddhairnāgalokagatairapi | 
anyairapi suraśreṣṭhaiḥ stūyamānaṃ smared vibhum | 
evaṃ yaściṃtayenmaṃtrī cetasā kṛṣṇamavyayam | 
saṃsārasāgaraṃ ghoramapivatsapadāyate || 

[iti śrīgautamīye mahātaṃtre sarvataṃtrottamottame caturtho'dhyāyaḥ] || 4 ||

gautama uvāca 
yadyaduktaṃ tvayā brahman tattvaṃ sarvaṃ śrutaṃ mayā | 
idānīṃ paripṛcchāmi kenātra cādhikāritam | 

nārada uvāca 
dīkṣāyāmadhikāritvamāpnoti gurusevakaḥ | 
dvijānāmanupanītānaṃ svakarmmādhyāpanādiṣu | 

<pṛ0 10ba> yathādhikāro nāstiha sandhyopasana karmmasu | 
tathāhyadīkṣitānāṃ tu maṃtrataṃtrārccanādiṣu | 
nādhikāro'styataḥ kuryyādātmānaṃ śiva saṃskṛtam | 
ateva hi dīkṣārthaṃ sarvajñaṃ gurumāśrayet | 
sundaraḥ sumukhaḥ svaccha sulabho bahutaṃtravit | 
asaṃśayaḥ saṃśayachinnirapekṣo gururmmataḥ | 
vedavedāṃga vedāṃta siddhāṃta jñānapāragaḥ | 
vāṃmanaḥ kāyacittaiśca viṣṇoḥ suśruṣeṇarataḥ | 
viṣṇu taṃtrānusaṃdhāyī viṣṇu vijñānavedakaḥ | 
viṣṇau samarpakaḥ samyak trividhotpātakarmmaṇi |
sanmataḥ satsudāṃtaśca maṃtrārtha jñānapāragaḥ | 
ṣaṭcakrabhedakuśalaḥ ṣaḍdhvajñānapāragaḥ | 
piṇḍe pade tathā rupe rupītīte vivecakaḥ | 
saṃdhyātraya viśeṣajño'dhvaṣaṭkaṃ ca viśodhakaḥ | 
maṃtra caitanya vijñātā gururuktaḥ svayambhuvā | 
namo'stu gurave tasmai pratyakṣāya yadājñayā | 
mṛdbhasma dārudṛśadaḥ phalanya viphalaṃ phalaṃ | 
paṃcāmnāya viśeṣajño nigrahānugrahakṣamaḥ | 
śiṣyasya saṃśayacchettā gururbhavati nāparaḥ | 
vaiṣṇaṇvānvayasidvāṃta ciṃtāmaṇirivāparaḥ | 
āśramī jñānakuśalo gururbhavati nāparaḥ | 
maṃtrataṃtrārtha caitanya kuṇḍalī gati vedakaḥ | 
maṃtrasiddhāṃta vidhivad gururbhavati nāparaḥ | 
svadūramapi gaṃtavyaṃ yathāmnāya vidojvanāḥ | 
te'pi stutyā namasyāśca sevyāścābhīṣṭamicchatā | 
evaṃ vidho gururjñeyastvanyathā śiṣya duḥkhadaḥ | 
śiṣyaḥ kulīnaḥ śuddhātmā puruṣārtha parāyaṇaḥ | 
adhīta vedakuśalaḥ pitṛmātṛhiterataḥ | 
dharmmaviddharmmakartā ca guruśuśruṣaṇerataḥ | 

<pṛ0 11a> sadā śāstrārtha tatvajño dṛḍhadeho dṛḍhāśayaḥ | 
hitaiṣī prāṇināṃ nityaṃ paralokārtha karmmakṛt | 
vāṃmanaḥkāyavasubhirguru śuśruṣaṇerataḥ | 
anityakarmmaṇastyāgī nityānuṣṭhānatatparaḥ | 
jitendriyo jitālasyo jitamoho vimatsaraḥ | 
guruvada guruputreṣu tat kalatrādiṣu bhaktimān | 
evamvidho bhavecchiṣyastvitaro guru duḥkhadaḥ | 
varṣaikeṇa bhavedyogyā vipraḥ sarvaguṇānvitaḥ | 
varṣadvaye tu rājanyo vaiśyastu vatsaraistribhiḥ | 
caturbhirvatsaraiḥ śudraḥ kathitā śiṣya yogyatā | 
yadā śiṣyo bhavedyogyaḥ kṛpayā sadgurustadā | 
kṛpayā parayā samyag dīkṣāyā vidhimācaret | 
maṃtrārambhastu caitre syāt samastapuruṣārthadaḥ | 
vaiśākhe ratnalābhaḥ syājjyaiṣṭhe tu maraṇaṃ dhruvaṃ | 
āṣāḍhe bandhunāśaḥ syāt pūrṇāyuḥ śrāvaṇe bhavet | 
prajānāśo bhavedbhādre āśvine ratnasaṃcayaḥ | 
kārttike maṃtrasiddhiḥ syānmārgaśīrṣe tathā bhavet | 
pauṣe tu śatrupīḍā़ syānmādye medhāvivarddhanaṃ | 
phālguṇe sarvakāmaḥ syurmmalamāsaṃ vivarjjayet | 
paṃcāṃgaśuddhidivase svodaye candrasūryyayoḥ | 
guruśukrodaye caiva śasyate maṃtrasaṃskriyā | 
ravau gurausite some karttavyaṃ budhaśukrayoḥ | 
śuklapakṣe śubhā dīkṣā kṛṣṇe syāt paṃcamāvadhi |
dvādaśyāṃ sarvathā kāryyā cāmalāyāṃ śubhe'ni (*)|
kṛṣṇapriyā dvādaśī sā kṛṣṇadīkṣā pravarttinī | 
uttarātraya rohiṇyāṃ revatī puṣyavāsare | 
dhaniṣṭhā vāyumitrāśvipitryaṃtvaṣṭriṃ ca nairṛtaṃ | 
aiśva vaiṣṇava hastā ca dīkṣāyāṃ tu śubhāvahāḥ | 
āśvinī rohiṇī svāti viśākhā hastabheṣu ca | 

<pṛ0 11ba> kṛṣṇottarātrayeṣvevaṃ kuryyānmaṃtrābhiṣecanaṃ | 
śubhayogeṣu sarveṣu dīkṣā sarva śubhapradā | 
śubhāni karaṇānyāhurddīkṣāyāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ | 
śakunyādīniviṣṭiṃ ca viśeṣeṇa vivarjayet | 
caraḥ sarve viparyyaḥ syāt sthira rāśiṣu saukhyadā | 
triṣaḍāya gatāḥ pāyāḥ śubhāḥ kendra trikoṇagāḥ | 
dīkṣāyāṃ ca śubhāḥ sarvaṃ randhrasthāḥ sarvanāśakāḥ | 
śiṣyasya janmasaṃkrāṃtyo viṣuve ayate tathā | 
anyeṣu puṇyayogeṣu grahaṇe candrasūryyayoḥ | 
śiṣyānukulakāle vā dīkṣā sarva śubhāvahā | 
sūryyagrahaṇakāleṣu nānyadanvoṣataṃ bhavet | 
tatra yadyatkṛtaṃ sarvamanaṃtaphaladaṃ bhavet | 
vināyāset maṃtrasya siddhirbhavati nānyathā | 
bhūmeḥ parigrahaṃ kuryyādyāvadāyatanaṃ bhavet | 
śuklamṛtsnā ca yā bhūmirbrāhmī sā parikīrttitā | 
kṣattriyā raktamṛtsnā ca haridvaiśyā prakīrttitā | 
kṛṣṇā bhūmirbhavet śūdrā caturddhā parikīrtitā | 
brāhmyā sarvārthasiddhiḥ syāt kṣattriyā rājyadā matā | 
dhanadhānyakarī vaiśyā śūdrā tu ninditā mune | 
tato bhūmiṃ parīkṣeta vāstujñāna viśāradaḥ | 
śasyādi śodhanaṃ kuryyāttuṣāṃgārādīni dūrayet | 
etasyākaraṇe maṃtrī na kiṃcit phalamāpnuyāt | 
viprāśiṣāvedaghoṣairmaṃgalācārapūrvakaṃ | 
vāstormmaṇḍalakaṃ kuryyādyathāśobhaṃ tathāvidhi | 
pūrvāparāyataṃ sūtraṃ vinyaseddhastāmānataḥ | 
tanmadhye kiṃcidālakṣyamatsyau dvau parito likhet | 
tayormmadhye sthitaṃ sūtraṃ vinyase dakṣiṇottaraṃ | 
dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ tathā grābhyāṃ koṇeṣu makarān likhet | 

<pṛ0 12a> matsyamadhyasthitāgrāṇi tatra sūtrāṇi pātayet | 
caturasraṃ bhavettatra catuṣkoṣṭha samanvitaṃ | 
īśānādrākṣasaṃ yāvada yāvadagre prabhaṃjanaṃ | 
evaṃ sūtradvayaṃ dadyāt karṇasūtraṃ samāhitaḥ | 
brāhmaṇaṃ pūjayedādau madhyakoṣṭha catuṣṭaye | 
dikcatuṣkeṣu pūrvādi yajedāvāhyasattamaḥ | 
vivasvaṃtaṃ tato mitraṃ mahīdharamanaṃtaraṃ | 
koṇārddhakoṣṭadvandveṣu vahnyādi paritaḥ punaḥ | 
sāvitraṃ savitāraṃ ca śakramindrajayaṃ punaḥ | 
rudraṃ rudra jayaṃ vidvānāpaṃcāpya parāṃśakaṃ | 
tata karṇasūtro bhayataḥ kroṣṭhadvandeṣu deśikaḥ | 
śarvaṃ guhaṃ cārpyamaṇaṃ jātakaṃ pilipicchakaṃ | 
carakīṃ ca vidārīṃ ca pūtanāmarccayet kramāt | 
arccayeddikṣu pūrvādi sārddhādyaṣṭapadeṣṭhimān | 
aṣṭāvaṣṭavibhāgena devatā deśikottamaḥ | 
kramādīśānaparyyanyau jayaṃtuḥ śakra bhāskarau | 
sadyo vṛṣāṃtarīkṣau ca diśi prācyāṃ vyavasthitāḥ | 
agniḥ puṣā ca vitatho yamaśca gṛharakṣakaḥ | 
gandharvāṃ bhṛṃgarājaśca mṛgo dakṣiṇa diggatāḥ | 
nirṛtirddhauvārikaśca sugrīva varuṇau tataḥ | 
puṣpadaṃtā surau śoṣa yogau pratyagdiśisthitāḥ | 
vāyurnāgaśca kṛkaraḥ somo bhallāṭa eva ca | 
akulākhyodityaditī kuberasya diśi sthitāḥ | 
bhaktānāmapi devānāṃ pādānyāpūryya paṃcabhiḥ |
rajobhisteṣvatho tebhyaḥ pāyasānnairbaliṃ haret |
pāyasairmmadhuraiḥ sarvān saṃyajenmadhurānvitān | 
tattadravyairvāṃ matimān pūjayeddoṣaśāṃtaye | 
pāyasauṭanalājaiśca yuktaṃ dhūpa pramūlakaiḥ | 
annādibhirasaṃyuktaṃ māṣabhaktādi maṇḍitam | 

<pṛ0 12ba> gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ brahman vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
gandhādi śarkarā pūrva pāyasoparisaṃyutaṃ | 
āryyakākhya gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
candanādyarccitenātha karpūrā gurumaṇḍitaṃ | 
vivasvan vai gṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
saguḍaṃ pāyasaṃ nātha puṣpādiṣu samanvitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ nitya śāṃtiṃ prayaccha me | 
māṣodanaṃ samāṃsaṃ ca gandhādi kṣīrasaṃyutaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ mahībhṛttvaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
evaṃ madhye tu saṃpūjya īśānādi baliṃ haret | 
kṣīraṃ khaṇḍa samāyuktaṃ puṣpādibhiralaṃkṛtaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamāpacchāṃtiṃ prayaccha me | 
dadhīdaṃ guḍa saṃyuktaṃ gandhādibhiḥ susaṃskṛtaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃvatsavighnamavapraṇāśaya | 
puṣpādi kuśapānīyaṃ śarkarā guru vāsitaṃ | 
sāvitra vai gṛhāṇemaṃ śāṃtimatra prayaccha me | 
piṣṭhakaṃ saguḍaṃ nātha raktagandhādiśobhitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ sūryya vighnamatra praṇāśaya | 
śitamatraṃ tathā puṣpaṃ kuṃkumādi samanvitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ śakradeva namostute | 
odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktaṃ vastragandhādi maṇḍitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyamindra jaya namostute | 
pakvāpakvamidaṃ māṃsaṃ vastrapuṣpādisaṃyutaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ rudradeva namostute | 
samāṃsaṃ ghṛtasaṃpakvaṃ gandhapuṣpādrisaṃyutaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ rudra jaya svastiṃ prayaccha me | 
raktapuṣpaṃ samāṃsaṃ vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣo vighnaṃ vināśaya | 
pitta raktāsthi saṃyuktaṃ raktagandhādi maṃḍitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ putanetvaṃ rakṣo vighnaṃ vināśaya | 

<pṛ0 13a> saghṛtaṃ māṃsabhaktaṃ ca vastragandhādyalaṃkṛtaṃ | 
baliṃ gṛhāṇa śarvemaṃ rakṣo vighnaṃ vināśaya | 
māṃsa puṣpādi saṃyuktaṃ māṣabhaktoparisthitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ skanda rakṣo vighna vināśaya | 
samāṃsaṃ piṣṭhakairyuktaṃ pakvamāṃsodakānvitaṃ | 
arghaman vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣo vighnaṃ vināśaya | 
raktamāṃsodanaṃ matsyaṃ gaṃdha dhūpa samanvitaṃ | 
janbhakatvaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣo vighna vināśaya | 
saghṛtaṃ cākṣataṃ netra vastra gandhā ca laṃkṛtaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ skanda rakṣo vighnaṃ vināśaya | 
samāṃsaṃ piṣṭakairyuktaṃ pakvamāṃsodakānvitaṃ | 
arghanan vai gṛhāṇemaṃ rakṣo vighnaṃ tvīśa vāstudoṣa prahārakaṃ | (??????)
utpalaṃ pāpasairyuktaṃ vastrādika samanvitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ bhāskarāya namostute | 
vitānaṃ dhūmnavarṇābhāṃ gandhādika suśobhitaṃ | 
vastuyuktaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ valiṃ sadyo namostute | 
idaṃ tu māṣabhakte vai vastragandhādi pūjitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ vṛṣabaliṃ vāstudoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
idaṃ tu śārddūlaṃ māṃsaṃ naivedyādika saṃyutaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ vyomaśāṃtiṃ prayaccha me | 
suvarṇaṃ piṣṭakaṃ cātha vastra gaṃdhādibhiryutaṃ | 
ghṛtānvitaṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ saptajihva namostute | 
kṣīraṃ lājānāṃ sayuktaṃ raktapuṣpādisaṃyutaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ pūṣa deva namostute | 
dadhi gandhādibhiryuktaṃ pītapuṣpasamanvitaṃ | 
baliṃ pragṛhyatāṃ soma sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
odanaṃ ghṛtasaṃmiśraṃ gandhapuṣpa samanvitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ bhallāṭaka namostute | 
māṣānnaṃ tu ghṛtābhyaktaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādi maṇḍitaṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ argalākhya namostute | 

<pṛ0 13ba> pūlikāṃ madhusaṃmiśrāṃ vastragaṃdhādi saṃyutāṃ | 
gṛhāṇemaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ deva mātarnamostute | 
kṣīraṃ khaṇḍasamāyuktaṃ nānāpuṣpopaśobhitaṃ | 
daityamātargṛhāṇemaṃ sarvadoṣaṃ praṇāśaya | 
svargapātālamadhye ca ye devā vāstudevatāḥ | 
gṛhna tvimaṃ baliṃ hṛdyaṃ tuṣṭāyāṃ tu svamandiraṃ | 
mātaro bhūtavetālā ye cānye balikāṃkṣiṇaḥ | 
viṣṇoḥ pāriṣadāye ca tepi gṛhnaṃ tvimaṃ baliṃ | 
pitṛbhyaḥ kṣetrapālebhyo balindatvā prakāmataḥ | 
abhāve raktasūtraiśca kuśapuṣpādibhiryajet || 

[iti gautamīyataṃtre sarvataṃtrottamottame paṃcamo'dhyāyaḥ] || 5 ||

pātayettat praṇataḥ 
caturasraṃ catuṣkoṣṭhaṃ bhavedati manoharaṃ | 
koṇasūtradvayaṃ dadyāt pramāṇaṃ tena rakṣayet | 
caturasraṃ bhavet kuṇḍaṃ sarvalakṣaṇa lakṣitaṃ |
brāhmaṇaiḥ kṣattriyairvaiśyaiḥ śūdraiśca samanuṣṭhitaṃ |
sarvakarmmakaraṃ proktaṃ śāṃtyādi ṣaṭsu karmmasu | 
anena janayet sarvaṃ kuṇḍāni manuruttamaḥ | 
tataḥ kuṇḍaṃ khanenmaṃtrī yathā śāstraṃ vidhānavit | 
tyaktvā sarpasya gātraṃ ca śirodeśaṃ prayatnataḥ | 
śirodyātādbhavenmṛtyuḥ piṇḍeṣu piṇḍaghātanaṃ | 
pucche ca dukhaḥ saṃbhūtiḥ kroḍe sarvārthasādhanaṃ | 
yāvān kuṇḍasya vistāraḥ khananaṃ tāvadīritaṃ | 
kaṃṭhamekāṃguliṃ tyaktvā mekhalāstisra eva hi | 
kuṇḍasyāṃgulamānena vedāgni nayanāṃgulāḥ | 
caturasre bhaveyustā catarasrāḥ suśobhanāḥ | 
hoturagne yonivāsāṃ kuṃjarādharasannibhāṃ | 
ṣaṭcaturthyaṃgulāyāmo vistāronnati śālinī |  

<pṛ0 14a> ṣaḍaṃgulā bhaveddīghī caturaṃgula vistṛtā |
dvyaṃgulā connatā yonirvinā lakṣaṇa lakṣitā | 
sthalādārabhya nālaṃ syāt saraṃdhrī yonimadhyataḥ | 
sūkṣmāgraṃ sthūlamūlaṃ ca sarandhraṃ nālamīṣyate | 
yonyāmadhya vilaṃ kuryyāttadā hyagrāhi saṃjñakaṃ | 
kuṇḍamadhye bhavennābhiḥ padmaṃ vā caturasrakam | 
dvyaṃgulaṃ connataṃ tattu caturaṃgula vistṛtam | 
arddhāṃgulaṃ tu yonyāgraṃ kuryyādīṣadadhomukham | 
eva dvaya pramānena kuṇḍeṣvanyeṣu varddhayet | 
kaṃṭhastu dvyaṃgulaṃ tatra varddhayet kuṇḍamānataḥ | 
cutarasrasya kuṇḍasya ekahastamitasya ca | 
karṇasūtrapramāṇena dvihastaṃ kuṇḍamuddharet | 
sarvakuṇḍeṣu sarvatra varddhayo dvidhināmunā | 
kuṇḍaṃ tu prakṛtiḥ sūkṣmā sarvalakṣaṇalakṣitā | 
ubhau pādau karau tasya bhavet koṇacatuṣṭayam | 
udaraṃ kuṇḍamityuktaṃ yoniḥ kāraṇarūpiṇī | 
tena tatraiva havyānāṃ nidhāstu tanmayaṃ tataḥ | 
phalaṃ vitanute samyaganyathā viphalāyate || 1 || 
caturasraṃ samaṃ kṛtvā paṃcabhāgaikabhāgakam | 
varddhayet puratastasya madhyasūtra samānataḥ | 
karṇāt karṇagataṃ sūtraṃ kṛtvā bhāgacatuṣṭayam | 
bhāgenaikena koṇārddhe saṃsthāpya bhrāmayettataḥ | 
āmadhyasūtrādā madhyāt sūtrayugmaṃttato nyaset | 
tanmānāddhṛddhiparyyaṃtamevaṃ syādyoni sannibham || 2 || 
caturasrī kṛte kṣetre caturddhā bhedite tathā |
bhāgamekaṃ nyaset pūrve paścime caika bhāgakam | 
madhye sūtraṃ samādāya tanmānādbhrāmayettataḥ | 
dakṣiṇārddhenārddhacandramevaṃ syāt sumanoharam || 3 || 

<pṛ0 14ba> samasya caturasrasya adhaḥ sūtrasya pārśvayoḥ | 
aṃgulatritayaṃ dadyādūrddhaṃ dadyāt ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ | 
madhyasūtrasamānenaṃ sūtrayugmaṃ tato nyaset | 
tryasraṃ kuṇḍamidaṃ proktaṃ pūrvānanamabhīṣṭadam || 4 || 
aṣṭadhā bheditaṃ kṣetraṃ parikalpya samānataḥ | 
ekaikabhāgaṃ madhyasya pārśvayoḥ parikalpayet | 
madhye sūtraṃ tu saṃsthāpya tanmānādbhrāmayettataḥ | 
vartulaṃ kuṇḍaṃ bhavedati manoharam || 5 || paṃcāsrakuṇḍam 
vibhajya saptadhā kṣetraṃ vedāsrasyaikabhāgakam | 
tadvahirnyasya sūtrāgraṃ pūrvavat saṃprasāryya ca | 
tanmānādbhrāmayedvṛttaṃ bhūyo'pi caturasrakaṃ | 
yugāṃśīkṛtya lokāṃśaistadvṛttaṃ pūrvamāditaḥ | 
paṃcadhā cihnitaṃ kṛtvā cihnāccihnī vicakṣaṇaḥ | 
bhūyaśca paṃcasūtrāṇi samyāgāsphālayet kramāt | 
etat paṃcāsrakuṇḍaṃ syāt saptakoṇamihocyate || 6 || 
aṣṭadhā bhedite kṣetre madhyasūtra samānataḥ | 
varddhayedbhāgamekaikaṃ caturddikṣu vicakṣaṇaḥ | 
caturddaśāṃgulaṃ cādha urddhaṃstanmānato nyaset | 
yathā madhye bhavenmadhye sūtraṃ ca triṃśadaṃgulam | 
ṣaḍsūtralāṃchanāttatra jāyate tu ṣaḍasrakam || 7 || 
pūrvokta vṛttakuṇḍasya sarvocca mekhalopari | 
ṣoḍaśāti suramyāṇi padmapatrāṇi saṃlikhet | 
abjakuṇḍamiti jñeyaṃ vedavedāṃta pāragaiḥ || 8 || 
atha saptāsrakuṇḍam | 
daśāṃśīkṛtya vedāsraṃ ekāṃśenaiva bāhyataḥ | 
madhya prāk sūtra pūrvāgraṃ varddhayitvā te deśikaḥ | 
tanmānādbhrāmayedvṛttaṃ bhūyo'pi caturasrakam | 
catuḥṣaṣṭi vibhāgena vibhajya viṃśadaṃśakaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 15a> sannitrikaiśca rekhāyāṃ saptadhā lāṃchayet sudhīḥ | 
cihnādvicihnaṃtadīrghaṃ saptasūtrāṇi pātayet | 
saptakoṇātmakaṃ kuṇḍaṃ bhavedevaṃ manoharam || 9 || 
caturasre same kṣetre koṇe kṛte guruḥ (* *) | 
madhyasūtraṃ samādāya kṣetrārddhaṃ parikalpayet | 
madhye sūtraṃ tu saṃsthāpya koṇārddhaṃ sthāpayedbudhaḥ |
tato'tiriktaṃ yatkoṇe tadarddhaṃ diśi varddhayet | 
anyattenaivamānena caturasraṃ vāhirbhavet | 
vahyasya caturasrasya dvādaśāṃgulamānataḥ | 
aṣṭadikṣu kṣipet sūtramaṣṭāstraṃ kuṇḍamuttamam || 10 || 
vṛttaṃ vā caturasraṃ vā aṣṭāsraṃ vā gurau bhavet | 
evamvidhāni kuṇḍāni parikalpya samaṃtataḥ || 11 || 
sātvikī mekhalā pūrvā dvitīyā rājasī smṛtā | 
tṛtīyā tāmasī jñeyā ityuktaṃ kuṇḍalakṣaṇam | 
maṇḍapasyottare bhāge śālāṃ pūrvāparottatāṃ | 
gūṭhāṃ kuryyāda yathā śobhāṃ sarvadṛṣṭi manoharām | 
pūrvāparāyataṃ tatra paṃcasūtrāṇi pātayet | 
madhye madhye vilupye ca tasyā dvādaśa koṣṭhakam | 
paṃcavarṇa rajobhistu padāni tāni pūrayet | 
pālikāḥ paṃcamukhyāśca sarāvāṇi ca pātayet | 
dviṣaḍ dvyaṣṭacaturvviṃśaduśritāni yathākramam | 
tāvanmātra mukhānyūrddhapadāni parikalpayet | 
tattribhāgogulimukhairvvistṛtāni prakalpayet | 
nārāyaṇa maheśāna brahmarūpāṇi tāni ca | 
pālikāḥ paṃcamukhyāśca sarāvaṇi tataḥ param | 
prakṣālitāni maṃtreṇa puṇyāni tāni (caiva ni) caiva hi |
saṃveṣṭitāni paritaḥ triguṇaiḥ śubha taṃtubhiḥ |
mṛdvālukākarīyaiśca pūritāni samaṃtataḥ | 

<pṛ0 15ba> samarccita svadevaśca pāścimādi krameṇa ca | 
vinyasya pālikā śyāmā(ka)priyaṃguphala sarṣapān | 
mudgamāsau tilaśimvī kulasyaṃ cāṭukīntathā | 
prakṣālitāni śuddhena jalena tadanaṃtaram | 
abhyarccita svadevāni mūlamaṃtrārccitāni vai | 
viprā śiṣā paṃcaghoṣaiḥ saha niḥsāryyatānatha | 
viṣicya tu haridrābhirnamasya ca punaḥ punaḥ | 
vasanena samācchādya navīnena tataḥ param | 
śuddhābhiradbhiḥ sicyātha sāyaṃ prātarmuhurmuhuḥ | 
ityevaṃ saptarātraṃ vā navarātra mathāpi vā | 
sthāpayedvāpayeccaiva rātri śeṣe baliṃ niśi | 
lājatila hariprāśca śaktu cūrṇaṃ tathā dadhi | 
etaiḥ prathamarātrau ca bhūtebhyo balimutsṛjet | 
dvitīyāyāṃ kṣipedrātrau pitṛbhyastilataṇḍule | 
tṛtīyāyāṃ ca yakṣebhyaḥ salajādadhiśaktubhiḥ | 
caturthyāṃ rajanyāṃ dadyānnāgebhyaśca punarbalim | 
nārikelodakairmiśraṃ śaktu cūrṇaṃ manoharam | 
padmākṣataṃ brāhmaṇaiśca paṃcamyāmutsṛjedbalim | 
sapūpamannaṃ bhāgāya ṣaṣṭhyāmatho samāharet | 
gurḍodanaṃ viṣṇave ca saptamyāṃ vicaredbalim | 
aṣṭamyāṃ mātṛkābhyaśca chāgairmmāṃsaiśca pakṣibhiḥ | 
mīnaistathā ca madhubhirāharedbalimuttamam | 
tilaudanaṃ viṣṇave ca navamyāmāharedbalim | 
praṇavādi caturthyaṃtaṃ svanāma ca namo'ntakam | 
balimaṃtrastathaiva syādāvāhana visarjjanam | 
vividhānāṃ ca patrāṇāṃ parito bahireva ca | 
aṣṭadikṣu ca saṃdadyāllokapāleṣu yatnataḥ |
yokteṣu teṣu pātreṣu viṣṇu brahma harān yajet | 

<pṛ0 16a> mudagapriyaṃ tu niṣā(?)ve vāyuragniḥ kulaptyake | 
āvārakyāṃ rakṣasāṃ ciṃtyā cheṣaṃ siddhāntake tathā | 
prāṇapatiṃ śālirāje devo vaivasvatastile | 
indraḥ śyāme rājamāse varuṇaśca tathā mune | 
vastu khaṇḍe dṛḍha badhvā kiṃcit kiṃcidyavaṃ kṣipet | 
uddhṛtya yāmadvitaye samatīte ca vāpayet | 
bījānāṃ daivataṃ somaḥ sa rātrau kāṃtimān yataḥ | 
tasmādāhṛtyabījāni niśāyāmeva vāpayet | 
prarūḍhānyaṃ kurāṇyeva nādīkṣeta kadācana | 
ācāryya eva praviśet tachiṣyo vā tadājñayā | 
prarūḍhairaṃkuraiḥ karturnirdiśecca śubhāśubham | 
śyāmaiḥ kṛṣṇairaṃkuraiśca arthahāniśca duḥkhavān | 
kujairdhanaṃ viprarūḍhairmṛtiṃ kuryyānna saṃśayaḥ | 
ācāryyaḥ kārayeccaiva pralapadvīkṣya yatnataḥ | 
śāṃtikaṃ sarvathā kuryyāt kartturīpsita siddhaye || 

[iti śrīgautamīye mahātaṃtrottamottame ṣaṣṭho'dhyāyaḥ] || 6 || 

atha dīkṣāṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvasiddhi pravarttikām | 
yāṃ vinā naiva siddhiḥ syātmaṃtro varṣa śatairapi | 
tadaṃgaṃ kathitaṃ pūrvamidānīṃ kathyate śṛṇu | 
dadāmi divyabhāvaṃ cet kṣiṇuyāt pāpa saṃtatiḥ | pāragaiḥ 
śiṣyaḥ snātaḥ suveśaśca sarvadravya samanvitaḥ | 
ācāryyaṃ vṛṇuyādbhaktyā vastrālaṃkārabhūṣaṇaiḥ | 
kuryyānnāndīmukhaṃ śrāddhaṃ brāhmaṇān paritoṣayet | 
gobhūhiraṇya vastrādyaistoṣayet gurumātmanaḥ | 
yathā dadāti saṃtuṣṭaḥ prasannavadano manum | 
idānīṃ pūrvakṛtyaṃ ca prasaṃgāt kathayāmite | 
yat kṛtvādhikāritāṃ yāti maṃtrayaṃtrārccanādiṣu | 
yena vinā siddhiḥ syāt narakaṃ ca pralabhyate | 

<pṛ0 16ba> brāhme muhūrtte cotthāya ciṃtayed guru daivatam | 
svamūrddhani sahasrāre kṛṣṇākhye parivinuke | 
śaśāṃkāyutasaṃkāśaṃ varābhaya lasatkaram | 
śuklāmbaradharaṃ śrīmacchuklamālyānulepanam | 
vāmorau bahuśaktyā ca yutaṃ kṛṣṇākhyamavyayam | 
śivenaikyaṃ samunnīya dhyāyet paraguruṃ dhiyā | 
mānasairupacāraiśca saṃtarpya manasā sudhīḥ | 
stotraiḥ stutvā namaskuryyānmaṃtradeveśamarccayet | 
ajñānatimirāndhasya jñānāṃjana śalākayā | 
cakṣurunmīlitaṃ yena tasmai svaguruve namaḥ | 
akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāptaṃ yena carācaram | 
tatpadaṃ darśitaṃ yena tasmai svagurave namaḥ | 
mūlādhāre trikoṇākhye koṭisūryya samatviṣi | 
dhyāyet kuṇḍalinīṃ nityāṃ kāmabījoparisthitām | 
śyāmāṃ sūkṣmāṃ ca viśvasya sṛṣṭisthitilayātmikām | 
viśvātītāṃ jñānarūpāṃ ciṃtayedūrddhavāhinīm | 
cakra ṣaṭkaṃ vinirbhījya prāpayitvā pare śive | 
tadbheda samāpannāmanākulamanāḥ smaret | 
prāpayitvā sudhāṃ pūrvaṃ plāvayecchāktimaṇḍalam | 
tenaiva cakrabhedena mūlādhāraṃ samāpayet | 
anena dhyānayogena maṃtrāḥ sidhyaṃti nānyathā | 
vairipakṣe sthitā ye ca vṛddhā yauvana garvvitāḥ | 
ye cānyādāsaduṣṭāśca sidhyaṃtyeva na cānyathā | 
pareṇa ca svamātmānaṃ kṛṣṇākhyena vibhāvayet | 
ahaṃ kṛṣṇo na cānyo'smi brahmaivāhaṃ na śoka bhāk | 
saccidānandarūpo'haṃ nityamuktaḥ svabhāvavān | 
tvamevāhamahaṃ tvaṃ ca saccitmātra vapurbhavān | 
āvayoraṃta vā kṛṣṇa naśyatyājñāvalāttama | 

<pṛ0 17a> ahaṃ tīrṇo bhavaṃ ghauraṃ kṛtyaṃ kiṃcinna me'sti hi | 
tathāpi dehi me nātha ājñāṃ tava niṣevaṇai | 
jānāmi dharmmaṃ na ca me pravṛttirjānāmya dharmmaṃ |
na ca me nivṛtti tvayā hṛṣīkeśa hṛdi sthitena | 
yathā niyukto'smi tathā karomi evaṃ saṃprārthya manasā kuryyāt paurvāhnikīṃ kriyām dīkṣitasya vidhānena tathā ca | brahmacāriṇām vāṇaprasthā sthitānāṃ ca śaucādi dviguṇā kriyā sandhyāśināṃ viśeṣeṇa kṛtyaṃ caturguṇaṃ bhavet | 
ācanya vidhiṭhanmaṃtrī śucau deśe ca sātviśet | 
tathā prātastanīṃ sandhyāṃ kuryyād guru niṣevakaḥ | 
jale saṃpūjya tīrthāni vivāraṃ mūlamaṃtrataḥ | 
kṣiptvā bhūmau kuśāgreṇa saptadhā mūrddhiṇ secayet | 
vāme jalaṃ samādhāya maṃtreyeddakṣiṇena tu |
punarvāmena taṃ kṣiptvā mūrddhiṇ siṃcedvivārakam | 
guruṇācopadeśaina mudrayā divyasaṃjñayā | 
īḍayākṛṣya tattoyaṃ kṣālitāṃtarmalaṃ punaḥ | 
dakṣapārśva sthitā vajraśilāyāṃ prokṣayecca tat | 
astramaṃtreṇa vidhivat punarācamanaṃ bhavet | 
adyamarṣaṇametaddhi sarvapāpanikṛṃtanam | 
toyāṃjaliṃ punaḥ kṣiptvā sūryyā maṇḍala madhyagām | 
gāyattrīṃ bhāvayeddevīṃ sūryyāsanakṛtā śrayām | 
tadyadādityasaṃkāśāṃ pustakākṣakarāṃ smaret | 
kṛṣṇājīnāmbarāṃ brāhmīṃ dhyāyettārakitemvare | 
utthāya kṛṣṇa gāyattrīṃ tadabheda śataṃ japet | 
kṛṣṇāya vidyahe ityuktā dāmodarāya dhīmahi | 
tanno viṣṇuḥ pracodayādgāyatryaiyā prakīrttitā tena kṛṣṇāya vidmahe dāmodarāya 

<pṛ0 17ba> dhīmahi | tanno viṣṇuḥ pracodayāt | 
sarva devamayī sarva pāvanā varadāyinī | 
sarvavedamayīti pāṭhaḥ |
praṇavādyā muktikarī śrībījādyā ca bhogadā | 
hṛllekhādyā mahāsiddhīkarī sarvavaśaṃkarī vāgbhavādyācare pva(?)śyā kāmādyā janaraṃjanī | 
evaṃ te kathitā maṃtra sandhyā maṃtra phalāptaye | 
na kuryyādyadi mohena na dīkṣā phalamāpnuyāt | 
saṃkṣepa sandhyāmathavā kuryyānmaṃtrī hyaśaktitaḥ | 
sāyaṃ prātaśca madhyāhne kṛṣṇaṃ dhyātvā manuṃ japet | 
iti sandhyā trayaṃ proktaṃ karmmaṇāṃ siddhidāyakam | 
sandhyāyāṃ patitāyāṃ vā patitāyāṃ vā gāyattrīṃ daśadhā japet | 
yathā prāṇaṃ yathā jñānaṃ yathā kuryyādatandritaḥ | 
yadyat kṛtyaṃ maṃgalārthaṃ tattatkuryyāttathā tathā | 
ādarśa darśanaṃ kuryyādghṛtasparśaṃ ca kajjalaṃ | 
matpoṣya poṣaṇārthāya kṣemaṃ yogaṃ ca ciṃtayet | 
strāyācca kṛṣṇapūjārthaṃ nadyādau vimale jale | 
pūjā ca paṃcadhā proktā tāsāṃ bhedān śṛṇuṣva me | 
abhigamanamupādānaṃ yogaḥ svādhyāya eva ca | 
ijyā paṃcaprakārārccā krameṇa kathayāmite | 
tatrābhigamanaṃ nāma devatāsthānamārjjanam | 
upalepana nirmmālya dūrīkaraṇameva ca | 
upādānaṃ nāma gandhapuṣpādi cayanaṃ tathā | 
ijyānāma ceṣṭadeva pūjanaṃ ca yathārthataḥ | 
svādhyāyo nāma kṛṣṇākhyo hyātmānupūrvako japaḥ | 
sūktastotrādi pāṭhaśca harisaṃkīrttanaṃ tathā | 
tatvādi śāstrābhyāsaśca svādhyāyaḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 
yogo nāma svadevasya svātmanaiva vibhāvanā | 
iti paṃcaprakārārccā kathitā tava suvrata | 
sāmīpya sārūpya sādṛśya sāyujya phaladā kramāt | 

<pṛ0 18a> prātaḥkāle vā madhyāhne snānārthaṃ tīrtha māśrayet | 
snānaṃ tu dvividhaṃ proktamaṃtarvāhya vibhedataḥ | 
anaṃtādityasaṃkāśaṃ vāsudevaṃ caturbhujam | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma mukuṭaṃ vanamālinam | 
tatpādodakajāṃ dhārāṃ niyataṃtrīṃ svakāṃtanum | 
tayā saṃkṣālayet sarvamaṃtarddehagataṃ malam | 
tatkṣaṇādvirajomaṃvaraṃcāṃtastīrtha koṭiśatādhikam | 
yogināṃ srānametaddhi kathitaṃ paramādbhutam | 
vāhyasnānaṃ tathā kuryyādyathā śāstraṃ vidhānavit | 
malaprakṣālanaṃ snānaṃ svaśākhoktaṃ samācaran | 
maṃtrasnānaṃ tataḥ kuryyāt karmmaṇāṃ siddhihetave | 
astreṇālojya mutsnāṃ vai vibhāgaṃ tāṃ tu kārayet | 
jale caikaṃ dvādaśayornniḥkṣipedastramuccaran | 
ekaṃ mūrddhādi nādyaṃtaṃ paṭhan mūlaṃ vilepayet | 
śeṣaṃ pādādi nādyaṃtaṃ tathaiva pravilepayet | 
gaṃge ca yamune caiva godāvari sarasvati | 
narmmade sindhu kāveri jale'smin sannidhiṃ kuru | 
āvāhayāmi devi tvāṃ snānārthamiha sundari | 
ehi gaṃge namastubhyaṃ sarvatīrtha samanvite | 
evamāvāhya vidhivanmūlamaṃtreṇa maṃtrayet | 
āmaṃtryambhasi saṃyojya somasūryyāgnimaṇḍalam | 
viciṃtya maṃtrī tanmadhye nimajjenmūlamuccaran | 
utthāyācamya tatpaścāt ṣaḍaṃgaṃ nyāsasaṃyutam | 
ātmānaṃ daśadhā siṃcenmudrayā kalasākhyayā | 
saptakṛtvo'bhiṣiṃcedvāmanunā maṃtritairjalaiḥ | 
vāmahastakṛtā muṣṭirdakṣahastena veṣṭayet | 
kalasākhyā bhavenmudrā sarvapāpa harā śubhā | 
śālagrāmaśilā toyaṃ tulasīdala miśritam | 
kṛtvā śaṃkhe bhrāmayan trirniḥkṣipenninamūrddhani |

<pṛ0 18ba> śālagrāme śilātoyaṃmapītvā yastu mastake |
prakṣepaṇaṃ prakurute brahmahāsanigadyate | 
viṣṇupādodakān pūrvaṃ viprapādodakaṃ pivet | 
viruddhamācaran mohādātmahāsa tu gadyate | 
pṛthivyāṃ yāni tīrthāni tāni tīrthāni sāgare | 
sāgare yāni tīrthāni pade viprasya dakṣiṇe | 
susāgarāṇi tīrthāni pade viprasya dakṣiṇe | 
iti vā pāṭhaḥ |
tataḥ saṃkṣepato devān manuṣyāṃstarpayet pitṛn | 
pīḍayitvāmbaraṃ toyam prakṣālyācamyavāgyataḥ | 
dhārayedvāsasī śuddhe paridhānottarīyake |
acchinne sadṛśe śukle ācāmet pīṭha saṃsthitaḥ |
ūrddhapuṇḍaṃ candanena kṛtvā sandhyāṃ samācaret | 
pūrvaṃ tu kathitā sandhyā dhyāyeddevīṃ samahitaḥ | 
śyāmavarṇāṃ caturbāhuṃ śaṃkhacakra lasatkarām | 
gadāpadmādharāṃ devīṃ sūryyāsana kṛtāśrayāṃ | 
dhyātvā jalāṃjaliṃ kṛtvā tarpayet kṛmavyayāṃ | 
guru paṃktiṃ purātarpya tarpayediṣṭa daivatam | 
nāradaṃ parvataṃ jiṣṇuṃ niśaṭhodbhavadārukam | 
viśvakasenaṃ ca śaileyaṃ guruṃśca tarpayetviśaḥ | 
paṃcaviṃśatisaṃkhyā vā daśadhā vā vidhāpi vā || 
mūlamaṃtraṃ sammuccāryya śrīkṛṣṇaṃ tarpayāmyaham | 
namo'ntoyaṃ manuḥ proktastarpaṇe vidhitatparaiḥ | 
klīṃ śrīkṛṣṇaṃ tarpayāmi namaḥ sāyāhne | varadāṃ devīṃ gāyatrīṃ saṃsmaredyatiḥ | 
śuklāṃ śuklāmbaradharāṃ vṛṣāsanakṛtā śrayām | 
vinetrāṃ varadāṃ pāśaṃ śūlaṃ ca nṛkaroṭikām | 
sūryyamaṇḍalamadhyasthāṃ dhyāyan gāyattrīmabhyaset | 

<pṛ0 19a> lalāṭe ca gadā kāryyā mūrddhiṇ cāpaṃ śaraṃ tathā | 
nandakaṃ caiva hṛnmadhye śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ bhujadvaye | 
śaṃkhacakrāṃkito vipraḥ śmaśāne mriyate yadi | 
prayāge yā gatiḥ proktā sā gatistasya gautama | 
pūjārthaṃ jalamādāya sūryye tīrthāniyojayet | 
brahmajyotirmayaṃ viṣṇuṃ gāyattrīṃ manasā smaran | 
śatāvṛtyā japet tāṃ tu dharmmakāmārthasiddhaye | 
sarvapāpakṣayaṃ yāti jñānamutapadyate'cirāt | 
mūlamaṃtraṃ hṛdi smṛtvā pāyādvai yāgamaṇḍapam | 
hastau pādau ca prakṣālya ācamya vāgyataḥ sudhīḥ | 
sūryyapūjāṃ tataḥ kuryyādviśeṣārthena dīkṣitaḥ | 
punarhastau ca pādau ca prakṣālya vidhinā yatiḥ | 
ācamanaṃ tataḥ kuryyādviśeṣādvaiṣṇavānvaye | 
keśavādyaistribhiḥ pītvā dvābhyāṃ prakṣālayet karau | 
dvābhyāmauṣṭhe ca saṃmṛjya dvābhyāṃ mṛjyānmukhaṃ tataḥ |
ekena hastau prakṣālya pādāvapi tathaikataḥ | 
saṃprokṣyaikena mūrddhānaṃ tataḥ saṃkarṣaṇādibhiḥ | 
āsya nāsākṣikarṇāśca nābhirudarakaṃ bhujau | 
evamācamanaṃ kṛtvā sākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet | 
keśavādyāḥ purā proktā vakṣye saṃkarṣaṇādikān | 
saṃkarṣaṇo vāsudevaḥ pradyumnaścāniruddhakaḥ | 
puruṣottamādhokṣaja nṛsiṃhāśca tathācyutaḥ | 
janārddanopendra harirviṣṇavo dvādaśeritāḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīyataṃtre sarvataṃtrottamottame sattamo'dhyāyaḥ] || 7 || 

atha dvādaśa śuddhistu vaiṣṇavānāṃ ihocyate | 
gṛhopasarpaṇaṃ caiva tathānugamanaṃ hareḥ | 
bhaktyā pradakṣiṇaṃ caiva pādayoḥ śodhanaṃ punaḥ | 
pūjārthaṃ patrapuṣpāṇāṃ bhaktyaivottolanaṃ hareḥ | 

<pṛ0 19ba> karayoḥ sarvaśuddhīnāmiyaṃ śuddhirviśiṣyate | 
tatrāmakīrttanaṃ caiva guṇānāmapi kīrttanam | 
bhaktyā śrīkṛṣṇadevasya vacasaḥ śuddhiriṣyate | 
tat kathāśravaṇaṃ caiva tasyotsava nirīkṣaṇam | 
śrotrayornetrayoścaiva śuddhiḥ samyagihocyate | 
pādodakasya nirmmālya mālānāmapi dhāraṇam | 
ucyate śirasaḥ śuddhiḥ praṇāmasya hare punaḥ | 
āghrāṇaṃ gandhapuṣpādernimmālyasya ca gautama | 
viśuddhiḥ syādanaṃtasya ghrāṇasyāpi vidhīyate | 
patrapuṣpādikaṃ yacca kṛṣṇapādayugārpitam | 
tadeva pāvanaṃ loke tadvi sarvaṃ viśodhayet | 
vṛndāvanaṃ tato dhyāyet pūrvoktenaiva vartmanā | 
tanmadhye svarṇabhūmi ca dhyāyennavagṛhaṃ tataḥ |
pūrvadvāraṃ tato gatvā sāmānyārghaṃ viśodhayet | 
astreṇa śaṃkhaṃ prakṣālya kṛṣṇamaṃtreṇa pūrayet | 
maṃtrayet praṇave naiva sāmānyarthamidaṃ smṛtam | 
dvāryyāvāgnayajettatra sarvavighnopaśāṃtaye | 
nandaḥ sunandaścaṇḍaśca pracaṇḍo bala eva ca | 
prabalo bhadranāmā ca subhadro vighnavaiṣṇavāḥ | 
dvau dvau vighnau pratidvāre purato vinatā sutam | 
praṇavādi namo'ntena nāmamaṃtreṇa pūjayet | 
tato'kṣatān samādāya dakṣe nārācamudrayā | 
prakṣipedastramaṃtreṇa gṛhāṃtarvighnaśāṃtaye | 
apasarpaṃtu te bhūtā ye bhūtā bhuvi saṃsthitāḥ | 
ye bhūtā vighnakarttāraste naśyaṃtu śivājñayā | 
bhūtasaṃghān samuccāryya dakṣapāda puraḥsaram | 
dhyāyediha gṛhābhyaṃtaḥ praviśennata kandharaḥ | 
yajettatraiva brahmāṇaṃ vāstudoṣopaśāṃtaye | 
prāṃmukhaḥ saṃyatātmā ca saṃviśedvihitāsane | 

<pṛ0 20a> tathā mṛdāsane maṃtrī paṭājina kuśottare | 
kāṣṭhāsane bhavedrogo vaṃśe vaṃśa kṣayaṃ bhavet | 
śailāsane ca vāgrodhaḥ pallave mati vibhramaḥ | 
dharaṇyāṃ duḥkha saṃbhūtiḥ pīḍanaṃ rājane bhavet | 
viṣṇuḥ kālāṃtmakaścātmā tataḥ pūrvamukho bhavet | 
gandhapuṣpādi patrāṇi svadakṣe ca niveśayet | 
dīpaṃ baliṃ ca naivedyaṃ kṣundaraṃ purato nyaset | 
suvāsitāmbusaṃpūrṇaṃ vāme kumbhaṃ suśobhanam | 
pṛṣṭhadeśe pātramekaṃ karakṣālanāya saṃnyaset | 
padmāsanaṃ svastikambā ātvāryyo vidhinā viśet | 
ūrorupari vinyasya samyakpādatale ubho | 
padmāsanamidaṃ proktaṃ yogino hṛdayaṃgamam | 
jānurvoraṃtare kṛtvā samyak pādatale ubhe | 
ṛjukāyo viśeda yogī svastikaṃ tat pracakṣyate |
maṃgalāṃkura pātrāṇi caturddikṣu niveśayet | 
āśīrvāgabhirdvijātīnāṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ yāgamārabhet | 
śiṣyaśca vṛṇuyādbhaktyā ācāryyaṃ bhaktitatparaḥ | 
vāso'laṃkāravibhavairvittaśāṭhya vivarjjitaḥ | 
ṛtvijaṃ vṛṇuyāttatra daśa paṃca trayaṃ tathā | 
puṇyāhaṃ vācayitvā ca paṃcaghoṣa puraḥsaram | 
bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryyāt sarvārthatvaviśuddhaye | 
kṛtāṃjali paro bhūtvā vāme guru trayaṃ yajet | 
guruṃ ca paramādiṃ ca parāpara guruṃ tathā | 
dakṣapārśve gaṇeśaṃ ca mūrddhiṇ devaṃ vibhāvayet | 
tato maṇḍapamadhye ca sthaṇḍilaṃ gomayāmbunā | 
upaviśya yathā nyāyaṃ tasya madhye nidhāpayet | 
sūtraṃ prāk pratyagagraṃ ca viprāśīrvācanaiḥ saha | 
guṇito nābhito matsyo madhyārabhya pravinyaset | 
tanmadhyasthitayāmyodagagraṃ sūtraṃ nidhāpayet | 

<pṛ0 20ba> tato madhyānnyaseddhastamānamātraṃ diśaṃ prati |
satreṣu makarānnyasyenmatsyān vānya tamaḥ pumān | 
sūtrāgramakarebhyaśca nyaset koṇeṣu matsyakān | 
koṇamatsyā sthitāgrāṇi dikṣu sūtrāṇi pātayet | 
tato bhaveccatuṣkoṇaṃ caturasraṃ tu maṇḍalam | 
tatrāgnimārutaṃ sūtraṃ nirṛteśaṃ tu pātayet | 
prāgyāmya varuṇo dīcya sūtrāgra makareṣu ca | 
vihitāgraṃ lagnasūtraṃ catuṣkaṃ pratipādayet | 
kṛta hastaṃ bhaveyuste kāṇe koṣṭheṣu matsyakāḥ | 
eṣa prāgvaruṇo yāmyodīcyāni ca prapātayet | 
ṣaṭpaṃcāśatpadāni syuradhikāni śatadvayāt | 
yadā tadātho vibhajet padāni kramaśaḥ sudhīḥ | 
padaiḥ ṣoḍaśakairmadhye padmaṃ vṛttatrayaṃmitaṃ | 
tairaṣṭacatvāriṃśadbhīrāśiḥ syāddīpaśobhitam | 
sadvādaśaiḥ śatapadaiḥ śobhākhyāḥ syuścatuṣpadāḥ | 
catuṣpadāśca śobhāḥ syuḥ ṣaṭpadaṃ koṇakaṃ bhavet | 
vṛttavīkhyo vā racayenmadhye sūtra catuṣṭayam | 
prāgyāmya varuṇo dīcyaṃ tadbhavedrāśimaṇḍalam | 
karṇikāyāḥ keśarāṇāṃ dalasyārddha dalasya ca | 
dalāgravṛttarāśīnāṃ vīthyāḥ śobhāṃ paśobhayoḥ | 
vṛttāni caturasrāṇi vyaktaṃ sthānāni kalpayet | 
bhavenmaṇḍalamadhyāṃkaḥ kareṇa caturaṃgula' |
dvyaṃgulāḥ keśarāṇilyuḥ saṃdhyagraṃ caturaṃgulam | 
tathā dalānāṃ mānādagraṃ dvyaṃgulo na bhavet (*)| 
aṃtarāla pṛthag vṛttatraye dvyaṃgulamucyate | 
tataśca rāśicakraṃ syāt sva sva varṇa vibhūṣitam | 
vāme maṇḍalakaṃ kuryyāt ṣaḍbhiraṣṭabhireva vā |

<pṛ0 21a> dvātriṃśadaṃgulaṃ hyetat paratvāttāvadiṣyaṃte | 
vṛttaṃ cakramuśaṃtyeke caturasraṃ tu tadvidaḥ | 
yadi vā varttulaṃ caiva vā syurdvādaśarāśayaḥ | 
te syuḥ pipīlikā madhyā mātuluṃgu nibhā api | 
cakraṃ ca caturasraṃ cettrayadvādaśarāśayaḥ | 
bhaveyuḥ paṃkajadalanibhā vā kathitā budhaiḥ | 
tadvahī rucirān kuryyāccaturaḥ kalpaśākhinaḥ | 
jalajaiḥ sthalajaiśca pisumanobhiḥ samanvitām | 
haṃsa sārasakāraṇḍa śuka bhramara kokilaiḥ | 
mayūra cakra vākādyairāruḍha viṭapātatān | 
sarveṣu nivṛttikarān vilocana manoharān | 
tadbahiḥ pārthivaṃ kuryyānmaṇḍalaṃ kṛṣṇakoṇakam | 
maṇḍalāni ca tattvajño rāśyastānyeva kārayet | 
nāmāvalyatra racayet pramāṇādanya maṇḍalam | 
āvāhya devatā yasyāmarccayaṃstvanya devatāḥ | 
ubhābhyāṃ labhate śāyaṃ maṃtrītaraladurmmutiḥ | 
kālātmakasya devasya rāśi vyāptimajānatā | 
kṛtaṃ samastaṃ nyarthaṃ syādājñāvajñānamāninā | 
tasmāt sarvaṃ prayatnena rāśīn sādhipatīn kramāt | 
avagamyānurūpāṇḍi maṇḍalāni na cānyadhīḥ | 
upakramedarccayituṃ hotuṃ vā sarva devatām | 
rajāṃsi paṃcavarṇāṇi paṃcadravyātmikāni ca | 
pīta śuklāruṇa śyāmakṛṣṇānyetāni bhūtale | 
hāridraṃ syāttathā pītaṃ tāṇḍūlaṃ ca sitaṃ bhavet | 
tathā doṣāya vakṣāra saṃyuktaṃ raktamucyate | 
kṛṣṇaṃ dagdhapulākoṣṭyaṃ śyāmaṃ viladalādikam | 
sitena rajasā kāryyā sīmārekhā vipaścitā | 
aṃgulot sedha vistā praśastā sarvakarmmasu | 

<pṛ0 21ba> pītā syāt karṇikā śukla pītaraktāśca keśarāḥ | 
dalānyabjasyāṃtarālaṃ śyāmacūrṇena pūrayet | 
sitariktāsitairvarṇairvṛttatrayamudīritam | 
nānāvarṇavicitrāḥ syuścitrākārāśca vīthayaḥ | 
dvāraśobhopaśobhāḥ syuḥ śvetaraktā haridrakāḥ | 
rāśicakrāvaśiṣṭāni koṇānyadvikṣuyāni vai | 
pīṭhapādāni tāni syurasitānyaruṇāni vā | 
atha vāruṇāni ca dalāni tathā dalasaṃdhirasitavat | 
asitā varuṇāśca rajasā vihitānyapi kathayaṃtyapare || 

[iti śrīgautamīye mahātaṃtre sarvataṃtrottamottame aṣṭamo'dhyāyaḥ] || 8 || 

paṃcagavyena tadgehaṃ maṇḍalaṃ ca viśodhayet | 
palamātraṃ dugdhabhāgaṃ gomūtraṃ tāvadiṣyate | 
ghṛtaṃ capalamātraṃ syādgomayaṃ tolaka dvayam | 
dadhi prasṛtimātraṃ syāt paṃcagavyamidaṃ smṛtam | 
athavā paṃcagavyānāṃ samāno bhāga iṣyate | 
mūlamaṃtreṇa saṃmaṃtrya kuśāgreṇaiva śodhayet | 
tena sarva viśuddhiḥ syāt sarvapāpanikṛṃtanam | 
mahāṃti pātakānyeva kṛtvā gavyaṃ pivedyadi | 
nāśayet pānamātreṇa ityūcurvedavedinaḥ | 
bhūtaśuddhiṃ tataḥ kuryyād yena pūrṇaphalaṃ labhet | 
oṃ namaḥ sudarśanāye tyuktāsteṇaiva deśikaḥ | 
tālatrayaṃ samvidadhyādūrddhorddhaṃ ca samāhitaḥ | 
digbandhanaṃ choṭikābhirddaśabhiḥ kārayet sudhīḥ | 
tatastenaiva janitaṃ tejo rakṣatviti smaret | 
vinidhāya karau svāṃke uttānau pariciṃtayet | 
hūṃkāreṇa samutthāpya śaktiṃ svādhāra saṃsthitām | 
mūlādhāramatha svādhiṣṭhānaṃ ca maṇipūrakam | 

<pṛ0 22a> anāhata viśuddhaṃ ca ājñācakraṃ ca ciṃtayet | 
gude ca dhvajamūle ca nābhau hṛdaya eva ca | 
kaṃṭhe tathā bhruvormmadhye yathākrama manuṃ smaret | 
ciṃtayet punarādhāraṃ kanakābjaṃ caturddalam | 
tanmadhye ciṃtayed yoniṃ caṃndrārkāgni samadyutim | 
tadaṃtaścintayenmaṃtrī jīvātmānaṃ samāhitaḥ | 
javā baṃdhūka sadṛśaṃ taḍaitkoṭipratīkāśaṃ candrakoṭi suśītalam | 
pradīpakalikākāraṃ kuṇḍalinyāsanaṃ tathā | 
suṣumnāvartmanā soha'miti maṃtreṇa yojayet | 
sahasrāraṃ śivasthāne paramātmani deśikaḥ | 
tathaiva paṃcubhūtāni saṃhārakramaḥ tastathā | 
vākpādpāṇipāyūpastha vacanādānameva ce | 
gatirvisargānandaśrotratvakcakṣūrasanāḥ punaḥ | 
nāsāśabdastathā sparśo rūpaṃ raso'pi gandhakaḥ | 
tattvānyetāni paṃcaviṃśat puruṣeṇa ca yojayet | 
ahaṃkāraṃ manobuddhiṃ cittaṃ tatraiva yojayet | 
jīvabhāvena līnāni sarvāṇi pariciṃtayet | 
dhūrmavarṇaṃ(dhūmravarṇaṃ) tato vāyu bījaṃ ṣaṭbiṃndu lāṃchitam | 
pūrayedīḍayā vāyu sudhīḥ ṣoḍaśamātrayā | 
mātrayā ca catuḥṣaṣṭyā kumbhayettu suṣumnayā | 
dvātriṃśanmātrayā maṃtrī recayet piṃgalādhvanā | 
pūrayedanayā caiva saṃciṃtya nīla mārutam | 
raktavarṇaṃ vahnibījaṃ trikoṇaṃ svastikānvitam | 
tena pūrakayogena mātrayā ṣoḍaśākhyayā | 
catuḥṣaṣṭyā mātrayā ca nirddahet kumbhakena ca | 
vāmapārśva sthitaṃ pāpa puruṣaṃ kajvalaprabham | 
brahmahatyā śiraskaṃ ca svarṇasteya (ya) bhujadvayam | 

<pṛ0 22ba> surāpāna hṛdāyuktaṃ gurutalpa kaṭidvayam | 
tat saṃsargi padadvandvamaṃgapratyaṃga pātakaṃ | 
upapātaka romāṇaṃ raktaśmaśru vilocanam | 
khaḍgacarmmadharaṃ kruraṃ kruddhāḥ kukṣau vicintayet | 
mūlādhārotthite naiva vahninā nirddaheccatam | 
evaṃ saṃdahya parito dvātriṃśanmātrayā tataḥ | 
bhasmānā sahitaṃ maṃtrī recayet piṃgalādhvanā | 
vāmanāḍyāṃ candrabījaṃ kundendvayuta saprabham | 
bhālendubījaṃ saṃyojya tataḥ ṣoḍaśamātrayā | 
suṣutrayā(suṣumnayā) catuḥṣaṣṭi mātrayā bījamaindavam | 
dhyātvā mṛtamayīṃ vṛṣṭiṃ paṃcāśadvarṇarūpiṇīm | 
tayā dehaṃ viciṃtyaivaṃ manasāpi kulādhvanā | 
dvātriṃśanmātrayā maṃtrī laṃ bījena dṛḍhaṃ nayet | 
svasthāne haṃsamaṃtreṇa punastenaiva vartmanā | 
jīvaṃ tattvāni cānīya svasthāne sthāpayettataḥ | 
iti kṛtvā bhūtaśuddhiṃ mātṛkānyāsamācaret | 

gautama uvāca 
bhūtaśuddhyā vada brahman kasya śuddhiḥ prajāyate | 
nātmanaḥ sarvaśuddhīnāṃ kāraṇaṃ sa tu kathyate | 
na jīvasya brahmaṇā ca sahaikyaṃ tasya nityaśaḥ | 
na dehasya tadārabhya nityatā tasya kathyate | 
manasāṃ vāpi buddheśca kasya syāt kuru vīkṣaṇam | 
ityādi saṃśayaṃ chindhi tvaṃ hi brahma samaḥ smṛtaḥ | 

nārada uvāca 
śarīrākāra bhūtānāṃ bhūtānāṃ yadviśodhanam | 
avyaya brahmasaṃyogād bhūtaśuddhiriyaṃ matā | 
aṃtaḥkaraṇa madhye tu jyotirātmā pravarttate | 
liṃgadehaṃ tu taṃ prāhuryoginastattvavedinaḥ | 
tasya śodhanamātreṇa sarvaśuddhiḥ prajāyate | 
tadeva viśvajanakakāraṇaṃ janmakāraṇam | 
tadviyoge bhavenmṛtyurnānyathā janma koṭibhiḥ | 

<pṛ0 23a> ityet kathitaṃ sarvaṃ purupārthasya nigame | 
yogādyabhyāsayogena maṃtrābhyāsena nāśayet | 
bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāyehyaṃ yogyastu deśikottamaḥ | 
nyāsaṃ dehasya sannāhaṃ videdhītānupūrvakam | 
bhūtaśuddhirmātṛkācakreśa vādyā tathā ca sā | 
tattvanyāsaṃ tathā kuryyāt prāṇāyāmastataḥ param | 
na jīvasya brahmaṇā ca sahyaikaṃ tasya nityaśaḥ | 
na dehasya tadārabhya nityatā tasya kathyate | 
manaso vāpi buddheśca kasya syāt kuruvīkṣaṇam | 
ityādi saṃśayaṃ chindhi tvaṃ hi brahma samaḥ smṛtaḥ | 

nārada uvāca | 
varṇanyāsaṃ tathā kṛtvā daśatattuṃ tathācaret | 
viṣṇupaṃjaranāmānamityuktaḥ kramasaṃgrahaḥ | 
tathārghyasthāpanaṃ kuryyād yathāvadanupūrvaśaḥ | 
svavāmāgre caturasraṃ maṃḍalaṃ pariciṃtayet | 
puṣpairabhyarcyataṃ maṃtrī tavādhāraṃ pratiṣṭhayet | 
maṃ vahnimaṃḍalāya namo maṃtro'yaṃ tasya ceṣṭyate | 
vṛttākāreṇa tatraiva vahnerddaśakalā yajet | 
vṛttākāreṇa tatraiva kalādvādaśa pūjayet | 
kaṃ bhaṃ tāpinyai ityuktā khaṃ vaṃ tāpinikā tathā | 
gaṃ phaṃ uccāryya dhāriṇyai dhūmrāṃ ca paripūjayet | 
dyaṃ paṃ marīcimabhyarccya ṅaṃ neṃ jvalinikāṃ tathā | 
caṃ dhaṃ ruciṃ chaṃ daṃ caiva suṣumnāṃ pūjayed guruḥ | 
jaṃ thaṃ ca bhogadāṃ maṃtrī pūjayet kusumākṣataiḥ | 
jhaṃ taṃ viśvāmabhyarccya aṃ ṇaṃ ca bodhinīṃ nyaset | 
ṭhaṃ ṭaṃ ca dhāriṇīṃ tadvat ṭhaṃ ḍaṃ kṣamāṃ ca pūjayet | 
namo'nnenaiva maṃtreṇa caturthī pratyayānvitā | 
evaṃ śaṃ khaṃ samabhyarccya kalāsaurerdhanapadāḥ | 
viloma mātṛkāṃ naptvā sveṣṭa maṃtraṃ tathā sudhīḥ | 
pāthasā tīrthaṃ tenaiva pūrayedvimalena ca | 

<pṛ0 23ba> uṃkāreṇaiva maṃtreṇa candraṃ tatra prapūjayet | 
amṛtā mānadā pūṣātpuṣṭiḥ puṣṭīratirdhṛtiḥ | 
śaśinī candrikā kāṃtirjyotsnā śrīḥ prīti vṛddhidā | 
pūrṇāpūrṇāmṛtā ceti ṣoḍaśalāmadoḥ | 
ṣoḍaśakharayīmena namo'ntena prapūjayet | 
tatrākṣatāni puṇyāṇi sa dūrvāṇi vinikṣipet | 
vāmenāchādya hastena ṣaḍaṃgaṃ dakṣahastataḥ | 
daśakṛto japenmūlaṃ gālinīṃ śikhayā nyaset | 
karau prasāryya cānyo'nyaṃ saṃpuṭa kramayogataḥ | 
prayojya dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭaṃ tathā vāmakaniṣṭayā | 
vāmayā dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭaṃ mudreyaṃ gālinī matā | 
arghasya phaladā proktā śaṃkhasyoparicālitā | 
gaṃdhādibhiḥ samabhyarccya kṛṣṇākhyaṃ dhāmayojapet | 
astrādibhiḥ susaṃrakṣya dhenuṃ yogī pradarśayet | 
taddakṣiṇe tu śaṃkhaṃ vā tāmraṃ vā pārthivaṃ tathā | 
pātramekaṃ nidhāyātha tathā toyena pūrayet | 
tābhra(mra>pātraṃ ca viprarṣe viṣṇo ratipriyaṃ matam | 
tathaiva sarvapāvāṇāṃ mukhyaṃ śaṃkhaṃ prakīrttitam | 
mṛtpātraṃ ca tathā proktaṃ svarṇaṃ vā rājataṃ tathā | 
paṃcapātraṃ hareḥ śuddhaṃ nānyattatra niyojayet | 
tenāmṛtena sarvatra dratyaṃ maṃtramayaṃ bhavet | 
tato dharmmādibhirmmaṃtrī gātre pīṭhāni vinyaset | 
gaṃdhākṣataiḥ kusumukaiḥ pavitrairjvalayojitaiḥ | 
iti pīṭhaṃ samabhyarccya dhyāyenmaṃtrātmadevatām | 
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ viṣataṃtusvarūpiṇīm | 
kuṇḍarlāṃ trividhāṃ tatra tathā bījākṣaraṃ tridhā | 
turīyāṃ kuṇḍalīṃ mūrddhiṇ vāsudevaṃ turīyakam | 
oṃkāraṃ mūladeśe ca dravat svarṇanibhaṃ smaret | 

<pṛ0 24a> mūlādi hṛdayaṃ yāvat vahni kuṇḍalinīṃ tathā | 
hṛdaye kāmabījaṃ ca sūryyāyuta samaprabham | 
sūryyakuṇḍalinīṃ tatra sūryyakoṭi samaprabhām | 
hṛdayā kulaparyyaṃtaṃ dhyāyedanākulaḥ sudhīḥ | 
bhrumadhyādbrahmarandhrāṃtaṃ māyāmindvayuta prabhām | 
candrakuṇḍalinīṃ tadvat svavedamṛtavigrahām | 
bindunādamayaṃ vāsudevaṃ bindau turīyakam | 
deśakālāthavacchinna sarvatejomayaṃ smaret | 
turyya kuṇḍalinīṃ tadvat kevalaṃ jñānavigrahām | 
evaṃ dhyātvā punarbījaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ manasā smaret | 
cidānandamayaṃ svacchaṃ ekā caikatayā guruḥ | 
sudhāvṛṣṭyanipataṃtyā tarpayet paradaivatam | 
dhyātvā dhyātvā punardhyātvā sahajānandavigrahaḥ | 
vinusnuta sudhābhistu tarpayecca punaḥ punaḥ | 
aṃtaryāga iti prokto jīvato muktidāyakaḥ | 
munīnāṃ ca mumukṣūṇāmadhikāro'tra kevalam | 
athavā mānasairdravyaiḥ prakaṭenāpi pūjayet | 
dhyātvā hṛtpadmamadhye tu vāsudevaṃ yathoditam | 
svāgatādyairupacaret pādyādyaiḥ snānabhūṣaṇaiḥ | 
gaṃdhapuṣpadhūpadīpairnaivedyavidhinā vinā |
puṣpāṃjalīn tato dadyāt bahumālāṃ nivedayet | 
athavā ghṛtasaṃbhūtaiḥ prakadvai(ṭai)rarccayet prabhum | 
svāgatādyairnivedyāṃtairātmabhedena pūjayet | 
candanāguru niṣpanda carcitāṃgaḥ svayaṃ guruḥ | 
viṣṇapaṃjaramaṃtreṇa tañatsthāne vidhānavit | 
racayettilakaṃ bhaktyā pradīpakalikā nibham | 
puṣpāṃjaliṃ paṃca kṛto vidhivattanuyād guruḥ | 
tulasī yugalaṃ vāmapāde dakṣiṇake tathā |

<pṛ0 24ba> hayāriyugalaṃ pārśvadvaye gandhādvayānvitaṃ |
padmayugmaṃ mūrddhiṇ deśe mūlena dakṣavāmake | 
ṣaḍbhiḥ sarvatanau nyaset punaḥ sarvaiśca sarvataḥ | 
evaṃ puṣpāṃjali prokto harisānnidhyakārakaḥ | 
śrīkhaṇḍaṃ dakṣiṇe dadyāt sitapuṣpeṇa saṃyutam | 
vāme ca candanaṃ dadyāttathā raktena saṃyutam | 
sarva puṣpāṃjalau dadyāt sarvagandha samanvitaḥ | 
dakṣiṇaṃ vāsudevākhyaṃ svacchacaitanyamavyayam | 
vāme ca rukmiṇī nityā raktā rajoguṇānvitā | 
tena sattvarajorūpaṃ ātmānaṃ ciṃtayedguraḥ | 
mūlamaṃtraṃ japan buddhyā suṣumnā mūladeśake | 
maṃtrārthaṃ tasya caitanyaṃ bījaṃ dhyātvā punaḥ punaḥ | 
udayādi layāṃtaṃ ca maṃtrameva samabhyaset | 
udayaḥ śabdarūpaśca lapaścātmā prakīrtitaḥ | 
jñānājñāna vibhāgena tanmayo bhava gautama | 
manaḥ saharasaṃ śaucaṃ naumaṃ maṃtrārthaciṃtanam | 
athagratvamanirvaṃdo japa sampati hetamaḥ | 
evaṃ te kathitaṃ samyak trividhaṃ yajanakramam | 
yān kṛtvā sampadāyena maṃtrī vāṃchitamaśnute || 
atha maṇḍala madhye tu pūjanaṃ bāhya gocaram | 
ārabhet prakaṭairdravyairnānārasasuvistaraiḥ | 
pādyārghyācamanīyāni pātrāṇi ca svadakṣiṇe | 
saṃsthāpya tattaddravyaiśca pūritāni ca deśikaḥ | 
arghyāsya trīṇi pātrāṇi pādyasyāpi trayaṃ bhavet | 
tathā cācamanīyyani pātrāṇi ca vibhāgaśaḥ | 
tathākaraṇa daurbalyādekamekaṃ praśasyate | 
pūrayedvidhinā maṃtrī maṇḍalaṃ śubha taṃḍulaiḥ | 
śuddhairevākṣakaiḥ samyag yāvat paṃkajamaṃḍalam | 

<pṛ0 25a> kuśān vistāryya tatraiva paṃkajaṃ viṣṭarānvitaṃ | 
puṣpāṇi ca vikīryyātha kumbhasthāpanamācaret | 
haimaṃ rūpyaṃ tāmramayaṃ mārttikaṃ vā svaśaktitaḥ | 
vittaśāṭhyaṃ na kurvīta kute'niṣṭamavāpnuyāt | 
dvātriṃśadaṃgulaṃ kumbhaṃ vistāronnatiśālinaṃ | 
poḍaśa dvādaśāṃgulamato nyūnaṃ na kārayet | 
puṇyastrīnirmmitaiḥ sūtrairvidhivanviguṇīkṛtaiḥ | 
tena saṃveṣṭya paritaḥ yathānakṣarate kvacit | 
bhagne mṛtyuḥ sādhakasya kṣaraṇe cāpadāṃ padaṃ | 
tasmāddoṣāpi vijñāya kuryyāt sarvamatandritaḥ | 
prakṣālyāṃtaramaṃtreṇa gaṃdhaiḥ parimalānvitaṃ | 
vedavidbhirdvijaiḥ sārddhaṃ sthāpayetāramuccaran | 
samīvṛkṣa tvacāṃtoyairathavāpyaikṣavauṣadhīḥ | 
viṣṇu gandhāṣṭakairvātha tīrthodairvātha pūrayet | 
candanāguruhnīveraṃ kuṣṭha kuṃkuma rocanāḥ | 
jaḍhāmāṃsī murāmāṃsī viṣṇorgandhāṣṭakaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
gandhyāṣṭakamidaṃ hṛdyaṃ viṣṇoḥ sānnidhyakārakaṃ | 
vahnirūpamathādhāraṃ kalābhiḥ saha pūjayet | 
tathā sūryyamayaṃ kumbhaṃ tat kalābhiḥ prapūjayet | 
jalaṃ somamayaṃ tadvat tata kalābhiḥ samarccayet | 
tejastrayamidaṃ proktaṃ jalaṃ tadātmakaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
viloma mātṛkāvarṇaiḥ sarvatra pūraṇaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
tathā mūlaṃ samuccāryya pūrayedvigatāmayaḥ | 
tīrthamaṃtreṇa tīrthāni yojayet sūryyamaṇḍalāt | 
vṛhat śaṃkhaṃ tathā sthāpya svapuro bhāgamagrataḥ | 
tatrādhāraṃ pratiṣṭhāpya pūjayedvahnimaṇḍalaṃ | 
tataḥ śaṃkhaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya sūryyātmakamathārccayet | 
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva kalāḥ sarvatra pūja (*) |

<pṛ0 25ba> viloma mātṛkāṃ japtvā tathā maṃtraṃ prapūrayet | 
kvāthodakairvvā dugdhairvā pūrvoktairvā prapūrayet | 
tejastrayakalā'bhyarccya prāṇasthāpana pūrvakaṃ | 
āvāhanādikaṃ kṛtvā kalā ekaikaśaḥ kramāt | 
saṃpūjya vidhivadvidvān devasānnidhyahetave | 
praṇavāṃśodbhavaḥ samyak kalāstatra prapūjayet | 
sthāpanāṃte tu saṃyojya gandhapuṣpādibhiryajet | 
ekaikamṛkpaṭhaṃstatra tatra tatra japaṃ kṣipet | 
pāthastejomāyaṃ tatrā yojayed guru sattamaḥ |
prathamaṃ prakṛte haṃsaḥ pratadviṣṇuranaṃtaraṃ | 
tryambakaṃ ca tṛtīye syāttadviprāsāṃ catuṣṭayaṃ | 
viṣṇuryoniṃ kalpayettu paṃcamaṃ parikīrttitaṃ | 
ṛk paṃcakamidaṃ proktaṃ praṇavārṇasvarūpakaṃ | 
tārasya paṃcabhedene paṃcāśadvarṇagāḥ kalāḥ | 
sṛṣṭirṛddhiḥ smṛtirmmedhā kāṃtirlakṣmīryyutiḥ sthirā | 
sthiti siddhiriti proktāḥ kacavargagatāḥ kramāt | 
akārādbrahmaṇotpannā taptacāmī karaprabhāḥ | 
etā karadhatākṣasrak paṃkajadvaya kuṇḍikā | 
jarā capolinī śāṃtirīśvarī rati kāmike | 
varadāhlādinī prītirdīghāḥ syuśca tavargagāḥ | 
ukārādviṣṇunītpannāstamāladalasannibhāḥ | 
abhīti davacakreṣṭa vāhavaḥ parikīrtitāḥ | 
tīkṣṇārauprī bhayāni śataṃ prīkṣuptāṃ dhanī kriyā | 
utakārī mṛtyuretaḥ syuḥ kathitāḥ payavargakāḥ | 
vajreṇanārṇādutpannāḥ śaraccandranibhā prabhāḥ | 
udvahaṃtyabhayaṃ śūlaṃ kapālaṃ bāhubhirvaraṃ | 
īśvareṇoditāvinyo pītaśvetāruṇāsitāḥ | 

<pṛ0 26a> aṃtā ca yakavargasthā javākusumasannibhāḥ | 
abhayaṃ hariṇaṃ ṭaṃkaṃ dadhānā bāhubhirvaraṃ | 
nivṛttiḥ saṃpratiṣṭā syādvidyā śāṃtiranaṃtaraṃ | 
ikṣikā dīpikā caidarocikā mocikā parā | 
sūkṣmāsūkṣmāmṛtā jñānāmṛtā cāpyāyanī tathā | 
vyāpina vyomarūpāḥ syuraṃtarā svaraśaktayaḥ | 
sadāśivena saṃjātā nādādetāḥ situṣṭhiṣaḥ | 
akṣasrak pustaka guṇa kapālavara tarjjanī | 
tatrat kalāḥ samāvāhya kṛtvā prāṇasya saṃyamaṃ | 
saṃpūjyā gaṃdhapuṣpādyaistasyāṃte jalamarpayet | 
kumbhe tejastrayakalā aṣṭaviṃśajjapan tataḥ | 
japeta kalāśca paṃcāśat praṇavāṃśca samudbhavāḥ | 
punaśca paṃca ṛk japyā mūlamaṃtraṃ japetataḥ | 
caturnavati maṃtro'yaṃ devasānnidhyakārakaḥ | 
navaratnaṃ tadvadeva niḥkṣipenmātṛkāṃ japan | 
navaraṃdhramayaṃ cāpyān navaratnaṃ tadātmakaṃ | 
vajramauktika puṣpākhya vidrumaṃ padmarāgakaṃ | 
nīlā makarataṃ caiva māṇikyaṃ svarṇa eva ca | 
navaratnamiti proktaṃ sarvadevāśramaṃ mahat | 
sthāpayettanmukhe maṃtrī capakaṃ phalasaṃyutaṃ | 
viṣṭaraṃ tanmukhe dattvā datvā ca paṃcapallavaṃ | 
śuddhena kṣaumayugmena nirnmalenāṃśukena vā | 
veṣṭayedvidhinā maṃtrī sarvāścaryyaṃ yathā bhavet | 
bahumālāṃ tato dadyāt gaṃdhaṃ ca sumanoharaṃ | 
harimāvāhayettatra chāyāyāṃ kalpaśākhinaḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīyamahāmaṃtre navamo'dhyāyaḥ] || 9 ||

atha puṣpāṃjali karaḥ samāyata nabhasthalaḥ | 
hṛtpadmasaṃsthitaṃ tejaḥ kuṃḍalyā sahamelayet | 
cidānandaghanaṃ śuddhaṃ sarvatejomayaṃ smaran | 

<pṛ0 26ba> ṣaṭcakrabhedane naiva unmanyā saha yojayet | 
jīvānandamayaṃ tattu prāptanaiśvaryyamadbhutaṃ | 
ārādhya mānasairdravyairvvahannāsāpuṭaṃ kramāt | 
karastha mātṛkāmbhoje caitanyaṃ yojayecca tat | 
kumbhamadhye maṃtramurttā vāvāhya paripūjayet | 
kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa mahāyogin sarve sattva hṛdi sthite | 
sarvaṃtra sarvaga brahman kṛpayā sannidhī bhava | 
maṃtreṇānena saṃsthāpya tattanmudrā pradarśayet | 
ūrddhāṃjalimadhaḥ kuryyādiyamāvāhanī bhavet | 
seyaṃ tu viparītāsyānmudrāsthāpanakarmmaṇi | 
vāhyāṃguṣṭadvayaṃ muṣṭīnuśasyāt sannidhāpanī |
aṃguṣṭagarbbhiṇī saiva mudrā syāt sannirodhanī | 
anyo'nyatarjvanīyāmabhramaṇādavaguṃṭhanī | 
āvāhya paṃcamuśabhiḥ prāṇasthāpanamācaret | 
pāśāṃkuśa puṭā śaktistato'haṃsa manuṃ vadet | 
kṛṣṇasya prāṇā iha prāṇāḥ kṛṣṇasya jīva iha sthitaḥ | 
teṣṭya sarvendriyāṇi ca vāṃmanaścakṣurityatha | 
ihāgatya sukhaṃ ciraṃ tiṣṭhaṃtu svāhayāyutaṃ | 
ayaṃ prāṇa manuḥ proktaḥ sarvajīva pradāyakaḥ | 
anena tu vihitāyermmanavonirjīvitā matāḥ | 
rahasyaṃ casya gurutastaṃtrato jñānavaibhave | 
kiṃ na sidhyati viprarṣe deśikasya na cānyathā | 
mātṛkāṃ keśavākhyāṃ ca tatvaṃ saṃnyasya yena vai | 
karāṃga daśa tattvāni nyāsanāt sannidhirbhavet | 
sarvātmā sarvago devo maṇḍalādhāradhiṣṭitaḥ | 
śālagrāmemaṇau yaṃtre maṇḍale pratimāsu ca | 
nityaṃ pūjā hareḥ kāryyā na tu kevala bhūtale | 

<pṛ0 27a> gaṇḍakyāścaika deśe ca śālagrāmasthalaṃ mahat | 
pāṣāṇaṃ tadbhavaṃ yattat śālagrāmamiti smṛtaṃ | 
śālagrāmaśilāsparśāt koṭijanmā ca nāśanaṃ | 
kiṃ punaryajanaṃ tatra hareḥ sānnidhyakārakāṃ | 
śālagrāmaika yajanācchata liṃga phalaṃ labhet | 
bahubhirjjanmabhiḥ puṇyairyadi kṛṣṇaśilāṃ labhet | 
gīṣpadena ca cihnena tena samāpyate januḥ | 
kāmakrodhādidoṣosya sarvaduḥkha nipaṃvaṇāt | 
evaṃ mityāhure tasmin devaḥ prīṇāti pūjitaḥ | 
padmamaṣṭapalāṃśaṃ ca caturasraṃ sulakṣaṇaṃ | 
caturdvārasamāyuktaṃ kāmagarvita karṇikaṃ | 
sāmānyayaṃtramuddiṣṭamaṣṭādaśākṣaraṃ śraṇu |
caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ padmamaṣṭadalānvitaṃ |
ṣaṭkoṇamadhye kāmākhyaṃ saptadaśārṇaveṣṭitaṃ | 
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ manuvaraṃ ṣaṭkoṇe vilikhettataḥ | 
etadyaṃtraṃ mahābhāga kṛpayā kathitaṃ tava | 
asya vijñānamātreṇa kṛṣṇātmā sādhako bhavet | 
akhaṇḍamaṇḍalākāraṃ vyāpta viśyaṃ vijṛmbhate | 
sarvadevamayaṃ yena tena maṇḍalamucyate | 
pratimā kṛṣṇadevasya yatnataḥ kārayet sudhīḥ | 
śilpinā kṛṣṇā bhaktena viśvakarmmo krajānato | 
daśapaṃcāṃgulā mukhyā madhyamā dvādaśāṃgulā | 
aṣṭāṃgulādhamāsā tu nyunādhikyaṃ na kārayet | 
ajñānenāpi mohena yadi kuryyānnarādhamaḥ | 
pratiṣṭā viphalā tasya pūjanātna phalaṃ bhavet | 
mānāṃgula vihīnā sā pratimā yatra tiṣṭhati | 
rājānaṃ pīḍayatyeva gṛhastho narakaṃ vrajet | 
mānāṃgulena sā kāryyā nānyathāmunisattama | 

<pṛ0 27ba> kāśmarī jñānadā proktā svarṇajāpi ca muktidā | 
sampatti dātu śilajā rājatī bahumuktidā | 
tejojādārujāyācaraiktikī śatrunāśinī | 
tāmrī dharmmavivṛddhiṃ ca karoti bahusaukhyadā | 
mṛdeva mṛṇmayī proktāṃ pratimā śubhalakṣaṇā | 
bhogadā mokṣadā sānu pratimā kathitā tava |
laṃpyā sekhyā dvidhā sāpi pratimā parikīrttitā | 
parvatāgre nadītīre catvare goṣṭabhūmiṣu | 
samudrakule'nyo vā mānahīnānna dūṣaṇaṃ | 
kṛṣṇa pratikṛtiṃ kuryyādivyāṃ paṃśasvacihnatāṃ | 
tāṃ tu saṃsthāpayenmaṃtrī gṛhe vā goṣṭamadhyataḥ | 
samāhitastato maṃtrī pūjayedupacārakaiḥ | 
ṣoḍaśopacāramaṃtreṇa yamanākhyena siddhaye | 
yasya darśanamicchaṃti devā brahmaharādayaḥ | 
kṛpayā devadeveśamadagre sannidhī bhava | 
uccate parameśāna svāgataṃ svargataṃ bhavet | 
kṛtārtho'nugṛhīto'smi saphalaṃ jīvitaṃ tu ne | 
yadāgato'si deveśa cidānanda mayāvyaya | 
ājñānā dvā pramādādvānaikaḥ syāt sādhakasya ca | 
yadapūrṇaṃ bhavet kṛtyaṃ tathāpyabhimukho bhava | 
pādyaṃ śyāmāka dūrvārka viṣṇukrāṃtābhiriṣyate | 
yadbhaktirlesa samparkāt paramānanda saṃplavaḥ | 
tasya te parameśāna pādyaṃ śuddhāya kalpate | 
jātīlavaṃgakakkolairdadyādācamanīyakaṃ | 
svadhā maṃtreṇa matimām smṛtvā vai dakṣiṇakaraṃ | 
vedānāmapi vedāya devānāṃ devatātmane | 
atvāmaṃ kalpaṣāmīśa śuddhānāṃ śuddhihetave | 
gandhapuṣpākṣatayavakuśāgratilasarṣapān |
durvābhirddeva śirasi śiromasreṇa cārpayet | 

<pṛ0 28a> etadarghyamidaṃ proktaṃ tuṣṭaye śārṅga dhanvanaḥ | 
tāpatraya haraṃ divyaṃ paramānandalakṣaṇaṃ | 
tāpatraya vimokṣāya tavārghyaṃ kalpayāmyahaṃ | 
ghṛtadadhimadhubhiśca madhuparkaṃ svadhānvunā | 
sarvakalmaṣahīnāya paripūrṇaṃ svadhātmakaṃ | 
madhuparkamimaṃ deva kalpayāmi prasīda me | 
mukhe ca tvamanaṃ dadyāt kevalena jalena ca | 
ucchiṣṭo'pyaśucirvāpi yasya smaraṇa mātrataḥ | 
śuddhimāpnoti tasmai te punarācamanīyakaṃ | 
candra candana kāśmīra jalaiḥ snānaṃ vidhīyate | 
paramānandabodhābdhi nimagna nijamūrttaye | 
sāṃgoyāṃgamidaṃ snānaṃ kalpayāmyahamīśāte | 
pītāmbarayugaṃ dadyād yathāśakyā pariṣkṛtaṃ | 
māyācitrapaṭāchatra nijaguhyokā tejase | 
nirāvaraṇa vijñāna vāsaste kalpayāmyahaṃ | 
uttarīyaṃ tatodyādvāso'rddhaṃ niyamānvitaṃ | 
yamāśritya mahāmāyā jagat sanmohanī sadā | 
tasmaite parameśāya kalpayāmurattarīyakaṃ | 
yajñasūtraṃ tato dadyādathavā svarṇanirmmitaṃ | 
yasya śakti trayeṇedaṃ saṃprotamakhinaṃ jagat | 
yajñasūtrāya tasmaite yajñasūtraṃ prakalpayet | 
hārādyā bharaṇaṃ dadyāt suvarṇāśma samanvitaṃ | 
svabhāva sundarāṃgāya satyā satyāśrayāyate | 
bhūṣaṇāni vicitrāṇi kalpayāmyamarārccita | 
arghyokṣitajalaṃ dadyādupacārāṃtarāṃtare | 
samasta devadeveśa sarvadṛṣṭikaraṃ paraṃ | 
akhaṇḍānanda saṃpūrṇa gṛhāṇajalamuttamaṃ | 
candanāgurukarpūramiśro gandha ihocyate | 
sarvāṃgaṃ lepayettena tāpatraya praśāṃtaye | 
paramānanda saurabhya paripūrṇa digaṃtaraṃ | 

<pṛ0 28ba> gṛhāṇa paramaṃ gandhaṃ kṛpayā parameśvaraṃ | 
paṃcapuṣpāṃjalīn dadyāt pūrvokte naiva vartmanā | 
tānyanyānyapi ca yogyāni puṣpāṇi vaiṣṇave manau | 
kamale karavīre dve tulasyau jāti ketakī | 
kahlāracampakotpala kundamandāranāgakeśara pāvaṃtī | nadyāvarttantu māllikāyuthī navamālikā saugandhikaṃ ca korakaṃ koraṇḍā lokasarjjana bilvārjuna munipatrakaṃ | 
patraṃ cāmalakaṃ śuddhaṃ karṇikāraṃ tathā śubhaṃ | 
palāśādi yathā lābhaṃ govindāya samarpayet | 
malinaṃ bhūmi saṃsṛṣṭaṃ krimikeśādi dūṣitaṃ | 
paryyuṣitāni puṣpāṇi varjjayeddevatārccane | 
tiṣṭheddinatrayaṃ śuddhaṃ padmamāmalakaṃ tathā | 
tulasī sarvathā śuddhā tathā bilvadalāni ca | 
dinaikaṃ karavīrāṇi yogyāni ca tapodhana | 
turīya guṇasampannaṃ nānāguṇa manoharaṃ | 
ānanda saurabhaṃ puṣpaṃ gṛhyatāmidamuttamaṃ | 
maṃtrasaṃpuṭitāṃ nyasya mātṛkāṃ deva varṣmaṇi | 
tattannyāsasthale tāṃ stān gandhapuṣpākṣatairyajet | 
paṃcātmikāyāṃ dīkṣāyāṃ gaṇeśādi kramād yajet | 
yadā madhye tu govindaṃ nairṛtyāṃ gaṇanāyakaṃ | 
āgneyyāṃ haṃ samabhyarccya aiśānyāṃ śivamarccayet | 
vāyavyāmarccayeddevīṃ bhoga mokṣa phalāptaye | 
gandhādibhirathābhyarccya ṣaḍaṃgasyārccyanaṃ tataḥ | 
śaktau tattadrasmi sarvamanyathā kevalaṃ yajet | 
viṃśat kṛtto japenmaṃtraṃ namaskṛtya samāpayet | 
tattadaṃge ṣaḍaṃgāni vakṣyamāṇena vā japet | 
āgneyyāṃ śivakoṇe ca (ca) rākṣase vāyukoṇake |

<pṛ0 29a> madhye dikṣu ca pūrvādi aṃgaṣaṭkaṃ samarccayet | 
hārasphāṭika kālāṃjana muktā vahnirociṣāṃ lalanā | 
abhayavaroghatahastāṃ pradhānato'ṅgadevatāḥ karthitāḥ | 
evamabhyarcya matimān dehetadbhedato yajet | 
mukhasthaṃ veṇuyaṃtraṃ yat pūjayet susamāhitaḥ | 
varṇava nama ityasya maṃtro'yaṃ samurīritaḥ | 
kaustubhaṃ hṛdaye ratnaṃ sūryyāyuta samaprabhaṃ | 
kaustubhāya nama iti tasya maṃtra udīritaḥ | 
tadadho vanamālāṃ ca candrāyuta sama (*) bhaṃ |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccāryya vanamālāyai natiṃ vadet | 
vanamālā manuḥ proktaḥ sarvapāpaughanāśanaḥ | 
kaustubhorddhe ca śrīvatsaṃ candrāyuta samaprabhaṃ | 
śrīvatsāya nama iti manustasya maharṣibhiḥ | 
sahasrasūryyasaṃkāśe karṇe makara kuṇḍale | 
makarakuṇḍalāya nama ityasya manurīritaḥ | 
kirīṭaṃ mastaye dīptaṃ sūryyāyuta samaprabhaṃ | 
sūryāyutasamābhāsa kirīṭāya namo vadet | 
praṇavādirayaṃ proktaḥ kirīṭasya maharṣibhiḥ | 
pūrvādidiśamārabhya prādakṣiṇya kramād yajet | 
dāmasudāmavasudāma kiṃkiṇī gandhapuṣpakaiḥ | 
aṃtaḥkaraṇarūpāste kṛṣṇasya parikīrttitāḥ | 
ātmā bhedena te pūjyā yathā kṛṣṇastathaiva te | 
praṇavādi namo'staiśca maṃtraistān paripūjayet | 
navāṃgamuktaṃ devasya bhogāṃgaṃ śṛṇu gautama | 
praṣṭau mahiṣyo devasya pura ādiṃ prapūjayet | 
pradakṣiṇa krameṇaiva rukmiṇyādyāṣṇutā matāḥ | 
rukmiṇī satyabhāmā ca lakṣaṇā ca sulakṣaṇā | 

<pṛ0 29ba> kālindī ṛkṣajānagnājityākhyā ca sunandakā | 
drutahema samaprakhyā rukmiṇīrūddhayauvanā | 
sitavastraparīdhānā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā | 
devasya vadanāmbhoja militākṣi madhuvratā |
varābhaya karopotā bhaktāya muktaye satāṃ |
iyaṃ lakṣmīḥ parāśaktirviśvānugraharūpiṇī | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā | 
pītāmbara vṛhacchrīṇī satyākhyā dharaṇi smṛtā | 
ratnapūrakarā vāme dakṣiṇe ca varapradā | 
anyāśca gaurāḥ śyāmābhāḥ krameṇa parīkīrttitāḥ | 
pītāmbara parīdhānā devārpita manomukhāḥ | 
tadbahirvasudevaṃ ca yaśodāṃ devakīṃ punaḥ | 
vasudevo hemagauro varābhaya karasthitaḥ | 
devakī śyāma subhāga sarvābharaṇa śobhanā | 
sitavastra yugānyā ca sarvepsita phalapradā | 
yaśodā hemaśaṃkāsā sitavastra yugapradā | 
sarvābharaṇa sandīptā kuṇḍalodbhāsitānanā | 
rohiṇīṃ ca yajettatra nandaṃ gauraṃ samarccayet | 
varadābhayasaṃyuktaṃ samastapuruṣārthadaṃ | 
baladevaṃ tathā caiva pūjayet kundasannibhaṃ | 
hālālolaṃ kuṇḍalilaṃ hemavaṃtaṃ smarettathā | 
tato yajet subhadrāṃ ca śyāmalaṃ rūḍha yauvanāṃ | 
tadvahirvaṣṇayaḥ sarve gopaṃ gopī śamarccayet | 
indranīla mukundādyān tadvahiḥ paripūjayet | 
indranīlaṃ mukunda ca tathā cānanda kacchapau | 
puṣkaraṃ śaṃkha padmau ca nidhāyāṣṭau prakīrtitāḥ | 
tadbahiḥ kalpavṛkṣāṃśca indrādīṃstadbahiryajet | 
indramairāvatārūḍhaṃ śyāmaṃ vajradharaṃ tathā | 
sādhipaṃ saparivāraṃ ca tadbahiḥ paripūjayet | 

<pṛ0 30a> agniṃ hemasamābhāsaṃ śaktitomaradhāriṇāṃ | 
meṣārūḍhaṃ śaktiyuktaṃ tejasāṃ patimarccayet | 
dakṣiṇe pitṛdevaṃ ca mahiṣopari saṃsthitaṃ | 
yajeddaṇḍadharaṃ caiva yamaṃ pitradhi daivataṃ | 
rākṣasādhipatiṃ tadvannairṛtyāṃ khaḍgadhāriṇaṃ | 
turagāvasthitaṃ devaṃ parivāraiḥ samarccayet | 
pāścātye varuṇaṃ śuklaṃ makarārūḍhamujjalaṃ | 
apāṃ patiṃ pāśadharaṃ parivārai samarccayet | 
vāyavyāṃ vāyudevaṃ ca prāṇādhipa samāhvayaṃ | 
dakṣahastāṃkuśameṇa cāhanaṃ paripūjayet | 
śaradindu samābhāsaṃ kṛpayā śaśalāṃchanaṃ | 
somaṃ somadigadhīśaṃ narārūḍhaṃ samarccayet | 
īśānaṃ vṛṣabhārūḍhaṃ candrāyuta samaprabhaṃ | 
rudrādhipaṃ śūlahastaṃ gandhamukhyaiḥ prapūjayet | 
indreśāna madhyadeśe brahmāṇaṃ haṃsavāhanaṃ | 
hemagauraṃ caturvaktuṃ padmahastaṃ samarccayet | 
rakṣo varuṇayormmadhye viṣṇuṃ cakradharaṃ yajet | 
nāgādhipaṃ suparṇasthaṃ viṣṇoḥ pāriṣadān yajet | 
vajrādīnāyudhān bhadrān teṣāṃ ca vahirarccayet | 
yathā sindhu samudbhutāṃ taraṃgā bhinnatāṃ yuyuḥ | 
tathā kṛṣṇa samudbhutā ete tadāyatāṃ yayuḥ | 
taddhyānena ca ta hyeyaṃ sādhakena śubhaṃ yunā | 
evaṃ saptāvṛttimayaṃ deśikaḥ kṛṣṇamarccayet | 
dharmmārthakāmamokṣāśca kare tasya suniścitaṃ | 
athavāṃga dikpatibhistadastrairapi cārccayet | 
evaṃ vā svarccayat kṛṣṇaṃ kāmamuktyoḥ sabhājanaṃ | 
ya etad yajanāśaktaḥ kṛṣṇāṣṭakena pūjayet | 
śrīkṛṣṇo vāsudevaśca nārāyaṇa samāhvayaḥ |
devakīnandanaḥ śreṣṭo vārṣṇoyastadanaṃtaraṃ | 
asurāṃtaka bhārahārī dharmmasaṃsthāpakaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
ayaṃ vā pūjayan kṛṣṇāṃ yathā vittānusārataḥ | 
iha bhuktāvarān bhogānaṃte tu haritāṃ vrajet | 

<pṛ0 30ba> agurūśīraguggulasitājya madhū candanaiḥ | 
sārajñau vairi nikṣiptairnāsādhyo madhumarpayet | 
vanaspatirasotpanno gandhāḍhyo gandha uttamaḥ | 
āghnaiyaḥ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpo'yaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ | 
varttyā karpūra garbhiṇyā sarpiṣā tilajena vā | 
saṃsthāpayatu pātrādau sudīptaśikhayā tataḥ | 
adhyodakena saṃskṛtya nandajāya nivedayet | 
uttāryyaṃ dṛṣṭiparyyaṃtaṃ ghaṃṭāṃ vāmadiśi sthitāṃ | 
vādayan vāmahastena dakṣahastena vāpaṃyet | 
suprakāśo mahātejāḥ sarvatratimirāpahaḥ | 
sarāhyābhyaṃtaṃ jyotirdīpo'yaṃ prakāśo mahātejāḥ | sarvatra timirāpahaḥ sarāhyābhyaṃtaṃ jyotirdīpo'yaṃ pratigṛhyatāṃ | 
svarṇe vā tāmrapātre vā raupye vā paṃkaje dale | 
śitopadaṃśaśālpatraṃ saguḍaṃ madhunā yutaṃ | 
dadhidugdhaghṛtopetaṃ kadalpādi phalānvitaṃ | 
ānīya deva purataḥ paṃ bījena vinikṣipet | 
astramaṃtreṇa vidhivaddhenumudrāṃ pradarśayet | 
candrabījaṃ cāmbusaṃsthaṃ caturddaśasvarānvitaṃ | 
nādabindusamāyuktaṃ bījaṃ tadamṛtātmakaṃ | 
parāyeti ca saṃprocya aniruddhaṃ vadet punaḥ | 
naivedyaṃ ca tathetyuktā kalpayāmi namo vadet | 
prokto naivedya maṃtro'yaṃ anena ca nivedayet | 
amṛtopastaraṇamasi svāheti jalamarpayet | 
anvāhāryyāya prāṇāya svāheti prathamāhutiḥ | 
aṃguṣṭhānāmikāmadhyā prāṇākhyā mudikā matā | 
āhavanīyāya apanāya svaheti ca dvitīyikā | 
kaniṣṭāṃguṣṭhanāmā ca mudrā tat parikīrttitā | 
gārhapatyāya vyānāya svāheti tṛtīyāhutiḥ | 

<pṛ0 31a> tarjjanyaṃguṣṭamadhyābhistanmudrā parikīrttitā | 
satyāya ca udānāya svāhayā ca caturthikā | 
madhyamānāmikāṃguṣṭa caturthī ca kaniṣṭhikā | 
āvasatyāya samānāya svāhā ca paṃcamī tathā | 
sarvābhiraṃgulībhistu tanmudrā parikīrtitā | 
praṇavādyairebhireva devavaktre huned guruḥ | 
oṃ nivedayāmi bhavate gṛhāṇedaṃ harirhare | 
nivedyārpaṇa maṃtro'yaṃ saparyyā suprakīrttitaḥ | 
kṣaṇaṃ vimṛṣya matimān dadyād gaṇḍūṣakaṃ tataḥ | 
amṛtopastaraṇamasi svāheti jalamarpayet | 
viśvakasenāya vai dadyāccheṣaṃ naivedyamuttamaṃ | 
ucchiṣṭa bhojino hyete eteṣāmavadhāraya | 
śive caṇḍeśvarāyeti viṣṇau viśvaksenāya ca | 
śaktyucchiṣṭaṃ śoṣakāyai dadyādarccana siddhayo | 
anyathā naiva siddhiḥ syādarccako narakaṃ brajet | 
naivedya jātamuddhṛtya sthānaśuddhiṃ vidhāya ca |
ācamanīya jalaṃ dadyāddaṃtaśodhanameva ca | 
hastalepaṃ tato dattvā punaḥ pānīyamarpayet | 
sūkṣmavastradvayaṃ dattvā dadyācca svarṇapāduke | 
pūjā sthānaṃ samānīya bahumālāṃ tathārpayet | 
divyagandhaṃ tato dadyāttāmbūlaṃ śaśi saṃyutaṃ | 
stotraiḥ stutvā ca vidhivat kṛtvā pradakṣiṇaṃ hariṃ | 
veda vidbhyo dhanaṃ dattvā yatphalaṃ labhate naraḥ | 
tatphalaṃ labhate bhaktyā kṛtvā kṛṣṇa pradakṣiṇaṃ | 
saptadvīpāṃ dharā dattvā veda vidbhyo mahāmune | 
tatphalaṃ labhate bhaktyā kṛtvā kṛṣṇā pradakṣiṇaṃ | 
padbhyāṃ karābhyāṃ jānubhyāmurasā śirasā dūśā |
vacasā manasā ceti praṇāmo'ṣṭāṃga īritaḥ | 
bhūmau nipatyayaḥ kuryyāt kṛṣṇe'ṣṭāṃganatiḥ sudhīḥ | 

<pṛ0 31ba> sahasrajanmajaṃpāpaṃ tyaktā vaikuṃṭhamāpnuyāt | 
navīna nīrada śyāmaṃ nīlendīvaralocanaṃ | 
vallarī nandanaṃ vande kṛṣṇaṃ gopālarūpiṇaṃ | 
sphuradvarhadalodvadvanīlakuṃcitamūrddhajaṃ | 
kadambakusumodvadvavanamālāvibhūṣitaṃ | 
gaṇḍamaṇḍalasaṃsargi calat kāṃcana kuṇḍalaṃ | 
sthūla muktāphalodāra hārodvyotita vakṣasaṃ | 
hemāṃgada tulā koṭi kirīṭojjavala vigrahaṃ | 
mandamāruta saṃkṣobhavalagitāmbara saṃcayaṃ | 
rucirauṣṭha puṭa nyasta vaṃśī madhura nisvanaiḥ | 
laladegāpālikā ceto mohayaṃtaṃ muhurmmuhuḥ | 
vallarī vadanāmbhoja madhupāna madhuvrataṃ | 
kṣobhayaṃtaṃ manastāsāṃ sasmerāpāṃga vīkṣaṇaiḥ | 
yauvanīdbhinnadehābhiḥ saṃsakrābhiḥ parasparaṃ | 
vicitrāmbarabhūṣābhirgopanārībhirāvṛtaṃ | 
prabhinnāṃjana kālindī jalakelikalotsukaṃ | 
yodhayannaṃ kvacid gopān vyāhayaṃtaṃ gavāṃ gaṇaṃ | 
kālindījalasaṃsargi śītalā nilakampite | 
kadambapādapacchāye sthitaṃ vṛndāvane kvacit | 
ratnabhūdharasaṃlagna ratnāsana parigrahaṃ | 
kalpapādapamadhyastha hemamaṇḍapikā gataṃ | 
vasaṃtakusumāmoda surabhīkṛta diṃmukhe | 
govarddhana girau ramye sthitaṃ vāsarasotasukaṃ | 
savyahastatalanyasta girivaryyātapatrayaṃ | 
khaṇḍitā khaṇḍalonmukta muktāsāra ghanāghanaṃ | 
veṇuvādya mahīllāsa kṛta huṃkāra nisvanaiḥ | 
sa vatsairunmukhaiḥ śaśvade gopālairabhivīkṣitaṃ | 

<pṛ0 32a> kṛṣṇamevānugāyadbhistacceṣṭā ca śavarttibhiḥ | 
daṇḍapāśodyata karairgopālairupaśobhitaṃ | 
nāradādmairmmunivarairvedavedāṃgaparigaiḥ | 
prīti susnigdhayā vācā stūyamānaṃ parātparaṃ | 
ya evaṃ ciṃtayeddevaṃ bhaktyā saṃstauti mānavaḥ | 
trisandhyaṃ tasya tuṣṭo'sau dadāti varamīpsitaṃ | 
rājavallabhatāmeti bhavet sarvajana priyaḥ | 
acalāṃ śriyamāpnoti savāgmī jāyate dhruvaṃ | 
atha mudrāṃ pradarśyātha agnisaṃskāramācaret | 
modanāt sarvadevāṃ drāvaṇāt pāpasaṃtateḥ | 
mudrāstāḥ kathitāḥ sadbhirdevasānnidhyadāyikāḥ | 

gautama uvāca 
bhagavanme tvayā mudrāḥ sūcitā na prakāśitāḥ | 
kathaṃ viracanaṃ tāsāṃ kāruṇyād bruhi me gurau | 

nārada uvāca 
kaniṣṭhāṃguṣṭhakau śaktau karayoritare tavaṃ | 
tarjjanīmadhyamānāmāḥ saṃhatābhugnavarjitāḥ | 
mudraiṣā gālinī proktā śastā gopāla pūjane | 
vanamālābhinayavat karābhyāmāgalādadhaḥ | 
jānuparyyaṃtamityeṣā mudrā syādvanamālikā | 
oṣṭhe vāmakarāṃguṣṭau lagnastasya kaniṣṭikā | 
dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭasaṃyuktā tat kaniṣṭhā prasāritā | 
tarjjanīmadhyamānāmāḥ kiṃcit saṃkocya cālitāḥ | 
veṇumudreha kathitā suguptā preyasī hareḥ | 
aṃgulīḥ saṃhatāḥ kṛtvā karayorvāmadakṣayoḥ | 
vāmanāsāsamāyuktā dakṣapāṇi kaniṣṭhikā | 
dakṣasya madhyamākrāṃtā vāmahastasya tarjanī | 
vāmamadhyamayākrāṃtā dakṣahastasya tarjjanī | 
saṃyutau kārayedvidvānaṃguṣṭhāvubhayorapi | 
dhenumudrānigaditā gopitā sādhakottamaiḥ | 
karau saṃpuṭitau kṛtvā vāmapāṇi kaniṣṭhikā | 

<pṛ0 32ba> niṣpīḍya dakṣapāṇistha dakṣiṇāṃgulibhirdṛḍhaṃ | 
tathā vāmāṃgulibhavairati gāḍhaṃ nipīḍayet | 
itīyaṃ bilvamuṃdrā syāt praśastā kṛṣṇa pūjane | 
kāyena manasā vācā buddhyā buddhyā ca yat kṛtaṃ | 
iha janmāne pūrvasmin athavā pāpasaṃcayaṃ | 
imāṃ jānan yojanaṃ tanmuṃcatyāśu na saṃśayaḥ | 
devāḥ sarve namasyaṃti praṇamyaṃti tathā janāḥ | 
kāmamuccāryya vidhivannikṣipeddhṛdayopari | 
kṛtvetaraṃ karaṃ vāme kṛtvā samyak samāṃgulīḥ | 
anyonya pṛṣṭha karayaurmmadhyamānāmikāṃgulīḥ | 
vāmakaniṣṭayā dakṣakaniṣṭhāṃ ca nipīḍya ca | 
vāmānāmikayā dakṣa tarjanīṃ ca nipīḍayet | 
vāmāṃgulatrayopari kuryyāddakṣiṇahastāṃgulitrayaṃ | 
ekatrayojitaṃ kṛtvā mudrā syāt kaustubhātmikā | 
dakṣiṇe maṇibandhe ca vāmāṃguṣṭhaṃ niyojayet | 
mudreye kaustubhākhyoktā darśanīyā prayatnataḥ | 
kṛtvetaraṃ karaṃ vāme kṛtvā samyak samāṃgulīḥ | 
tarjanyupari vāmaṃ ca nyaset karatalaṃ tataḥ |
aṃguṣṭhau cālanīyau ca matsyamudrai ca mīritā | 
karau saṃpuṭitau kṛtvā maṇibandhau suyojitau | 
aṃguṣṭhe ca kaniṣṭhe ca pravidhāya suyojite | 
śeṣā aṃgulayaḥ sarvā ubhayorvāma bhaṃguraḥ | 
parasparamasaṃlagnā śūnyamadhye ca kārayet | 
uktā kalasamudreyaṃ gopālārccā vidhau śubhā | 
kṛtvetare karatale aṃtarāṃjali saṃyute | 
anyonyamatisaṃlagne aṃguṣṭhāntaramāhite | 
kathitā kūrmmamudreyaṃ sarvataṃtreṣu gopitā | 
ākuṃcitaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā vāmāṃguli catuṣṭayaṃ | 

<pṛ0 33a> prasāryya ca tadaṃguṣṭhaṃ dakṣahastena veṣṭayet | 
prasāryya tarjanīṃ dakṣāṃ tadaṃguṣṭhaṃ ca maṃtravit | 
śaṃkhamudreya mudritā darśanāt pāpanāśinī || 

[iti gautamīye mahātaṃtre daśamo'dhyāyaḥ] || 10 || 

athāgnijananaṃ kṛṣṇa iha maṃtrānusārataḥ | 
dharmmārtha kāma mokṣāṇāṃ yat kṛtvā phalamaśnute | 
gomayāṃtaḥ samālipya kuṇḍaṃ sarvatra maṃtravit | 
sāmānyārghyaṃ prakalpyātha paṃcagavyena secayet | 
trikoṇaṃ tadbahiḥ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ ca padmaṃ prakalpayet | 
caturasraṃ caturdvāramevaṃ vā vahnimaṇḍalaṃ | 
kuṇḍasyottarabhāge ca trirekhāṃ hastamātrakaṃ | 
dakṣiṇottaratastadvat kuryyādrekhātrayaṃ śubhaṃ | 
arghyādbhiḥ prokṣya sarvaṃ hi paṃcaśuddhiṃ samācaret | 
vīkṣaṇaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇa kavacenātha lepayet | 
astreṇa rakṣitaṃ kṛtvā vahneḥ saṃskāramācaret | 
pāṣāṇa bhavamagniṃ ca athavā yoni sambhavaḥ | 
śrotriyāṇāṃ gṛhotthaṃ vā vanasthaṃ cāthavā haret | 
yadṛcchālābha saṃprāpto yogyo'yaṃ homa karmmaṇi | 
niragni brāhmaṇālladhvo hyartha lābhakaro bhavet | 
kṣattrabandhaścaturthāṃśa phalaṃ dadyāddhutāśanaḥ | 
vaiśyāt śūdrācca viphalaṃ jāyate homakarmmaṇi | 
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena vahni muktaṃ samāharet | 
ānīya kāṃśyapātrasthaṃ kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajet | 
kravyādebhyo namaskṛtya praṇavādyo manurbhavet | 
rekhāṇāmudgagrāṇāṃ brahmavaivasvatendavaḥ | 
prāgagrāṇāṃ ca rekhāṇāṃ mukundeśa purandarāḥ | 
tato vahneryogapīṭhamarccayet karṇikopari | 
dharmmaṃ jñānaṃ ca vairāgyamaiśvaryyamādito yajet | 
pūrvādi dikṣu cā pūrvān tathā dharmmādikān yajet |

<pṛ0 33ba> madhye ca pūjayedvaherna praśaktīrvidhānavit | 
pītā śvetāruṇā kṛṣṇā dhūmrā tīvrā sphuliṃginī | 
rucirā jvālinī proktā kṛśānorṇavaśaktayaḥ | 
amarkamaṇḍalaṃ pūjyaṃ uṃ somamaṇḍalaṃ yajet | 
maṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ tadvadarccayed gandhapuṣpakaiḥ | 
vāgīśvarī mṛtyusnātāṃ nīlendīvara sannibhāṃ | 
vāgīśvareṇa sahitāmupacāraiḥ prapūjayet | 
śaktipraṇa ca bījābhyāṃ tayorarccanamīritaṃ | 
vāgīśvarī mṛtumatīṃ puruṣādhiṣṭhitāṃ smaret | 
vahniṃ saṃskṛtya pātrasthaṃ raṃ bījena tu maṃtrayet | 
caitanyaṃ praṇaveṇaiva yojayana taṃ prapūjayet | 
ātmano'bhimukhe vahniṃ jānu pṛṣṭha mahītalaḥ | 
śiva bījadhiyā devyā yonāvenaṃ vinikṣipet | 
tato devāya devyai ca dadyādācamanīyakaṃ | 
garbhanāḍyādhṛtaṃ dhyāyedvahnirūpaṃ paraṃguruḥ | 
paścādagarbhasya rakṣārthaṃ pradadyārddarbhakaṃ kaṇaṃ | 
bhūṣābhibhūṣayoddavīṃ trailokyotpatti mātṛkāṃ | 
rephavāyuṣadasvaraiśca nādabindu vibhūṣitāḥ | 
sādiṣāṃtāśca jihvānāṃ manavaḥ parikīrttitāḥ | 
pāyau liṃge tathā nābhau hṛdaye kaṃṭhamūlataḥ | 
lambikāyāṃ bhruvormmadhye jihvā jvālā rucau nyaset | 
hiraṇyā kanakā raktā kṛṣṇākhyā suprabhā matā | 
bahurupāti raktā ca jihvākvapīṭayoninaḥ | 
sahasrārcciḥ svasti pūrṇa utthitaḥ puruṣastathā | 
dhūmavyāpi saptajihvo dhanurdhara iti smṛtaḥ | 
ṣaḍaṃgamaṃtrā vahneśca praṇavādyā namo'ntakāḥ | 
hṛdayādi krameṇaiva nyastavyā aṃgadevatāḥ | 
bhūrddhiṇ skandhe tathā pārśve kaṭyāṃ tu kaṭipārśvake | 

<pṛ0 34a> skandhe mūddhiṇ ca vinyasya prādakṣiṇya krameṇa tu | 
jātavedāḥ saptajihvo havyavāhanasaṃjñakaḥ | 
aśvodarajasaṃjño'nyaḥ punarvaiśvānarāhvayaḥ | 
kaumāra tejā viśvāmukho'nte devamukhastathā | 
evaṃ vinyasta dehaḥ san jvālayenmanunāmunā | 
citpiṃgalastadvayaṃ daha dvayaṃ tathāpi ca | 
sarvajño jñāpaya svāhā maṃtroyaṃ samudāhṛtaḥ | 
agniṃ prajvalitaṃ vande jātavedaṃ hutāśanaṃ | 
suvarṇavarṇamamalaṃ samṛddhaṃ sarvatomukhaṃ | 
samiddhena ca maṃtreṇa tribhirmmaṃtrairhutāśanaṃ | 
jvālayenmatimānmaṃtrī anyathā viphalaṃ bhavet | 
darbhairagarbhaiḥ śuddhaiśca mūla madhyāgrachāditaiḥ | 
saṃstaredvidhivanmaṃtrī pradakṣiṇa vaśādatha | 
evaṃ saṃstaraṇaṃ kuryyādvarjayitvānmano diśaṃ | 
yajñavṛkṣodbhavaistadvat kāṣṭhaiśca paridhi trayaṃ | 
madhyastha mekhalāyāṃ tu saṃstarettaṃtravittamaḥ | 
atha cet sthaṇḍile maṃtrī bhūmau sarvaṃ paristaret | 
gandhādibhiḥ samabhyarccya vahnidevaṃ vibhāvayet | 
trinayanamaruṇābhaṃ vaddhamauliṃ śuklāmbūjāṃ | 
śukamaruṇamaṇikā kalpamambhosaṃsthaṃ abhimatavaśakti svastikā bhītimuccairmmarakata kamalamālālaṃkṛtāṃ śaṃkṛśānuṃ | 
suvarṇavarṇamamalaṃ lasat svarṇe pavītakaṃ | 
caturbhujaṃ dvi śirasaṃ havyakavya dvināsikaṃ | 
kamaṇḍalu tālavṛṃta śakti svastika dhāriṇaṃ | 
catuḥśrotraṃ śabdāyamānamuttamaṃ | 
evaṃ vā manasā dhyāyecchāttikādau guruttamaḥ | 
kṛṣṇaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ gatervvarṇaṃ dhyāyenmāraṇakarmmaṇi | 
mūrttiraṣṭau sammubhyarccya ṣaṭkoṇe tu ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ | 
madhye jihvāṃ yajaiṣvahnervahniṃ tanmaṃnunā yajet | 

<pṛ0 34ba> vaiśvānarapadaṃ pūrvaṃ jātavedamanaṃtaraṃ | 
lohitākṣaṃ tataścoktā ihāvaha tataḥ paraṃ | 
sarvakarmmaśi dehi me svāhā manuḥ samṛddhidaḥ | 
ānyasthālīṃ samānīya kṣālayedastumuccaran | 
kuṇṭhe'ḍgagarān samuttaulya nyasettatrāṃga maṃtrataḥ | 
tasyā mājyaṃ vinikṣipya jānīyāttāpanaṃ hitaṃ | 
prajvālya kuśa gucchaṃ tu ājye kṣiptvānale kṣipet | 
abhidyotanamityuktaṃ sarvatra sarvakarmmasu | 
punaḥ kuśān samujjvālya nikṣipe dāhya madhyanaḥ | 
mūlamaṃtreṇa matimānājya saṃskāra īritaḥ | 
abhimaṃtrya ca mūlena rakṣayedasramuccaran | 
pradarśya venuyonī ca ājyaṃ tadamṛtātmakaṃ | 
suksruvau ca samādāya vidhinā nirmmito guruḥ | 
triśaḥ pratāpayedvahnau punaḥ prakṣālya vāriṇā | 
punaḥ pratapyatau maṃtrī sthāpayettau svadakṣiṇe | 
prādeśamātraṃ sagrasthi darbhayulmaṃ ghṛte kṣipet | 
kṛtvā bhāgau śukla kṛṣṇa pākṣau smṛtvā tu nāḍaikāḥ | 
vāmadakṣamādhyabhāgeṣvīḍādyāḥ saṃsmarettataḥ | 
śruveṇa dakṣiṇādbhāgādagraye svāhayāmunā | 
juhuyāda ghṛtamādāya vahnerddakṣiṇalocane | 
vāmatastadvadādāya somāya svāhayā tataḥ | 
maṃtreṇānena juhuyādagnervāma vilocane | 
madhyāttadvat samādāya argnarbhālasthalocane | 
juhuyādagnisomābhyaṃ svāheti manunāmunā | 
hṛnmaṃtreṇa śruveṇājya bhāgādādāya dakṣiṇāt | 
juhuyādagnaye sṛṣṭi kṛte svāheti tanmukhe | 
ityagnernetra vaktrāṇāṃ kuryyādurghghaṭanaṃ guruḥ | 
punavyāhṛtibhirhutvā jihvāṃgaṃ mūrttito hunet | 
vaiśvānareṇa maṃtreṇa trivāraṃ juhuyād guruṃ | 

<pṛ0 35a> saṃskārārthaṃ tato vahnerhunetra vanavāhutīḥ | 
praṇavādyena matimān svāhāṃtena taduccaran | 
garbhādhānaṃ puṃsavanaṃ sīmaṃtonnayanaṃ tathā | 
jātakarmma tathā nāma upaniṣkramaṇaṃ tathā | 
cūḍaopanayane bhuyo vedādhyāyanameva ca | 
godānaṃ ca vivāhaṃ ca saṃskārāḥ śubhakarmmaṇi | 
aśubhe maraṇāṃtāṃte prayuktāstaṃtravedibhiḥ | 
tataśca pitarau vahneḥ saṃpūjya hṛdayaṃ nayet | 
vahnimaṃtreṇa vidhivaddadyāhutipaṃcakaṃ | 
samidhaḥ paṃca juhuyānmalāgra ghṛtasaṃplutāḥ | 
gururhṛdayamaṃtreṇa vidhivat svāhayā vinā | 
mahāgaṇeśamaṃtreṇa hunedekādaśāhutīḥ | 
sāmānyaṃ sarvadevānāmetadagni mukhaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
bahurūpāyāṃ ca jihvāyāmāvāhya parameśvaraṃ | 
gandhādibhiḥ samabhyarcca juhuyāt ṣoḍaśāhutīḥ | 
mūlamaṃtreṇa vidhinā vaktraihyekī(?) karaṇantvidaṃ | 
punastenaiva juhuyādāhutīḥ paṃcaviṃśatiṃ | 
nāḍaīsandhānamuddiṣṭaṃ vahni devanayorapi | 
aṃgādi parivārāṇāmekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet | 
punarvyāhṛtibhirhutvā homaṃ kuryyādyathāvidhi | 
tilenājyena juhuyāt sahasrādi yathāvidhi | 
anukte tu havirdravye tilājyaṃ havirucyate | 
juhuyādraktapadmaṃ vā madhuratrayasaṃyutaṃ | 
pāyasaṃ madhuropetaṃ juhuyādvā yathāmatiḥ | 
āsyāntarjuhuyādvahneḥ paṇḍitaḥ sarvakarmmasu | 
badhiratvaṃ karṇahome netretvandhatvamāpnuyāt | 
nāsikāyāṃ manaḥ pīḍā śirohomīhi mṛtyudaḥ | 
yataḥ kāṣṭhaṃ tataḥ śrotraṃ yato dhūmo'tha nāsikā |
yato'lpajvalanaṃ netraṃ yato bhasma tataḥ śivaḥ | 
yataḥ prajvalito vahnistanmukhaṃ jātavedasaḥ | 

<pṛ0 35ba> evaṃ homaṃ samāpyātha matimān śrapayeccaruṃ | 
pātre tāmramaye śuddhe dugdhaṃ na kāpilena vai | 
śuddhataṇḍala saṃbhūta prasṛte viṃśatiṃ kṣipet | 
ghṛtadhārāṃ tato dadyādyāvat svinno bhaveccaruḥ | 
āvatāryya tato vidvān bhāgatrayamathārccayet | 
athācaret |
bhāgamekaṃ samādāya nityahomaṃ samācaret | 
kuṇḍe vā sthāṇḍele maṃtrī sthale vā śodhite tathā | 
ekahastāmite deśe kuśapuṣpāmbusenvite | 
vahni tatra samādhāya jātavedo manorjjapāt | 
manuṃ japet |
vyāhṛtibhistato hutvā kṛṣṇamāvāhya bhaktitaḥ | 
gandhādibhiḥ samabhyarccya mūlena paṃcaviśatiṃ | 
āhutīrjuhuyānmaṃtrī ṣaḍaṃgahomamācaret | 
natāṃgaśca tato bhūtvā namaskṛtya ca maṃtravit | 
visṛjedvinduge dhāmni nityahomo'yamīritaḥ | 
svagṛhyokra vidhānena bali vaiśvamathācaret |
bhāgadvayamathacaruṃ kṛṣṇāya vinivedayet | 
eka bhāgaṃ svayaṃ bhuktā śiṣṭaṃ śiṣye samarpayet | 
śayītaḥ saṃyataḥ śiṣya kamvalepalālevā kuśāstare | 
bhūteśvarasya maṃtreṇa svāśikhāṃ bandhayeda guraḥ | 
tataḥ śayīta tāṃ rātrimadhivāso'yamīritaḥ || 

[iti gautamīye ekādaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 11 || 

tataḥ prātaḥ samutthāya kṛta nityakriyo guruḥ | 
kṛtakṛtyo'pi śiṣyastu niṣīded gurusannidhau | 
kathayedrātri vṛttāṃtaṃ śubhaṃ vā yadi vā śubhaṃ | 
sumaṃgalītirnārībhiḥ sahasaṃ bhojanaṃ mithaḥ | 
giriśṛṃgārohaṇaṃ ca hastyaśvaratharohaṇaṃ | 
ārohaṇaṃ saudhagehe devotsavanirīkṣaṇaṃ | 

<pṛ0 36a> maṃgalaṃ ca svavāmāṃśa darśanaṃ sparśanaṃ tathā | 
maṃtrasiddhasya liṃgāni proktāni tava suvrata | 
anākulāni kathaye śṛṇu nindyāni sarvataḥ | 
kṛṣṇavarṇairbhaṭaiḥ svapne prahārastailalepanaṃ | 
viprāṇāṃ roṣavāde ca parastrīṇāṃ niṣevaṇaṃ | 
siddhivighnāni coktāni anyāni ninditāni ca | 
evaṃ doṣaṃ samājñāya kṣaṇāt parihareda guruḥ | 
homaṃ kuryyāt sahasrādi dravyaiḥ kalpokta darśitaiḥ | 
sāṃgaṃ saparivāraṃ ca hutvā balimathācaret | 
maṇḍalasya bahirbhāge lokeśādi baliṃ haret | 
nakṣatrāṇāṃ savārāṇāṃ sarāśīnāṃ yathākramaṃ | 
gandhādyaiḥ samyagabhyarccya tatranmaṃtraistu maṃtravit | 
śuddhānnenat dadyādbaliṃ gandhapuṣpa dhūpadīpakamādarāt | 
tārāṇāmaśvinyādīnāṃ rāśiḥ pādādhika dvayaṃ | 
meṣādimuktā nakṣatra saṃjñā pūrvamanaṃtaraṃ | 
devatābhyaḥ padaṃ proktā divānaktaṃ vadettathā | 
carebhyaśvātha sarvebhyo bhūtebhyaśca namo vadet | 
evaṃ rāśau tu saṃpūrṇe tasmiṃstadavat prayojayet | 
tathā rāśyadhipānāṃ ca grahāṇāṃ tatra tatra tu | 
mīna meṣāṃtarāle tu karaṇānāṃ baliṃ vadet | 
meṣasya vṛścikasmāraḥ śukro vṛṣa tulādhipaḥ |
budhuvai kanyakā nāthaścandraśca karkaṭādhipaḥ | 
siṃharāśyadhipo bhānuścāpa mīnādhipo guruḥ | 
makarasyāpi kumbhasya mandorāśyadhipā ime | 
lāṃ indrāyetyādi viṣṇupāriṣadamarccayettathā | 
dadyādbaliṃ digīśebhyo vidhinatha guruttamaḥ | 
oṃ āśvinī devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ bharaṇī kṛttikāpāda devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ |

<pṛ0 36ba> kṛttikā tripāda rohiṇī devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
kṛttikā tripāda rohiṇī devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
rohiṇī mṛgaśīrṣa pūrvāṣāḍhārddhadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
mṛgaśīrṣottarārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
ārdrāpunarvasutripāda devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
punarvasupādapuṣpa devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
aśleṣā devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
maghā devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ |
pūrvaphalguṇyattarāphalguṇī pādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
uttarāphalguṇī dvipādahastā devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
hastācitrārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
hastācitrārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
citrottarārddhasvātī devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
svātī viśākhā tripādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
viśākhā pādānurādhā tripādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvadevatābhyo namaḥ | 
jyeṣṭhādi devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
mūlādi devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
pūrvāṣāḍhottarāṣāḍhā pādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 

<pṛ0 37a> uttarāṣāḍha śravaṇā devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
śravaṇā dhaniṣṭhārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
dhaniṣṭhārddha śatabhiṣag devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
śatabhiṣak pūrvabhādrapada tripādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
pūrvabhādrapadottarabhādrapada devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
revatī devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
meṣāśvinī bharaṇī kṛttikā pādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
vṛṣabha kṛttikā tripāda rohiṇī mṛgaśiraḥ pūrvārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
mithuna mṛgaśirārdrā punarvasu tripādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ |
karkaṭa punarvasvekapāda puṣpāśleṣa devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
siṃhamaghā pūrvottarāpāda devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
kanyottarā tripāda hasta citrārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
tulā citrottarārddha svātī viśākhā tripāda devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
vṛścika viśākhā pādānurādhā jyeṣṭā devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
dhanurmula pūrvāṣāḍhottarāṣāḍha pādadevatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
makarottarāṣāḍha tripāda śravaṇā dhaniṣṭhārddha devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 

<pṛ0 37ba> kumbhadhaniṣṭhottarārddhaśatabhiṣak pūrvabhādratripāda devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
mīna pūrvabhādrapada uttarabhādra revatī devatābhyo divānaktaṃ carībhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo namaḥ | 
āvaraṇā devatābhyo namaḥ |  śukra devatābhyo namaḥ | budha devatābhyo namaḥ | candra devatābhyo namaḥ | āditya devatābhyo namaḥ | bṛhaspati devatābhyo namaḥ | śanaiścara devatābhyo namaḥ | siṃha devatābhyo namaḥ | vyāghra devatābhyo namaḥ | varāha devatābhyo namaḥ | khara devatābhyoḥ namaḥ | gaja devātābhyo namaḥ | vṛṣabha devatābhyo namaḥ | kukkura devatābhyo namaḥ | hara devatā durgā guha viṣṇu brahma lakṣmī dhanādhipā dvāradevatā | ityuktā tebhyo baliṃ hared guruḥ | itthaṃ bali vidhiḥ proktaḥ sarvavighnaugha nāśanaḥ | 
gopucchamadhikaṃ tyaktā tṛṇairāstaraṇaṃ bhavet | 
jambīraṃ kali vṛkṣaṃ ca tyaktā caidhāṃsi kalpayet | 
śuddha sindūra bālārka varṇo vahneḥ suśobhanaḥ | 
bherī vāditra gambhīra śabdo vahneḥ śubhapradaḥ | 
candra candrana kundābha dhūmaḥ sarvārthasiddhidaḥ | 
kharavāya savacchando vahneḥ sarva vināśa kṛt | 
kṛṣṇaḥ kṛṣṇātervarṇo rājyaṃ cāpi vināśayet | 
pūrṇāhutiṃ tato dadyāt sandhiścaiva vidhānavit | 
oṃ bhūragnaye pṛthivyai mahate svāhayā tataḥ | bhūvo vāyave cāṃtarīkṣāya ca dive ca mahate ca svāhayā tataḥ | svaścandramase digbhyaśca nakṣatrebhyaḥ svāhā | oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svaścandramase nakṣatrebhyaśca digabhyaśca mahate svāhā | sruksruvau ca samādāya | 

<pṛ0 38a> ghṛtenāpūryyatau punaḥ homadravyāṇi nikṣipya | 
nābhau saṃsthāpyatau punaḥ | brahmārpaṇaṃ na madhunā dadyāt | pūrṇāhutiṃ punaḥ | itaḥ pūrvaṃ prāṇabuddhi dehadharmmādhikārato jāgratsvapna suṣuptyavasthāsu ca manasā vācā karmmaṇā hastābhyāṃ padbhyāṃ mudareṇa śiśnāyat | 
smṛtaṃ yaduktaṃ yatkṛtaṃ tatsarvaṃ brahmārpaṇaṃ bhavatu svāhā | brahmārpaṇa manuḥ so'yaṃ brahmārpaṇa vidhau smṛtaḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye dvādaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 12 ||

evaṃ homavidhiṃ kṛtvā kuṇḍasthaṇḍila devatāḥ | dikpāladevatāścāpi aṃkurārpaṇa daivatā ānayet | kalase cāpi kṛṣṇaukyaṃ bhāvayed guruḥ | 
kṛṣṇaṃ svadhā yutaṃ nītvā śiṣyamārūpa taṃtravit | 
vāsasā netre badhnīyānnetra maṃtreṇa yatnataḥ | 
pāpayitvā paṃcāgavyaṃmatrāmṛtamayaṃ śubhaṃ | 
spṛṣṭvātaṃ taṃtramaṃtrajño'dhvaṣadakaṃ viśodhayet | 
viṣṇutattvāni saṃśodhya abhiṣeka gṛhaṃ nayet | 
varṇaḥ kalāpadaṃ tattvaṃ maṃtro bhuvanameva ca | 
adhvaṣadakamiti proktaṃ munibhistaṃtra vedibhiḥ | 
varṇādhvā varṇaśaṃkhaśca phalādhvā ṣaḍabhirīritā | 
pādādhvā padasamūhaḥ syāṃttattvādhvā paṃcaviṃśati | 
ṣaṭtriṃśadevaṃ tattvāni iti tattvavido viduḥ | 
maṃtrādhvā maṃtrarāśiḥ syātte hi vaidika tāṃtrikāḥ | 
bhuvanādhveti kathitā bhuvanāni caturddaśa | 
śodhayāmyamumadhvānamamukasya hi parvataḥ | 
vedagarbho namaścāṃte manuradhva viśodhane | 
navāhutīrguraḥ kuryyāt ekaikādhva viśodhane | 
haste gṛhītvā taṃ śiṣyamabhiṣeka gṛhaṃ nayet | 
niveśya mātṛkāyaṃtre secayet kalasā mṛtaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 38ba> kṛṣṇānubhava pūrṇātmā ācāryyaścānayed ghaṭaṃ | 
gorocanā pallavāni kalpavṛkṣadhiyāmṛṣan | 
śiśoḥ śirasi saṃyojya viloma mātṛkāṃ japat | 
mūlamaṃtraṃ tathā japtvā kuryyāddevābhiṣecanaṃ | 
kṛṣṇātmakaṃ tu tattoyaṃ śiva ādi padāvadhi | 
abhiṣiṃce cena maṃtrī kṛṣṇātmā bhavati dhruvaṃ | 
nanauṣadhi kalābhiśca jalaṃ kṛṣṇātmakaṃ bhavet | 
tena tat saṃkamātreṇa śiśuḥ kṛṣṇo na cānyathā | 
evaṃ yaḥ kurute bhaktyā ātmānaṃ viṣṇu saṃskṛtaṃ | 
iha bhuktā yathā kāmaṃ dehāṃte tatpadaṃ vrajet | 
candanālepitāṃgaśca dvijāśīrbhiśca saṃyutaḥ | 
kṛṣṇātmakaṃ deśikaṃ taṃ praṇamya ca punaḥ punaḥ | 
niṣīdet sannidhau tasya niyato vinayānvitaḥ | 
nyāsajālaṃ tasya dehe guruḥ sāmyasya yatnataḥ | 
dakṣakarṇe vadenmaṃtraṃ trivāraṃ pūrṇamānasaḥ | 
gaṇeśādi manuṃ coktā samayān kathayed guruḥ | 
maṃtrārthaṃ maṃtrabījaṃ ca tacchaktiṃ tat kalāpi ca | 
ātmānaṃ darśayet sākṣāt svanāmnā tanmayaṃ tataḥ | 
maṃtrakuṇḍali devānāmekārthatvaṃ prakāśayet | 
siddhāṃtaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ yatnād bādhayet kṛpayā guruḥ | 
ekaṃ copadiśecchiṣyaṃ yathā tanmayatāṃ vrajet | 
yathā grāma śataṃ toyaṃ viṣṭhādi mūtradūṣitaṃ | 
gaṃgāyāṃ militaṃ tattu gaṃge va bhavati dhruvaṃ | 
yathā mā tṛptāmame yatra pātīto bhavecchiśuḥ | 
śiṣyo'pi pūrṇā tāṃ jñātvā guruṃ yatnena toṣayet | 
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyādvitrārddhaṃ bhakti tatparaḥ | 
tadarddhaṃ vā tato dadyād yathāśaktyātha bhaktitaḥ | 
vittaśāṭhyaṃ na kurvīta kṛtenārthaṃ samāharet | 

<pṛ0 39a> go bhū hiraṇya vastrādīn gurave'tha nivepayet | 
guru putre'pi tat patnyai tāchiṣyo'pi svaśaktitaḥ | 
vastrālaṃkaraṇaṃ dadyādbhojyaṃ miṣṭaṃ yathā ruci | 
ṛtvigbhyo dakṣiṇāṃ dadyād vastrālaṃkāra bhūṣitaṃ | 
sātvatāṃ tarpayedbhaktyā yathā vibhava vistarāt | 
tataḥ prabhṛti maṃtrajño guruśāsana saṃsthitaḥ | 
yathā maṃtre tathā deve yathā deve tathā gurau | 
paśyedabhedato maṃtrī evaṃ bhakti kramo mune | 
abhaktiṃ janayaṃlloke devatā kleśadāyakaḥ | 
tridinaṃ nivasedbhaktyā siddhaye gurusannidhau | 
anyathā tadbhutaṃ tejo gurumeti na saṃśayaḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye trayodeśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 13 || 

caitremāsyatavā kṛtvā śubharkṣe guruśāsanāt | 
dvādaśyāṃ śuklapakṣe ca mādhave māsi tattithau | 
ārabhedamalāyāṃ vai puraścaryyāṃ susiddhaye | 
japahomau tarpaṇaṃ ca seko brāhmaṇa bhojanaṃ | 
paṃcāgopāsanaṃ loke puraścaraṇamucyate | 
ādau purasakriyāṃ karttuṃ kuryyādbhūmeḥ parigrahaṃ | 
svecchācāra vihārāya tataḥ ūrddhaṃ na laṃghayet | 
jīvahīno yathā dehī sarvakarmmasu na kṣamaḥ | 
puraścaraṇa hīno'pi tathā na syāt phalapradaḥ | 
parvatāgre nadītīre goṣṭhe devālaye tathā | 
puṇyāraṇye mahātīre samudrasya nije gṛhe | 
tulasīkānane ramye bilvamūle ca śasyate | 
viṣṇukṣetre ca vidhivat siddhaye japamārabhet | 
puraścaraṇa kṛnmaṃtrī bhakṣyābhakṣyaṃ vicārayet | 
anyathā bhojanāddoṣāt siddhi hāniḥ prajāyate | 
satkulasthānajātāni śucīnāṃ śrīmatāṃ satāṃ | 
gṛhasthānaṃ vadānyānāṃ bhīkṣāśino'grajanmanāṃ | 

<pṛ0 39ba> bhuṃjāno vā haviṣyānnaṃ śākaṃ ca vihitaṃ tathā |
phalaṃ kramuka kendūnāṃ varjjayan vihitaṃ mune | 
payodadhi phalaṃ vāpi nārikelaṃ yathoditaṃ | 
haviṣyaṃ vā tathā śriyāt śaktuṃ yava samudbhavaṃ | 
rambhā phalaṃ tiṃtiḍaīkaṃ kamalā nāgaraṃgakaṃ | 
phalānyetāni bhojyāni eṣāmanyāni varjjayet | 
aikṣavaṃ varjjayenmaṃtrī śarkarai kṣava varjjitaṃ | 
lavaṇaṃ kṣāramamlaṃ ca gṛṃjanaṃ kāṃśyameva ca | 
tāmbūlaṃ ca vibhaktaṃ ca duḥsabhāya prayatnataḥ | 
śrutismṛti virodhaṃ ca japaṃ rātrau ca varjjayet | 
bhūśayyāṃ brahmacāri tvaṃ maunaṃ capyana sūyatāṃ | 
nityaṃ trisavanaṃ snānaṃ kṣudrakarmma vivarjjitaṃ | 
nitya pūjā nitya dānaṃ devatā stuti kīrttanaṃ | 
naimittikārccanaṃ caiva viśvāso gurudevayoḥ | 
japaniṣṭhā dvādaśaite dharmmāsyurmmaṃtrasiddhidāḥ | 
nityaṃ sūryyamupasthāya tasya cābhimukho bhavet |
devatā pratimādau ca vahnau cābhyarccya tanmukhaḥ | 
anirvedastathā vyagraḥ śāstroktācārapālakaḥ | 
snāna pūjā japa dhyāna homa tarpaṇa tata paraḥ | 
niṣkāmo devatāyāṃ ca sarvakarmma nivedakaḥ | 
evamādīṃśca niyamān puraścaraṇamucyate | 
śaktau trisavanaṃ snānaṃ anyathā dviḥ sakṛttathā | 
asnātasya phalaṃ nāsti nacāturpayataḥ pitṛn | 
amedhya sambhavaṃ dehaṃ jalādindriya śuddhatā | 
tasmānmukhyaṃ jalasnānaṃ sarveṣāṃ munibhirmmataṃ | 
na vīkṣyet patitaṃ vrānyaṃ piśunaṃ veda nindakaṃ | 
tathā nāśramiṇe vipraṃ viṣṇutvasya vinindikaṃ | 
ṛtukālaṃ vinā maṃtrī svastriyaṃ nāpi saṃspṛśet | 
maithunaṃ tat kathālāpaṃ tadgoṣṭhīṃ parivarjjayet | 

<pṛ0 40a> parvate sindhutīre vā puṇyāraṇye nadī taṭe | 
yadi kuryyāt puraścaryyāṃ tatra kūrmmaṃ na ciṃtayet | 
grāme vā yadi vā vāstau gṛhe vā taṃ ca ciṃtayet | 
dīpasthānaṃ tathā coktaṃ mukhaṃ pṛṣṭaṃ ca maṃtriṇaḥ | 
dīpasthāne bhavet siddhi nānyathā koṭi jāpanaiḥ | 
pūrvottara vibhāgena catuḥsūtraṃ nipātayet | 
navakoṣṭhaṃ bhavedetat kūrmmadehamanuttamaṃ | 
pūrvādidiśi maṃtrajñaḥ pradakṣiṇa krameṇa tu | 
kādivargān likhedvidvān paṃca paṃca vibhāgaśaḥ | 
yādivargaṃ śādivargaṃ lakṣamīśe ca saṃlikhet | 
kūrmmasyāṃgaṃ ca kūrmmaṃ ca kuryyācchobhāṃ yathā bhavet | 
svarāṇāṃ yugma yugmaṃ ca madhye cāṣṭasu dikṣu ca | 
evamaṣṭaṃgavān kūrmmaḥ sarveṣāṃ siddhi dīpakaḥ | 
dīpanāthaṃ likhenmadhye pūjayettaṃ vibhāvayan | 
yasmin diśi patedagrāmādyakṣaraṃ dṛśyate tathā | 
kūrmma vaktraṃ ca jānīyāttatra siddhiranuttamā | 
vaktrapārśve ca koṣṭhe dve karau kūrmmasya viddhi hi | 
madhye kukṣī ubhe jñeyau pādau dvau śeṣa pucchakaṃ | 
evaṃ kūrmmaṃ vijānīyāddīpacakra vivecakaḥ | 
mukhe siddhirbhavennyūnaṃ madhye śuddhiśca jāyate |  
udāsīnaḥ karasthaśca kukṣistho duḥkhamāpnuyāt | 
pādasthaḥ pīḍyate maṃtrī baṃdhanoccāṭanādibhiḥ | 
pucche mṛtyurbhavennyūnamevaṃ kūrmmasya saṃsthitiḥ | 
maṃtrākṣareṇa maṃtraṃ cet kūrmmanāmno bhaved yadi | 
sādhakasya ca nāmnātha kiṃ na siddhyati maṃtriṇaḥ | 
paṃcāśadvarṇarūpeṇa kṣetreśā viśvavigrahāḥ | 
tasmācca saguṇaṃ kṣetraṃ siddhaye syānna cānyathā | 
dviguṇaṃ cenmukhasyo'pi koṣṭhena siddhimāpnuyāt | 
tasmāccakraṃ vicāryyaivaṃ mitraṃ cet sarvasiddhidaṃ | 
yasmin deśe dīpa patiḥ saguṇaṃ nāma maṃtrayoḥ | 

<pṛ0 40ba> tatra yatnena gaṃtavyaṃ sapīṭho durlabho mataḥ | 
rudrākṣairapi bhadrākṣaiḥ pratu jīva kucandanaiḥ |
sphaṭikaiśca pravālaiśca kuśagraṃthi bhavaistathā || 
tathā malaka sambhūtaistūlasīkāṣṭhanirmmitaiḥ | 
ebhiśca mālikāṃ kuryyānmatimān vaiṣṇave manau | 
rudrākṣa sambhavāyā tu anaṃta phaladā matā | 
puṇḍarīkā bhavā mālā gopāla manu siddhidā | 
jīvaputrabhanāyā tu putraṃ vitanute cirāt | 
kucandana bhavā mālā rājyabhogāpavargadā | 
pravālanirmmitā yā tu sarvasattvavaśaṃkarī | 
kuśagraṃthi bhavāmālā dharmmavṛddhikarī matā | 
tulasī sambhavā yā tu mokṣaṃ vitanute'cirāt | 
aṣṭottaraśatairmmālā nirmmitā yā tu mālikā | 
rājyaṃ vitanute nṛṇāṃ dehāṃte mokṣadāyinī | 
mokṣārthī paṃcaviṃśatyā putrārthī triṃśatā japet | 
catvāriṃśanmaṇi bhavā abhicārāya kevalaṃ | 
paṃcāśanmaṇibhirmmālā sarvakarmmaprasādhikā | 
akārādikṣakārāṃtā cākṣamālā prakīrttitā | 
kṣāṃtaṃ merumukhaṃ tatra kalpayenmunisattama | 
anayā sarvamaṃtrāṇaṃ japaḥ sarvasamṛddhidaḥ | 
nityaṃ japaṃ kare kuryyānnatu kāmyamabodhanāt | 
ārabhyānāmikā mūlāt parivartena vai kramāt | 
tarjjanīmadhyaparyyaṃtaṃ japedaṣṭasu parvasu | 
gopālataṃtramaṃtrāṇāṃ karamāleyamīritā | 
kārpāsamambhavaṃ sūtraṃ puṇyastrībhirvinirmmitaṃ | 
athavā paṭṭasūtreṇa svarṇasūtreṇa vā tathā | 
aṇimādika mokṣāṃtāḥ siddhaye svarṇasūtrake | 
paṭṭasūtraṃ vaṃśakaraṃ dhana putra vivarddhanaṃ | 
kārpāsa sambhavaṃ sūtraṃ dharmmakāmārtha mokṣadāṃ | 

<pṛ0 41a> triguṇaṃ triguṇīkṛtya grathayecchilpaśāstrataḥ | 
mukhe mukhaṃ tu saṃyojya pucche pucchaṃ niyojayet | 
gopuccha sadṛśī mālā yadvā sarpākṛtiḥ śubhāḥ | 
evaṃ nirmmāya mālāṃ vai śodhayenmunisattama | 
aśvattha patra navakaiḥ padmākāraṃ tu kalpayet | 
tanmadhye sthāpayen mālāṃ mātṛkāṃ mūlamuccaran | 
nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kṛtvā sāmānyārghyaṃ vidhāya ca | 
kṣālayedīśasūktena limpettat puruṣeṇa tu | 
gandhairanalpairmmatimān aghoreṇa tu dhūpayet | 
aghoreṇaiva sūktena śatānyunaṃ tu maṃtrayet | 
vāmadevena sūktena śamī kuryyādvicakṣaṇaḥ | 
ekaika mālāmādāya brahmagraṃthiṃ prakalpayet | 
ekaika mātṛkāvarṇān grathanādau tu saṃjapet | 
tat sajātīyamekākṣameva ca triḥprakalpayet | 
evaṃ saṃgrathitāṃ mālāṃ punaḥ padmopari nyaset | 
tatrāvāhya yajeddevaṃ yathā vibhavavistaraiḥ | 
maṃtrayenmūlamaṃtreṇa krameṇota kramayogataḥ | 
tathaiva mātṛkāvarṇairmmaṃtrayenmaṃtrataṃtravit | 
kṣālayet paṃcagavyena punarīśena sūktataḥ | 
punarvilipya gavyena japenmaṃtraṃ yadṛcchayā | 
nānya maṃtraṃ japenmaṃtrī kabhyayetra vidhunayet | 
kampanāt siddhi hāniḥ syāt dhūnanaṃ bahuduḥkha kṛt | 
śabde jāte bhavedrogaḥ karabhraṣṭo vināśakṛt | 
chinne sūtre bhavenmṛtyustasmād patra paro bhavet | 
japāṃte karṇadeśe vā uccasthāne ca vinyaset | 
tvaṃ māle sarvadevānāṃ sarvasiddhipradā matā | 
tena satyena me siddhiṃ dehi mātarnamo'stute | 
ityuktā paripūjyātha gopayed yatra toyatī | 
mālāṃ maṃtraṃ ca paśubhyo na prakalpayet | 

<pṛ0 41ba> prakāśane kāryyahānirityuktaṃ taṃtravidibhiḥ | 
aṃguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ ca japā chata guṇaṃ bhavet | 
tarjanyaṃguṣṭhayogena śatruccāṭanakārakaḥ | 
aṃguṣṭhamadhya prāyogānmaṃtrasiddhiḥ suniścitā | 
aṃguṣṭhānāmikāyogāduccāṭot sādane mate | 
jyeṣṭākaniṣṭāyogaina śatruṇāṃ nāśanaṃ maṃtaṃ | 
iti te kathitaṃ vidvan mālāyāḥ parinirṇayaḥ | 
śaktyātrisavanaṃ snānamanyathā dviḥ sakṛttathā | 
trisandhyaṃ prajapenmaṃtraṃ pūjanaṃ tat samaṃ bhavet | 
ekadā vā bhavet pūjā na japet pūjanaṃ vinā | 
prātaḥkāle'thavā pūjā japāṃte vā yajeddhariṃ | 
prātaḥkālaṃ samārabhya japen madhyandināvadhi | 
paśubhāvenmadhyandināvadhi paśubhāve sthitā maṃtrāḥ | 
kevalā varṇarūpiṇaḥ sauṣumnadhvanyucciritāḥ | 
prabhutvaṃ prāpnuvaṃtite | 
maṃtrākṣarāṇi cicchaktau proktāni paribhāvayet | 
tāmeva paramavyomni paramāmṛtavṛṃhitāḥ | 
darśayetyātmasambhāraṃ pūjā homādibhirvinā | 
manaḥ saṃhṛtya viṣayānmaṃtrārtha gata mānasaḥ | 
na drutaṃ na vilamvaṃ ca japenmauktika paṃktivat | 
japaḥ syādakṣarāvṛttirmānasopāṃśuvātvekaiḥ | 
dhiyāyadakṣara śreṇīṃ varṇa svara padātmikāṃ | 
uccaredarthamuddiśya mānasaḥ sa japaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
jihvauṣṭhau cālayet kiṃciddevatā gata mānasaḥ | 
kiṃcicchavaṇayogyaḥ syādupāṃśuḥ sajapaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
maṃtramuccārayedvācā vācikaḥ sajapaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
mānasādi tribhirbhedaiḥ kathitaṃ japalakṣaṇaṃ | 
mānasaḥ siddhikāmānāmupāṃśuḥ puṣṭimicchatāṃ | 
vācikāmāraṇe śastaḥ kathitaṃ japa lakṣaṇaṃ | 

<pṛ0 42a> evaṃ japaṃ purā kṛtvā tejorūpaṃ samarpayet | 
devasya dakṣiṇe haste kuśapuṣpārghya vāribhiḥ | 
sajapaṃ tadvibhāvyaivaṃ prāṇāyāma trayaṃ caret | 
japasyādāvatha cāṃte tritayaṃ tritayaṃ caret | 
na nyūnaṃ nādhikaṃ vāpi japaṃ kuryyāddine dine | 
yadi kuryyāt pramādāttatadāneṣṭamavāpnuyāt | 
nyūne nyūnāṃga doṣaḥ syādadhike cādhikāṃgakaṃ | 
yathāvidhi kṛtānīha phalaṃti tānya yatrataḥ | 
japāṃte pratyahaṃ maṃtrī homayettaddaśāṃśataḥ | 
tarpaṇaṃ sekamityevaṃ tattaddaśāṃśato mune | 
pratyahaṃ bhojayedviprān nyūnādhika praśāṃtaye | 
viprabhojanamātreṇa vyaṃgaṃ sāṃgaṃ bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
goṣuśuśrūṣaṇaṃ kuryyāddevatābhyo yaśaḥ pradaḥ | 
goṣvapi priyamāṇāsu gopālo'yaṃ prasīdati | 
karmmāṃte saṃsmaret kṛṣṇaṃ aṃtaḥkaraṇa śuddhaye |
nāma saṃkīrttanaṃ viṣṇoḥ sarvavighna nikṛṃtanaṃ | 
athavā lakṣapūrṇau ca homādi kṛtyamācaret | 
saṃpūrṇāyāṃ pratijñāyāṃ tarpaṇādi tathācaret | 
viṣṇorniveditānnaṃ yadrātrau bhuṃjeda kutsayan | 
tadannā devatā yasya tadannaḥ puruṣo bhavet | 
śayīta kuśaśayyāyāṃ kambale vā kuśāsmare | 
evaṃ pratidinaṃ kuryyād yāvat sāṃgaṃ vrataṃ bhavet | 
homaṃ ca pūrvavat kuryyāt pāyasairathavāmbujaiḥ | 
homābhāve jāpaṃ kuryyāddhīmasaṃkhyā caturguṇaṃ | 
ṣaḍguṇaṃ cāṣṭaguṇitaṃ yathāsaṃkhyaṃ dvijātayaḥ | 
śudrasya vipra bhṛtasya tat patnī sadṛśo japaḥ |
homa śūnyasya viprasya yo japaḥ sa tu tat striyaḥ | 
daśākṣaraṃ manuvaraṃ siddhaye daśalakṣakaṃ | 
japtvā tadaṃte homo'pi vidhinā karmma cācaret | 

<pṛ0 42ba> daśāṃkṣaraṃ japen maṃtrī sahasra daśakaṃ japet | 
pratyahaṃ mukhya kalpo'yaṃ anyaṃ nyūnamudāhṛtaṃ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇaṃ manuvaraṃ paṃcalakṣaṃ japettataḥ | 
kṛtyamevaṃ samuddiṣṭamanyattat kalpasaṃgrahāt | 
tarpaṇaṃ ca tataḥ kuryyāttīrthodaiścandramiśritaiḥ |
jale devaṃ samāvāhya pādyādyairudakātmakaiḥ | 
saṃpūjya vidhintadbhaktyā parivāra samanvitaṃ | 
ekaikamaṃjaliṃ toyaṃ parivārān pratarpayet | 
tato homa daśāṃśena tarpayet puruṣottamaṃ | 
ādau maṃtraṃ samuccāryya śrīpūrvaṃ kṛṣṇamityapi | 
tarpayāmāhamityuktā namo'ntasmarpaṇo manuḥ | 
tarpaṇasya daśāṃśena abhiṣekaṃ tathā caret | 
nyāsāna śekhān kṛtvā tadabhedena prapūjayet | 
kṛṣṇātmānaṃ svamātmānaṃ dhyātvā rāśmi samanvitaṃ | 
kusumaṃtoyamekaṃ ca sugandhi parimiśritaṃ | 
jalāṃjaliṃ samādāya mūlamuccāryya sādhakaḥ | 
śrīkṛṣṇamabhiṣiṃcāmi nama ityabhiṣecane | 
abhiṣeka daśāṃśena brāhmaṇān paritarpayet | 
kṣīra khaṇḍāddhabhaujyaiśca bahumāna puraḥsaraṃ | 
viprabhojanamātreṇa vyaṃgaṃ sāṃgaṃ bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
sarvathā bhojayedviprān te ca kṛṣṇatanuryataḥ | 
yatra bhukteṃ dvijastuṣṭyā tatra bhuṃkte hariḥ svayaṃ | 
yatra bhuṃkte śriyaḥ kāṃtastaṃtra bhuṃkte jagattrayaṃ | 
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyādbhojanācchādanādibhiḥ | 
guru saṃtoṣamātreṇa maṃtrasiddhirbhaveddhruvaṃ | 
guru mūlamidaṃ sarvamityāhustaṃtravedinaḥ | 
miṣṭānnaṃ bahu satkāryyaṃ bhuṃjīta bahubhiḥ saha | 
evaṃ siddhamanurmmaṃtrī sādhayet sakalepsitaṃ | 
evaṃ nityakramaṃ kṛtvā naimittikamathācaret | 

<pṛ0 43a> kṛte naimittike vipra nityasya pūrṇatā bhavet | 
anyathā naiva siddhiḥ syādanuṣṭhāna śatairapi | 
mathurāyāṃ mahākṣetre vasan kṛṣṇaṃ samarccayan | 
lakṣamātraṃ japenmaṃtraṃ maṇḍalādīpsitaṃ bhavet | 
mandarasya mahāraṇye saraladruma kānane | 
puṣpairvanya samudbhūtairdugdhāśī vijitendriyaḥ | 
lakṣamātraṃ japan bhaktyā kṛṣṇaṃ paśyati cakṣuṣṇa | 
vṛndāvana gato maṃtrī dvātriṃśa sthānamāśritaḥ | 
lakṣaṃ kṛtvā japedbhaktyā aṇimādi guṇāllabhet | 
samudragāsarinmadhye kuṭṭime nivasan yatī | 
dugdhāhāro japellakṣaṃ pāpaṃ koṭi bhavodbhavaṃ | 
nāśayennātra sandeho vāksiddhiṃ cāpi vindati | 
parvatāgre yajet kṛṣṇaṃ śākamūla phalāśanaḥ | 
lakṣaṃ tatrāpi saṃjapya khecarī melanaṃ bhavet | 
samudragā nadītīre tulasīkānane vasan | 
lakṣamātra japāttatra koṭijanmādya nāśanaṃ | 
puṇḍarīka vakaiḥ kṛṣṇaṃ māsamekaṃ samarccayan | 
dharmmārthakāmamokṣāṇi karasthāni labhed dhruvaṃ | 
tulāsthe bhāskare padmairhomayeddaśasahasrakaṃ | 
lakṣmī sthirā bhavettasya puttrapauttrānuyāyinī | 
śrīpuṣpairjjuhuyānnityaṃ vaiśākhe māsi dugdhayaḥ | 
sarvapāpakṣayakaraḥ sarvasiddhi pravarddhakaḥ | 
devāḥ sarve namasyaṃti bhaktyā taṃ puruṣarṣabhaṃ | 
śrījalaistarpayet kṛṣṇaṃ matsyaṇḍī candrasaṃyutaiḥ | 
aṣṭottaraśataṃ kṛtvā pūjāṃte bhakti tatparaḥ | 
maṇḍalāllabhate siddhiṃ dvyakṣaraṃ svakavartmanā | 
yad yat kāmayate maṃtrī anāyāsāllabhecca tat | 
dugdha budhyā jalairnityamaṣṭottaraśataṃ śataṃ | 
tarpayannakhilān kāmān labhemmokṣaṃ ca vindati | 

<pṛ0 43ba> kuśapuṣpaiḥ samabhyarccya māsamātraṃ nirāmayaḥ | 
yaśase dharmmavṛdhyai ca brahmacārī vrate sthitaḥ | 
hayāri kusumaiḥ śuklairmaṇḍalādvāṃchitaṃ bhavet | 
tathā raktāśvamāreṇa acalāṃ bhūtimāpnuyāt | 
tathā dvābhyāṃ samabhyarccya bhuktiṃ muktiṃ ca vindati | 
goṣu bhaktiḥ sadā kāryyā goṣu kaṇḍūpana tathā | 
goṣu nityaṃ prasannāsu gopālaḥ saṃprasīdati | 
brāhmaṇānāṃ kṣatriyāṇāṃ vaiśyānāṃ śeṣa janmanāṃ | 
strīṇāṃ caiva mahāvāho naimittikamidaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
eteṣāṃ caikamātraṃ tu kṛtvā kāmyāni kārayet || 

[iti śrīgautamīye caturddaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 14 ||

trikālābhyarccanaṃ vakṣye govindasya yathāvidhi | 
maṃtrayorubhayoḥ kāryyamanyeṣāṃ ca tadātmanaḥ | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ nīlendīvaralocanaṃ | 
vārṣikaṃ ca śiśuṃ mugdhamāsīnaṃ padmaviṣṭaye | 
bhaṃga vidruma bimbābha kara pādādharodbhavaṃ | 
guḍālaka ca yācchanda mukhendu grahasaṃvṛtaṃ | 
kundendukāśa saṃkāśa hārabhāsitadiṃmukhaṃ | 
rājakundadvayābhāsa ninditāneka mauktikaṃ | 
mahāśmarāśrisaṃkīrṇa suvarṇāneka bhūṣaṇaṃ | 
svapuṣṭaṃ dhūṣarāṃgaṃ ca dhenu dhulī ca yotthayā | 
gopa gopī gavāṃ vṛndairvīkṣyamāṇaṃ suvismitaiḥ | 
brahmaṇā śaṃkareṇāpi premot kaṃṭhāt suvīkṣitaṃ | 
purandaramukhairdevairmunibhiḥ saṃstutaṃ paraṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā yajet kṛṣṇāṃ yajedbhakti bharānataḥ | 
ajñairindriyavajādyairāvṛtti tritayānvitaṃ | 
kṣīra khaṇḍājya dugdhaṃ ca kadalī navanītakaṃ | 
covāṃ rambhā phalaṃ cā'pi anyadvāla priyaṃ ca yat | 
japaṃ cāṣṭasahasraṃ ca kṛtvā kṛṣṇaṃ prasādayet | 
stotrairnānāvidhairbhaktā namaskāra pradakṣiṇaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 44a> dugdha budhyā jalairaṣṭaśataṃ saṃtarpya maṃtravit | 
ātmānaṃ tat kalāmbhoje hyalabhyaḥ san samarpayet | 
brahmārpaṇākhya manunā tato nyasya hṛdaṃ nayet | 
pūrvekti na krameṇātha śeṣamanyatha samāpayet | 
hutaśeṣaṃ niśāśī ca ekākī ca niśāṃ nayet | 
ya evaṃ māsamātraṃ tu bhaktyā kṛṣṇaṃ samarpayet | 
pūjyo lokaiḥ kavirvāgmī lakṣmīṃ prāpyānuyāyinīṃ | 
puttrairmitraiśca sambandhaḥ prayātyaṃte paraṃ padaṃ | 
madhyāhne vāsudevaṃ taṃ rājamaṇḍalamadhyagaṃ | 
dvārāvatyāṃ sahasrākī dīpite bhavanāṃtare | 
kalpavṛkṣa samākīrṇe puṇya pakṣi ninādite | 
padmotpalādi kahlaraiḥ saṃkīrṇābhiralaṃkṛte | 
tasmin supuline ramye chāyāyāṃ kasya ca | 
ratnastambhai ratnadīpairmmuktādāma vibhūṣite | 
nānāvicitrāṃtavirtana śata saṃkule | 
tat pārśvaracanaṃ dhyāyet punnāgakeśaraiḥ saha | 
tathā nānāvidhairvṛkṣaiḥ pāṭalaiścamyakādibhiḥ | 
vakustaiḥ saralairvamyaiḥ kuruvakairveṣṭitairapi | 
sarvarttu kusumopetaiḥ puṣpāvanataśākhibhiḥ | 
ratnasiṃhāsanāsīnaṃ puṇḍarīka dale kṣaṇaṃ | 
pṛthūraskaṃ supuṣpāṃgaṃ rājanya gaṇa mohanaṃ | 
puṇḍarīka nibhāṃ nābhiṃ puṇḍarīkākṣamavyayaṃ | 
subhrūlalāṭavadanaṃ puṣpahāsaṃ sulocanaṃ | 
sukapolaṃ sutāmroṣṭaṃ śyāmalaṃ maṃgalāśrayāṃ | 
nīlakuṃcita keśāṃtaṃ vicitrāmbara bhūṣaṇaṃ | 
kambugrīvaṃ suvistīrṇaṃ kaustubhodbhāsi vakṣasaṃ | 
mahābalī mahoraskaṃ mahābhuja catuṣṭayaṃ | 
balī bandhuramadhyena rājadadhara śobhitaṃ | 
pradakṣiṇa gata śrīmadbhuvanābhi vibhūṣitaṃ | 
samoru jānujaṃghābhiḥ svastikāṃghiyugātmakaṃ | 

<pṛ0 44ba> tuṃgaratra nakhaṃcitraṃ tuṃgapādāṃgurīyakaṃ | 
anekavidharatrādi pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
sphurito raskabandhena śobhitaṃ vanamālayā | 
ratnahāraiśca sauvarṇairgraiveyaka vibhūṣitaṃ | 
keyūramaṇi sambadha rājadbhujacatuṣṭayaṃ | 
vicitrakaṭakairyukta nūpuraiḥ pādaśobhitaṃ | 
nānāratnamayairhaimairaṃgurīyairvirājitaṃ | 
anaṃtaratnasaṃchanna sphuranmakarakuṇḍalaṃ | 
sauvarṇe nābhirucira nānācitravicitritaiḥ | 
loladbhramarasaṃchannaiḥ prasūnairmukuṭojjalaṃ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma dharaṃ śāṃta mukhe kṣaṇaṃ | 
divyalakṣaṇa sampannaṃ divyabhūṣaṇabhūṣitaṃ | 
divya mālāmbaradharaṃ divya gandhānulepanaṃ | 
lalāṭe hṛdaye kukṣau kaṃṭha bāhvośca pārśvayoḥ | 
virājitordhapuṇḍeṇa candanena vibhūṣitaṃ | 
mahībhārabhūtārātiṃ tarjjayaṃtaṃ muhurmuhuḥ | 
uddhavādimamaṃtrivarairmmaṃtrayaṃtaṃ muhurmuhuḥ | 
teṣāṃ nipātanāyaiva dharmmārthanīti yuktibhiḥ | 
evaṃ madhyāhṇa saṃprāpte kāle dhyāyan jagadguruṃ | 
āvāhya vidhivadbhaktyā pūjayannupacārakaiḥ | 
aṃgaṃ pūrvavaduddiṣṭaṃ pūra ādi prapūjayet | 
rukmiṇīṃ satyabhāmāṃ ca kālindīṃ ca sulakṣaṇāṃ | 
nāgnajītiṃ jāmbavatīṃ mitra vindāṃ suśīlikāṃ | 
ityaṣṭaśaktīrddevasya pūjyāḥ kṛṣṇasya vallabhāḥ | 
āgnau sudarśanaṃ cakraṃ nairṛte ca jalodbhavaṃ | 
vāyavye ca gadāṃ divyāṃ īśāne padmamujjalaṃ | 
tato dalānāṃ vāhye ca vasudevaṃ ca daivakīṃ | 
nandagopaṃ yaśodāṃ ca pūra ādit prapūjayet | 
pādyairarghyaistathā puṣpaiḥ pūrvādidalato'rccayet | 

<pṛ0 45a> balabhadraṃ subhadrāṃ ca rohiṇīṃ ca tathottare | 
sudānaṃ ca tathā dānaṃ vasudāmaṃ ca kiṃkiṇīṃ | 
devasya vāmapārśve tu pūjayed gurupādukāḥ | 
paramaṃ ca guruṃ tatra parāpara guruṃ tathā | 
pādukāṃtaṃ samabhyarcca pūrvasiddhaṃ tathā yajet | 
pūrve gaṇapatiṃ yaṣṭvā tadbahiḥ paripūjayet | 
indrādi lokapālāṃśca svasvadikṣu svamaṃtrataḥ | 
kumudaṃ kumudākhyaṃ ca puṇḍarīkaṃ ca vāmanaṃ | 
śaṃku karṇaṃ sarvanetraṃ sumukhaṃ supratiṣṭitaṃ | 
dakṣiṇāvarttametāṃstu pūrvādidalatorcca'yet | 
uttareśānayornmadhye viṣvaksenaṃ samarccayet | 
saṃpūjyaivaṃ hariṃ bhaktyā naivedyaṃ ca nivedayet | 
pāyasaṃ śarkarā pūpaṃ khaṇḍādyaṃ kadalīphalaṃ | 
sitopadaṃśamaṃtra ca svarṇapātre nivedayet | 
athavā raupyapātre ca tāmrapātre'thavā punaḥ | 
abhāvāt padmapatre vā anyathā narakaṃ vrajet | 
suvarṇa casakevātha raupye vā vidhinā tataḥ | 
saśarkaraṃ pakvadugdhaṃ atra vyaṃjana pāyasaṃ | 
nānāvidhopahārāṇi govindāya nivedayet | 
rājopacāraṃ datvā tu stutvā natvā visarjjayet | 
ya evaṃ ciṃtayeddevaṃ gopālaṃ vigata spṛhaḥ | 
rājānaḥ kiṃkarāḥ sarve samānyāḥ saparicchadāḥ | 
rājaputrāśca patnyaśca sarve tasyānuvartitaḥ | 
iha bhuktvā varān bhogānaṃte viṣṇoḥ padaṃ vrajet | 
aṣṭottaraśataṃ homaṃ kuryyāttat saṃkhyayādṛtaḥ | 
homatarpaṇayormmaṃtrī sādhayedakhilānapi |
prātarhomaṃ prakurvvītaṃ tathā madhyandine'thavā |
rātri homaṃ ca madhyāhṇe kuryyādevaṃ vidhiḥ smṛtaḥ || 

<pṛ0 45ba> tṛtīyakālapūjāyāmastikāla vikalpanā | 
sāyāhṇe niśi vetyatra vadattyeke vipaścitaḥ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇaṃ sāyāhṇe śatrau ceddaśavarṇakaṃ | 
ubhayomubhaye naiva vadaṃte brahmavādinaḥ | 
sāyāhṇe dvāravatyāṃ tu citrakodyāna madhyagaḥ | 
saugandhikotpalamatī dīrghikā śata veṣṭite | 
nandanodyān madhye tu kadambavanamadhyagaṃ | 
jvaladratnamayaiḥ stambhaiḥ suratnavīthikamvite | 
nānāratnamayollāsi prācīra dvāra śobhite | 
mahāratnamayaṃ gehaṃ munibhiḥ pariveṣṭitaṃ | 
nāradādyairmmunivaraiḥ śaunakaiḥ pippalādibhiḥ | 
sanakādi brahmaputraiḥ parītaṃ tattvanirṇaye | 
nāradaṃ parvataṃ jiṣṇuṃ niśaboddhavadārukaṃ | 
viśvaksenaṃ ca śaileyaṃ kṛpādṛṣṭi vilakṣitaṃ |
tebhyo munibhyaḥ svadhāma diśaṃtaṃ paramakṣaraṃ | 
candrakoṭi pratīkāśaṃ viśvāvakāśadīpitaṃ | 
nānāratnagaṇākīrṇaṃ mahāmukuṭa bhūṣitaṃ | 
aneka ratnarāśyarkalasanmakarakuṇḍalaṃ | 
bhāvahārāvalī rājallasat kaustubha vakṣasaṃ | 
nānāratnagaṇākīrṇa keyūra valayāṣṭakaṃ | 
vidravat kanakābhāsa pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
bandhurodāra jaṭharaṃ gabhīra nābhi paṃkajaṃ | 
uttuṃga caraṇāmbhoja lasat svarṇāṃgurīyakaṃ | 
pradīpta ratnakaṭaka tulā koṭi dvayānvitaṃ | 
śaśaraktādhara puṭamārakta padapaṃkajaṃ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma dhāriṇaṃ vana mālinaṃ | 
śuddha jñāna svabhāva tvāt suśuklaṃ taṃ parātparaṃ | 
ajñānanāśakādyadvannavavārijasannibhaṃ | 
sūryyakoṭi pratīkāśamavidyā dhvāṃta nāśanāt | 
ityevaṃ paramātmānaṃ dhyāyaṃti brahmavādinaḥ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā madhyamārccā vidhānena prapūjayet | 

<pṛ0 46a> sahasraikaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ homāddaśāṃśa tarpaṇaṃ | 
rajatā rājite pātre khaṇḍe dugdhaṃ nivedayet | 
pūrvopacārān datvātha namaskṛtya visarjjayet | 
gṛhasthānāṃ vanasthānāṃ nyāsikāṃ hṛdayāmbuje | 
dhyātvā saṃpūjya munibhirmānasairupacārakaiḥ | 
vivikto gṛhamedhī ca munibhiḥ saha pūjayet | 
vāsudevādibhirapi nirvāṇaṃ padamāpnuyāt | 
sāyāhne vāsudevaṃ ca pūjayedvidhinā naraḥ | 
devāḥ sarve namasyanti kiṃ punarnaramarkaṭāḥ | 
saṃsāra sāgaraṃ ghoraṃ niṣamaṃ nakra saṃyutaṃ | 
saṃtīryyaviṣayān bhuktvā jñānīte padamāpnuyāt | 
durvāsanāṃ parityajya koṭijanmasamudbhavaṃ | 
ekena janmanā muktiṃ yāti kaivalya nirmmitaṃ | 
tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ sadā paśyaṃti śūrayaḥ | 
rātrau cenmanmathākrāṃtaṃ mānasaṃ devakī sutaṃ | 
rāsagoṣṭhī pariśrāṃtaṃ gopī maṇḍalamadhyagaṃ | 
vṛndāvana gataṃ dhyāyet chāyāyāṃ kalpaśākhinaḥ | 
susthitaṃ veṇu gāyaṃtaṃ vanamālā parīvṛtaṃ | 
pītāmbaradharaṃ śyāmaṃ gopikā saṃkhyaveṣṭitaṃ | 
devāsuraiśca gandharvairapsarobhiśca sevitaṃ | 
yakṣairvidyādharagaṇairvihaṃgairbhūvi yadgataiḥ | 
brahmarṣibhirdevarṣibhiḥ stūyamānaṃ suvismitaiḥ | 
nānāvivairapsarobhirvīkṣyamāṇaṃ suvismitaiḥ | 
lelihyamāna gandharvairdevastrī śatakoṭibhiḥ | 
indīvara nibhaṃ ratnaṃ sundarendu varānanaṃ | 
saṃphulla padmavadanaṃ padmapatra nibhekṣaṇaṃ | 
padmanābhi pāṇipādaṃ padmanābhi nibhādharaṃ | 
śaraṇaṃ sarvabhūtānāṃ gopikājanavallabham | 

<pṛ0 46ba> kvacidbhaṃgaparimilata paṃkajopari saṃsthitaṃ | 
kalpitānaikadehena nārīṇāṃ śatakoṭibhiḥ | 
veṣṭitaṃ ramamāṇaṃ ca gāyaṃtaṃ divyamūrchanaiḥ | 
dvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ vallabhābhyāṃ madhye madhye virājitaṃ | 
yathā marakata stambhaṃ suvarṇenābhiveṣṭitaṃ | 
kvacidgopāṃganā vastra hāriṇaṃ helayānvitaṃ | 
kvacidvasaṃtaṃ hāsaṃtaṃ strīvṛndamupahāsakaiḥ | 
nirmmitaṃ deva nikarairarccitaṃ puṣpavṛṣṭibhiḥ | 
devastrībhirvījyamānaṃ kāmotkaṃṭhika ceṣṭitam | 
evaṃ dhyātvā madhu ripuṃ yajettaṃsaṃ śitavrataḥ | 
mithunaiśca ṣoḍaśakaiḥ keśarādibhirāvṛtaṃ | 
mahīṣibhistathā vītaṃ goyībhirapi sarvataḥ | 
evamabhyarccya vidhinā kāṃśye vā rājato vite | 
pātre dugdhaṃ nivedyātha mithunebhyastathārvayet | 
japtvā stutvā namaskṛtya hṛtpadme taṃ visarjjayet | 
evamabhyarccya jagatāṃ patiṃ śuddhamanāyatiḥ | 
dharmmārya kāmamokṣāṇāṃ dāyādo bhavati dhruvaṃ | 
vipro vedādhipo bhūyāt sākṣādbhūmipurandaraḥ | 
kṣattriyo rājavaryyaśca vaiśyo dhanasamṛddhimān | 
śūdraḥ sukhāni sarvāṇi bhuktvā cāṃte paraṃ vrajet | 
evaṃ te kathitaṃ vipra saṃsārabhayanāśanaṃ | 
arccanaṃ trividhā yā tu mūlavidyā nikṛṃtanaṃ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye paṃcadaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 15 ||

gautama uvāca
brūhi me bālakṛṣṇatvaṃ tava sārvajña kāraṇaṃ | 
brahmaṇā yat purā proktaṃ sevayā tapaso'rccitaḥ | 
yat prasādān muniśreṣṭha trailokya viditaṃ na te | 
yathākramaṃ kathaya me sarvameva samāhitaḥ | 
suśruṣāmeva navatī gopālasyārccanaṃ prati | 

nārada uvāca 
bālyaṃte kathayāmādya devasya paramādbhutaṃ | 
 
<pṛ0 47a> gopanīyaṃ na te kiṃcitvaṃ hi veda vidāmbara | 
tapasā kalmaṣa manāḥ kṛṣṇo bhakto'si niścayāt | 
tāraḥ prajāpatiḥ śakro māyā ca bindureva | 
etanmaṃtravaraṃ viddhi rahasyaṃ paramādbhutaṃ | 
mahācamatkārakaraṃ ripukṣobhaṇakārakaṃ | 
caturvargaphalaṃ cāsya japamātreṇa sidhyati | 
gopālasyāpi ye maṃtrā vakṣyaṃte'traiva taṃtrake | 
sadīpita manenaiva phalapradamavekṣyatāṃ | 
cūḍāmaṇirayaṃ prokto devasya śiśurūpiṇaḥ | 
ahaṃ muniḥ samākhyāto gāyattrīchanda ucyate | 
devatā kathitaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ sarvakāma phalapradaḥ | 
samāhāroccāraṇo'yaṃ madhyama svara īritaḥ | 
netrābdhitarka sūryyendraiḥ kālavarṇa vibheditaiḥ | 
yaṃtrāgāni manoḥ kṛtvā dhyānaṃ kuryyāt samāhitaḥ | 
mathurāyāṃ pure dhyāyet kaṃsasyāntaḥ purājire | 
sūtikā gṛha madhyasthaṃ jātamātraṃ jagatpatiṃ | 
sidha cāraṇa gandharva deva dānava kinnaraiḥ | 
yakṣa rākṣasa vetālaiḥ khecarairdikcarairapi | 
vidyādharībhirdevībhiḥ kinnarībhiḥ samaṃtataḥ | 
brahmaṇā tanayaiḥ sārddhaṃ vīkṣyamāṇaṃ mudānvitaiḥ | 
indrādibhiśca dikpālairlasat kusuma varṣaṇaiḥ | 
caturbhūjaṃ śaṃkha cakra gadā śāṃrgadharaṃ hariṃ | 
dakṣasyorddhe smareccakraṃ gadāṃ ca tadadhaḥ kare | 
vāmasyorddhe śāṃrga dhanuḥ śaṃkhaṃ ca tadadhaḥ kare | 
navīna jalada prakhyaṃ pītakauṣeya vāsasaṃ | 
vilasat kuṇḍalā bhoga bhāsvare nijamūrddhani | 
vihitā śeṣa sadratnaśobhi svarṇakirīṭakaṃ | 
sugandhi pārijātaiśca śobhitā śeṣa kuntalaṃ | 
lalāṭataṭavinyasta kastūrī tilakojjvalaṃ | 

<pṛ0 47ba> aṣṭamī candra śakala bhāla bhāla talojjvalaṃ | 
utphulla puṇḍarīka śrīnayanadvaya bhāsitaṃ | 
manobhava dhanuḥ kalpa cillī cāpa virājitaṃ | 
tila prasūna vijayi nāsā vaṃśa vibhūṣitaṃ | 
parārdhacandrasaṃkāśa mukha candra virājitaṃ | 
dāḍimī bījakundābha daṃtapaṃkti manoharaṃ | 
pakva bimbaphalodbhāsi daṃtavāsojjvalaṃ vibhuṃ | 
jāmbūnadānekaratna sphuranmakarakuṇḍalaṃ | 
mahāmarakatastambhabhāsamāna bhujot karaṃ | 
ratna cāmīkarā bhogairaṃgadairvalayairyutaṃ | 
kambugrīvaṃ mahoraskaṃ muktāhāra virājitaṃ | 
śrīvatsa lāṃchanaṃ bhrājata kaustubhojjavala vakṣasaṃ | 
ratnavaiduryya ghaṭita kiṃkiṇī jāla mālikaṃ | 
paṭṭasūtreṇa sannaddha madhyadeśopaśobhitaṃ | 
ratnamaṃjīrayugala maṃju śrīpādapallavaṃ | 
devakyā vasudevena hareṇa vidhinā tathā | 
vidikṣu tiṣṭatā stotra mukhe raṇa puṭāṃjaliṃ | 
meruśṛṃga pratīkāśaṃ garuḍopari saṃsthitaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā parātmānaṃ gurumātmānameva ca | 
ekībhāvena saṃbhāvya tataḥ pūjanamārabhet | 
karpūra mānitā lola sitacandana carccite | 
ālikheddevakīputra yaṃtraṃ śobhana rekhayā | 
śalākayā vaidrumayā tathā vāpi ca hemayā | 
kiṃjalkarūpakaṃ vṛttaṃ tato lekhyaṃ caturddalaṃ | 
tato vṛttaṃ cāṣṭadalaṃ likheddaśadalaṃ tataḥ | 
samarekhaṃ catuṣkoṇa caturdvāra suśobhitaṃ | 
bījaśobhi caturdvāre catuṣkoṇa virājitaṃ | 
madhye saṃpūjya deveśaṃ pūjayecca caturddale | 
aiśānyāmīśvaraṃ devamāgneyyāṃ ca pitāmahaṃ | 
nairṛtyāṃ vasudevaṃ vāyavyāmambikāmapi | 

<pṛ0 48a> tathā cāṣṭasu patreṣu pūjayeddevavallabhāḥ | 
raktāmbaradharāḥ saumyāḥ karāmbuja dhṛtāmbujāḥ | 
sarvālaṃkaraṇoddīptā lasad yauvana vibhramāḥ | 
śrīmaddevamukhāmbhoja nyasta netra madhuvratāḥ | 
tato daśadale pūjyā lokapālāstato bahiḥ | 
garuḍaṃ paścime dvāre jayaṃ pūrve prapūjayet | 
vijayaṃ dakṣiṇe tadvannāradaṃ ca tathottare | 
puṭāṃjalikarāḥ sarve sustotra mukharā api | 
vilasadvanamālāśca pītakauṣeya vāsasaḥ | 
tataḥ śaṃkhaṃ ca cakraṃ ca gadāṃ kaumadakīmapi | 
śāṃgaṃ dhenu ca saṃpūjya tadvāhye pūjayedapi | 
airāvatādīnabhyarccya gaṇānaṣṭau tato bahiḥ | 
kṛte lakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ tretāyāṃ dviguṇaṃ tathā | 
trilakṣaṃ dvāpare japtvā caturllakṣaṃ kalau japet | 
prayogānatha kurvīta sādhakaḥ siddhi lālasaḥ | 
lakṣmī prasūnairjuhuyāchriyamicchanna ninditāṃ | 
ājyenānena juhuyādānnasya samṛddhaye | 
āraṇyai kusumai viprān jātībhiḥ pṛthivīpatīn | 
prasūnai rasitairvaśyān śūdrānnīlotpalairapi | 
vaśe purlavarṇaiḥ sarvān paṃkajairvanitā janān | 
gośālā sukṛto homaḥ pāyasena sasarpiṣā | 
gavāṃ śāṃtiṃ karotyāśu govindo gokula priyaḥ | 
śiśuveśadharaṃ devaṃ kiṃkiṇī jālaśobhitaṃ | 
smṛtvā pratarpayen maṃtrī dugdha buddhyā śubhairjjalaiḥ | 
dhanaṃ dhānyāṃśukādīni prītastasmai dadāti saḥ | 
piṇḍaṃ mūlena vītaṃ dahana purayuge koṇa rājat ṣaḍarṇaṃ kuryyāt | padmaṃ daśārṇaṃ sphurita daśadalaṃ kāmabījena vītaṃ | 
padmaṃ kiṃjalkasaṃsthaṃ muravikṛti dala prollasat | 

<pṛ0 48ba> ṣoḍaśārṇaṃ kiṃjalka vyaṃjanāṭyaṃ vikṛti dalayugeṣvarpitānnaṣṭavarṇaṃ | 
pāśāṃkuśābhyāmāvītaṃ kṣauṇīpura yugānvitaṃ | 
aṣṭākṣareṇa saṃvītaṃ yaṃtraṃ govindadevataṃ | 
dharmmārtha kāma phaladaṃ sarva rakṣākaraṃ smṛtaṃ | 
pakṣāṃtako dharā saṃstho manubindu vibhūṣitaḥ | 
piṇḍa bījamidaṃ proktaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ paraṃ | 
caturlakṣaṃ japedetattaddaśāṃśaṃ hunettataḥ | 
tarpayettaddaśāṃśaṃ ca daśāṃśaṃ cābhiṣecayet | 
brāhmaṇān bhojayeccāpi daśāṃśamiti ca kramāt | 
gaṇeśaṃ bhāskaraṃ rudraṃ gaurīṃ ca paripūjayet | 
vidikṣu yaṃtrarājasya svasvamaṃtra puraḥsaraṃ | 
etaddhāraṇamātreṇa trikālajño bhavennaraḥ | 
yad yannijepsi sarvaṃ sādhayennātra saṃśayaḥ | 
anena sadṛśo maṃtro yaṃtraṃ cāpi na vidyate | 
kevalaṃ prema bhāvena kathitaṃ tava suvrata || 

[iti śrīgautamīye ṣoḍaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 16 || 

atha prayogān vakṣyāmi maṃtrayorubhayoḥ samān | 
yān kṛtvā sādhakavaralaukadvaya supūjitaḥ | 
tadātmakāri maṃtrān vai vakṣyāmi ca kvacit kvacit | 
vande taṃ devakīputraṃ sadyojātāmbuja prabhaṃ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma dhāriṇaṃ vana mālikaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā manuvaraṃ lakṣaṃ brāhme muhūrttake | 
japtvā medhāṃ parāṃ prāpya kavīnāmagraṇīrbhavet | 
athavā sphaṭikābhāsaṃ dvibhujaṃ lekha pustakaṃ | 
dhāriṇaṃ taṃ vicintyātha lakṣaṃ brāhmye muhūrttake | 
japtvā maṃtraṃ trikālajño bṛhaspati samo bhavet | 
atha vai tat samo maṃtraḥ procyate śṛṇu tattvataḥ | 
śrīmat padaṃ tathā coktā mukunda caraṇau tataḥ | 

<pṛ0 49a> sadeti śaraṇamahaṃ prapadye svāhayāyutaḥ śyāmalaṃ komalaṃ bālaṃ krīḍaṃtaṃ | 
māturaṃkake 
dvibhujaṃ stanapātāraṃ cittat śrutidharo bhavet | 
lakṣambā prajapedenaṃ samānaṃ labhate phalaṃ | 
kāmabījādya maṃtro'yaṃ kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale | 
upasaṃhṛta divyāṃgaṃ gurovanmāturaṃ kage(?) | 
calad goścaraṇaṃ bālaṃ dhyānādbrāhmye muhūrttake | 
japtvā manuvarau vidvān sarvaśāsrārthavidbhavet | 
sarvavedārthakuśalo jñānavān bhavati dhruvaṃ | 
nandāṃgane paryyaṭantaṃ dhūlī nicaya dhūṣaraṃ | 
pradīpta maṇigaṇoddīptaṃ yaśodā lokanotsukaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā manuvaraṃ japenniyamamāsthitaḥ | 
lakṣaika japa nādasya kiṃ na sādhyati bhūtale | 
prātaḥ prātaḥ pivettoyamaṣṭottaraśataṃ japan | 
anena mūko duṣṭārtho jaḍaḥ pāṣāṇavattathā | 
anena jalapānena sākṣādvākpatisannibhaḥ | 
jāyate nātra sandaihaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ na cānyathā | 
padbhyāṃ niḥkṣipya śakaṭaṃ rudaṃtaṃ prākṛtaṃ tathā | 
lakṣaṃ japyāditi dhyātvā āpadbhyomucyate dhruvaṃ | 
śatrubhyo na bhayaṃ tasya rājato dasyuto'pi vā | 
na tasya vidyate bhītiḥ kadācidapi suvrata | 
athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ surapūjitaṃ | 
yaja jñātvā sādhaka varaḥ prayoga phalamāpnuyāt | 
brahmāṇaṃ somasaṃyuktaṃ mūrddhiṇ svara vibhūṣitaṃ | 
bindunāda samākrāṃtaṃ kalparājaṃ samuddharet | 
evaṃ na vīti hotrasthaṃ mahāmāyā svarānvitaṃ | 
bindunāda samākrāṃtaṃ dvitīyaṃ bījamuddharet | 
vāṃ taṃ repha samāyuktaṃ caturthasvarabhūṣitaṃ | 
nādabindusamāyuktaṃ tṛtīyaṃ bījamuddharet | 

<pṛ0 49ba> thāntaṃ śambhu samāyuktaṃ indu bindu samanvitaṃ | 
daurgabījamiti khyātaṃ samastāpannivāraṇaṃ | 
śambhoḥ padaṃ vahniyutaṃ māyābindu samanvitaṃ | 
aśeṣa jagato bījaṃ mahāmāyeti viśrutaṃ | 
anayā yojito maṃtrī asādhyamapi sādhayet | 
vāṃ taṃ vahṇisamāyuktaṃ caturthasvara bhūṣitaṃ | 
śriyo bījamiti proktaṃ nṛṇāṃ sarvasukhapradaṃ | 
viriṃcīndra samāyuktaṃ caturthasvarabhūṣitaṃ | 
nādabindu kalākrātaṃ bījaṃ trailokyamohanaṃ | 
proktaṃ sāṃtākṣaraṃ tattu ṣaṣṭhasvara samanvitaṃ | 
nādabindu kalāyuktaṃ kurccabījamiti smṛtaṃ | 
eteṣāṃ bīja varṣyāṇāṃ jñātvā karmmāṇi maṃtravit | 
gurutaḥ śāstrataḥ samyak sarvakarmmāṇi sādhayet | 
anyathā naiva siddhiḥ syānmaṃtraḥ kalpaśatairapi | 
meruścaturddaśasvaraḥ adho vahni samanvitaḥ | 
nṛsiṃha bījamityuktaṃ bhūtāpasmāra nāśanaṃ | 
samāhita manā bhūtvā padmākṣaiḥ kṛtamālayā | 
ayutaikaṃ japen maṃtraṃ brahmacāri vraterataḥ | 
alpayāsena kāmāḥ syurdaridraśca na jāyate | 
sarve manorathāstasya sidhyantīti na saṃśayaḥ | 
nityaṃ karmmarataḥ kṛṣṇaṃ canya puṣpaiḥ samarccayet | 
vaśyā bhavaṃti sarve ca brāhmaṇā nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
gopāla veśaṃ manasā jātī puṣpaiḥ samarccayet | 
vaśyā bhavaṃti rājāno nātra kāryyā vicāraṇā | 
tameva raktapuṣpaistu vaiśyā vaśyā bhavaṃti hi | 
nīlotpalaiśca śūdrāḥ syurmmāṃsaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ samarccayet | 
juhuyādraktakusumairmmiśritaistilataṇḍulaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 50a> maṃtreṇāṣṭasahasraṃ tu japtvā bhasmadharedyatiḥ | 
lalāṭe vidhṛte tasya sarve ghaśyā bhavaṃti hi | 
anena ca śarīreṇa rājāno vaśatāmiyuḥ | 
striyo vaśyā bhavaṃ tasya putrāmātyāśca sarvathā | 
vivāhārthī japenmaṃtraṃ māsamaṣṭasahasrakaṃ | 
rāsamaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ dhyātvā vrate sthitaḥ | 
vivāhayeduttamāṃtāṃ ramyāṃ sarvakulojjvalāṃ | 
putraṃ me rakṣa rakṣeti dvijena prārthito hariḥ | 
hṛtaṃ putraṃ samāhṛtya dadau yastaṃ vicintayet | 
putrakāmo labhet putraṃ māsenaikena sundaraṃ | 
dīrghayurapratihata balavīryya samanvitaṃ | 
kundapuṣpaiḥ samārādhya kṛṣṇaṃ dhyāyecca kanyakā | 
māsadvayaṃ tathā maṃtraṃ japedaṣṭasahasrakaṃ | 
manoratha patiṃ labdhā dīrghakālaṃ ca krīḍati | 
aṃjanaṃ kusumaṃ vastraṃ tāmbūlaṃ candanaṃ tathā | 
anyānyānyupabhogāni spṛṣṭvā maṃtraṃ śataṃ japet | 
dīyate yasya yasyābhiso'cirāddāsavadvaśī | 
strīyo vaśyā anenaiva bhavaṃti munisattama | 
puruṣaṃ vaśayennārī anenaiva vidhānataḥ | 
annādyakāmaḥ śrīpuṣpaiḥ sitataṇḍūlamiśritaiḥ | 
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ tu juhuyādannavān bhavet | 
viśvarūpadharaṃ dhyātvā śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet | 
samāhita manāḥ śrīmān yaśasvī kīrtimān bhavet | 
pretabhūtapiśācāśca skandādigrahapīḍitaiḥ | 
pūtanāstanapātāraṃ dhyātvā maṃtraṃ śataṃ japet | 
praṇaśyaṃti grahā duṣṭāḥ palāyaṃta itastataḥ | 
sarpamaṇḍala daṃṣṭāśca mūṣikādyaiśca daṃśitān | 
kṛṣṇaṃ kālīya damanaṃ cintayitvā japennaraḥ | 

<pṛ0 50ba> tarjjayaṃtaṃ viṣaṃ ghoraṃ huṃkāreṇa vināśayet | 
atrāpyanyomatra krūṃca bījadyaṃ śṛṇu tattvataḥ | 
kālīyasya phaṇā madhye dinyaṃ nṛtyaṃ karoti ca | 
namāmi daivakīputraṃ nṛtyarājānanacyutaṃ | 
jvarārtto'bhyarccayenmaṃtrī japedaṣṭaśataṃ tathā | 
jvareṇa saṃstutaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ bala pradyumnasaṃyutaṃ | 
dahaṃtaṃ vāṇanagarīṃ garuḍo़pari saṃsthitaṃ | 
nija jvareṇa saṃpiṣṭaṃ dhyātvā nāśayati kṣaṇāt | 
śītalā kāmalādīni tathā cāturthakodbhavān | 
plīhagulmayakṛdvāyu apasmāra bhavaṃ tathā | 
nāśayennātra sandeho dṛṣṭimātreṇa maṃtrikaḥ | 
gopālaṃ yaṣṭipāśaṃ ca dhenumādāya saṃsthitaṃ | 
dhyātvā kṛṣṇaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ patryumānsa tu māsataḥ | 
rājñaḥ purodhā bhavitumiti yasyamatirbhavet | 
madhusiktaiḥ sitaiḥ puṣpairhutvā tanmaṇḍalāllabhet | 
mahaiśvaryyamatha prāpya viśvakhyāto bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
govarddhanadharaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ dhyātvā maṃtraṃ japennaraḥ | 
vātavarṣādibhirghorairbhaye samyagupasthite | 
bhayamāśu vinaśyeta nātra kāryyā vicāraṇā | 
vṛndāvanagataṃ kṛṣṇāṃ vṛṣṭikāmo vicintayan | 
japedaṣṭasahasraṃ tu vṛṣṭimāpnotya saṃśayaṃ | 
evaṃ ca manasā dhyātvā vṛṣṭiṃ varṣāṣu cārahet | 
evaṃ jalāśaye dhyātvā japedaṣṭasahasrakaṃ | 
vṛṣṭirbhavatyakāle'pi mahatī nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
gāyaṃtaṃ veṇunā kṛṣṇaṃ gāna kāmo vicintayan | 
ājyamaṣṭaśataṃ hutvā kinnaraiḥ saha gīyate | 
jaya kāmo japedyastu haraṃtaṃ kalpakadrumaṃ | 
saṃstutaṃ devatābhistu garuḍārūḍhamacyutaṃ | 
dhyātvā raktakaravīrasamidbhirjuhuyādvaśī | 

<pṛ0 51a> aṣṭottarasahasraṃ tu pakṣāt parājito ripuḥ | 
rājādi bhayamāpanne saṃśayairddurgasaṃsadi | 
hutvā daśasahasraṃ tu tatkṣaṇannāśayed dhruvaṃ | 
nīlotpalādibhiḥ puṣpairaṣṭottarasahasrakaṃ | 
śaṃkhādinidhisaṃyuktaṃ dvārakāmadhyagaṃ hariṃ | 
dhyātvā taṇḍūla dūrvābhirhutvā śāṃtikamāharet | 
kadambamūle gāyaṃtaṃ gopālaṃ vanamālinaṃ | 
kadambapuṣpaiḥ saṃspṛṣṭaṃ cintayitvā janārddanaṃ | 
apāmārgaśatairhutvā japedaṣṭasahasrakaṃ | 
sarvān kāmān vaśīkṛtya āśu vijño bhavatyapi | 
rājadvāre sabhāyāṃ ca vyavahāre ca maṃtravit | 
maṃtramaṣṭaśataṃ japtvā prathamaṃ vākyamuccaret | 
anenaiva vidhānena sarvatra vijayī bhavet | 
mokṣakāmo japedyastu puṇḍarīkākṣamavyayaṃ | 
sanakādyaiḥ stutaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ śuklāmbaradharaṃ parāṃ | 
śaṃkha cakra dharaṃ dhyātvā maṃtraṃ lakṣaṃ japennaraḥ | 
tārābhyāṃ puṭitaṃ kṛtvā vidhivat sthānamāśritaḥ | 
cakrābjamaṇḍale kṛṣṇaṃ pūjayan bhaktimāvahan | 
saṃsārasāgarāt sābhyāmucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
yadṛcchedbrāhmaṇo maṃtrī vaśīkarttuṃ jagatrayaṃ | 
vanyairmmanoharaiḥ puṣpairvenuṃ gāyaṃtamacyutaṃ | 
dhyātvā saṃpūjya vidhivallakṣamekaṃ sahomakaṃ | 
japtvā samastalokānāṃ priyo bhavati nānyathā | 
daivopamaṃ sukhaṃ bhuktā yāti viṣṇuṃ tanuṃ dvija | 
arccayenmānasā kṛṣṇaṃ sahasraṃ pratyahaṃ japet | 
vatsarāllabhate mokṣa yajña jñātvā na nivarttate | 
varṇināṃ ca gṛhasthānāṃ nyāsināmapyayaṃ vidhiḥ | 
medhā kāmohunedagnau pālāśairājyamiśritaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 51ba> samidbhiḥ pūrvavaddhyātvā medhā syādati mānuṣī | 
vācamicchellabhedvācaṃ brāhme japtvā muhūrttake | 
śataṃ śataṃ ca ṣaṇmāsaṃ vāgmī cāpi sudhīrbhavet | 
śatrūṇāṃ jaya kāmastu pārijāta haraṃ hariṃ | 
garuḍārohaṇaṃ dhyātvā jitā śeṣa divaukasaṃ | 
samidbhiścāpi juhuyāt karavīra samudbhavaiḥ | 
lakṣaṃ japtvā tathā lakṣaṃ juhuyānmaṃtravittamaḥ | 
jitvā śatru gaṇānetān nākrāṃtāṃśca yathāvidhi | 
pratiṣṭhāṃ kārayed yastu bhagavaṃtaṃ vicintya ca | 
śaṃkha padma nidhi yuktaṃ vasaṃtaṃ dvārakāṃ purīṃ | 
dhyātvā tilājya karaṇān juhuyāt sita taṇḍulān | 
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ vai pratiṣṭhāṃ labhate dhruvaṃ | 
sarvāṃllokān vaśīkarttuṃ kāmayam paṃkajāsane | 
kadamba mālayā nityaṃ bhagavaṃtamalaṃkṛtaṃ | 
sanakādyaiḥ prārthyamānaṃ yogibhirgopaveśakaṃ | 
vicitra puṣpamālābhirbhūṣitaṃ vanamālayā | 
kadambamūle gāyaṃtaṃ cintayet sarvanāyakaṃ | 
samiddhirapyayāmārgairaṣṭottarasahasrakaṃ | 
madhvājyayuktai juhuyāt sarvaloka vaśī bhavet | 
mumukṣubhirbhagavaṃtaṃ puṇḍarīka dale kṣaṇaṃ | 
sanakādyaiścintyamānaṃ siddhairanyaiśca yogibhiḥ | 
brahmendra śaṃkara mukhairgaṇaiścāpi divaukasāṃ | 
prahlādaṃ pramukhairbhaktairanyaiścāpi mahātmabhiḥ | 
hūtapadmakarṇikottuṃga divyasiṃhāsanopari | 
dhyātvaivaṃ paramātmānaṃ yaśodānandavarddhanaṃ | 
palāśatulasīpatraiḥ sauvarṇakusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ | 
mānasairvā yathāśaktyā arccayet puruṣottamaṃ | 
ātmānaṃ daivakīputraṃ līlā yaṣṭidharaṃ smaret | 
yad yat kāmayate maṃtrī tattadāprotya yatrataḥ | 

<pṛ0 52a> anena vidhinā sarvaṃ sādhayet paramātmanaḥ | 
yojayecca caturthena viṣṇoścaiva buddhimān | 
tṛtīyamaṣṭamaṃ vidyādbrahmaṇā viṣṇunā saha || 

[iti śrīgautamīye saptadaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 17 ||

athāparān pravakṣyāmi prayogān bhuvi durllabhān | 
yat kṛtvā mānavaḥ samyak sadyo devatva mṛcchamā |
sādhyaṃ vidyate tasya bhuvi svarge rasātale | 
niśīta śaranibhinnaṃ bhīṣmatāpa haraṃ hariṃ | 
dṛṣṭvā pīyūṣa varṣiṇyā kāruṇyāttaṃ vilokayan | 
evaṃ dhyātvā yuta jāpādasādhya jvaranāśanaṃ | 
mūrchā dāha gadā sphoṭa viṣa kīṭa samudbhavaṃ | 
nāśayeddāhamatvirād amṛtāṃ śāṃśato hutet | 
kāśīrājena prahitāṃ kṛtyāṃ tāṃ dvārakāpurīṃ | 
nijāriṇā tāṃ chitvā tattat purīṃ cakra tejasā | 
dahaṃtaṃ taṃ hariṃ smṛtvā japedayutamādarāt | 
svasnehāktaiḥ saptaryaiśca hunedrātro tathā yutaṃ | 
kṛtyāḥ pareritāstīntu na grasaṃti kadācana | 
ḍākinī pūjanā kṛtyā yakṣa pannaga rākṣasāḥ | 
anye vai krūra satvāśca prayogājjapahomayaḥ | 
deśāddeśāṃtaraṃ yāṃti na samarthāśca hiṃsituṃ | 
dhyātvā viśveśvare devaṃ vyāpti viśvāvakāśakaṃ | 
sūryyakoṭi pratīkāśaṃ candrakoṭī suśītalaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā ca matimān lakṣamekaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
juhuyādayutaṃ bhaktyā śatavīryyaṃ kurannikaiḥ | 
dūrvā yasya khyātiḥ akālamṛtyu nāśāya satyemetat paraṃ padaṃ |
mṛtyujayaṃ hariṃ dhyātvā sarvapāpairvimucyate |
āsīnamāśrame divye vadarīṣaṇḍamaṇḍite || 

<pṛ0 52ba> spṛśan vṛhadbhyāṃ hastābhyāṃ ghaṃṭā karṇa kalevaraṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japenmāsamaṣṭottarasahasrakaṃ | 
samasta vipadāṃ maṃtrī praśamāya śamāya ca | 
samatā sarvabhūteṣu āśu nirvāṇa dāyakaṃ | 
viśīthe rathamārūḍhaṃ tarjjayaṃtaṃ muhurmuhuḥ | 
dhāvamānaṃ ripugaṇaṃ anudhāvanamacyutaṃ | 
visṛjadvāṇasaṃghena nayaṃtaṃ dūradeśataḥ | 
udghāṭanaṃ bhavet sadyoripūrṇā lakṣa jāpataḥ | 
dveṣayaṃtaṃ rukmi valau pāṇḍya madhya sthitaṃ hariṃ | 
dhyātvā lakṣaṃ manu varaṃ nisvapneha vimiśritaṃ | 
tailenetyarthaḥ | 
tadaṃte juhuyānmaṃtrī gulikā gomayadbhavāḥ | 
evaṃ prayogamātreṇa vairasyaṃ jāyate mithaḥ | 
anyonya kalahe naiva deśāddeśāṃtaraṃ vrajet | 
vidviṣṭastatra tatrāpi kākavat paryyaṭenmahīṃ | 
pārśve diśaṃtaṃ gītārthaṃ rathasthaṃ madhusūdanaṃ | 
rājamaṇḍalamadhyasthaṃ candrāyuta samaprabhaṃ | 
dhyātvā yutaṃ manuvaraṃ śamāya prajapet sudhīḥ | 
anena japamātreṇa kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale | 
sthāne hṛṣīkeśa tavetyādi cārjjuna vārṣakaṃ | 
gāyatrīchandovalitaṃ viśvātmā viśvadaivataṃ | 
saparyyā pūrvavat proktā sādhayet sakalepsitaṃ | 
śrībījādyairjjapenmaṃtro varau dhyātvā ca pūrvavat | 
lakṣaika japamātreṇa kubera khamodate | 
annadaivata gopālaṃ vakṣye'nyaṃ śrṛṇu tattvataḥ | 
annarūpa rasarūpa tuṣṭirūpa padopari | annādhipataye svāhā | 
so'yamatrādhipo manuḥ śrībījādyo manuḥ prokto'tra ratnasamṛddhidāḥ ācakrādyaṃga kḷptiḥ syānnārado'sya muniḥ smṛtaḥ gāyatrī chanda ityuktaṃ devaścānnaprado hariḥ | 

<pṛ0 53a> dhyānārccanādikaṃ sarvamasya pūrvavadācaret | 
ya evaṃ ciṃtayenmaṃtrī sa tu sarvasamṛddhimān | 
āhṛtya svarṇapātraṃ ca kṣālitaṃ śuddha vāriṇā | 
vilipya gandhapaṃkena likhedaṣṭadalāmbujaṃ |
karṇikāyāṃ likhedvahneḥ puṭitaṃ maṇḍala dvayaṃ |
dvivahnipuṭitaṃ ṣaṭkoṇamityarthaḥ | 
tanmadhye vilikhet kāmaṃ sādhyākhyaṃ karmmasaṃyutaṃ | 
tata iṣṭairmmanorvarṇaistata kāmaṃ veṣṭayet sudhīḥ | 
śriyaṃ ṣaṭkoṇakoṇānāmaindranaiṛta vāyuṣu | 
ālikhecca likhenmāyāṃ vahṇi varuṇa śūliṣu | 
akṣaraiḥ kāma gāyatryā veṣṭayet keśareṣu ca | 
māramālāmanorvarṇairddaleṣvaṣṭaṣu maṃtravit | 
likhed guhāntarairvarṇairmmātṛkāṃ tadvahirllikhet | 
bhūbimbaṃ ca likhedvāhye śrīmāye digvidikṣvapi |
maṃtraṃ mevaṃ samālikhya jātarūpamaye taṭe | 
rājate tāmrapātre vā bhūrjje kṣaumamaye'pi vā | 
sūkṣmataṃtu maye vāpi pratiṣṭāpya samīraṇaṃ | 
ākarṣaṇaṃ surastrīṇāṃ nāgaloka vilāsinīṃ | 
piśāca yakṣa rakṣāṃsi krūragrahāśca ye sthitāḥ | 
duṣṭa satvāśca ye sarve pari sarpaṃti bhūtale | 
yaṃtrarāja dharaṃ dṛṣṭvā vidravaṃti drasaṃti ca | 
bahunā kimihāktena sarvaloke sukhāvahaṃ | 
strīṇāmākarṣaṇaṃ rājñāṃ lokavaśyakaraṃ bhūvi |
yoga siddhikaraṃ puṃsāṃ bhavasāgaratārakaṃ | 
bhukti mukti karaṃ yaṃtramiti proktaṃ svayambhuvā | 
vāṃtaṃ yāṃtaṃ samārūḍhaṃ māyābindu vibhūṣitaṃ | 
śriyo bījamiti proktaṃ nṛṇāṃ sadyaḥ sukhapradaṃ | 
ādau klīṃkāramuccāryya kāmadeva padaṃ vadet | 
āyāṃtaṃ vidmahe puṣpaṃ bāṇāyeti padaṃ tathā | 

<pṛ0 53ba> dhīmahīti padaṃ proktā tatro'naṃga pracodayāt | 
eṣā manmatha gāyatrī proktā manmatha dīpanī | 
kāmaṃ nāḍī ca saṃbhāvya tataḥ kāmapadaṃ vadet | 
devāyeti padaṃ brūyāttathā sarvajanaṃ padaṃ | 
priyāyeti padāṃte ca vadet sarvajanaṃ punaḥ | 
brūyāt sanmohanāyeti jvalaśabdaṃ ca vīpsayet | 
prajvaleti padaṃ sarva janasya hṛdayaṃ tathā | 
uktvā mama vaśaṃ paścāt kuru śabdaṃ ca vīpsayet | 
vahnijāyāṃ tathetyuktā mālākhyā maṃtyatho manuḥ | 
bhūgṛhaṃ caturasraṃ syādaṣṭavajra vibhūṣitaṃ | 
asmin maṃtre samāvahya vāsudevaṃ jagadguruṃ | 
kiṃ na sidhyati maṃtrajño yat kathyaṃ kathitaṃ ca te | 
evaṃ te kathitaṃ yaṃtraṃ prayogāṃtamihocyate | 
lakṣaṃ japtvā palāśānāṃ kusumaistatsamaṃ hunet | 
vyākhyātā sarvaśāstrāṇāṃ acirādeva jāyate | 
sa yogī sa ca vijñānī viṣṇu yogī tathātmavit | 
śuklavastrasya lābhāya śuklādi puṣpamāhunet | 
aṣṭottaraśataṃ kṛtvā rājato vānyato labhet | 
muṃcaṃtau pitarau kṛṣṇaṃ mathurā nirddatārdditau | 
dhyātvā yuta japāṃte ca tāvat saṃkhyaṃ ca homayet | 
nigaḍānmucyate sadyo yamuddiśya kṛtvā kriyā | 
purandara mukhairddevaiḥ sthitaṃ vṛndāvanaṃ hariṃ | 
surabhyāḥ payasā toyairabhiṣicya saṃstutaṃ | 
rājarājeśvaraṃ kṛtvā maṃgalācāra pūrvakaṃ | 
ūrvvaśī pramukhābhistu svarveśyābhiradhiṣṭhitaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japellakṣaṃ paṃkajairayutaṃ hunet | 
sārvabhaumo bhavet so'pi yeneyaṃ vihitā kriyā | 
ātmānaṃ kaṃsamathanaṃ ripuṃ kaṃsātmakaṃ smaran | 

<pṛ0 54a> niśīthe prajapenmaṃtrī dakṣiṇāmukha saṃsthitaḥ | 
lakṣamekaṃ japāṃte tu vāṇīrataratarpaṇaiḥ | 
ayutaṃ homamātreṇa mriyate'rirna cānyathā | 
ariṣṭapalakṣaṃ tat pādapāṃśuna īkṣitaṃ | 
haraṇāmmriyate śatraḥ śaṃkareṇāpi rakṣitaḥ | 
ariṣṭadalakārpāsa vyomāsthikaṇasaṃyutaṃ | 
haraṇāllakṣamātreṇa yadi bhūrasthito bhavet | 
api pīyuṣa sevī ca mriyate'rirna cānyathā | 
haridrāgraṃthi homena stambhaye daridrāgraṃthi homena stambhayedarivāhinīṃ | 
na śastaṃ maraṇaṃ karmma kadācidvaiṣṇave manau | 
krūraṃ krūrāśayaṃ kaṣṭamāyinaṃ ca satāmapi | 
īdṛgvidhaṃ janaṃ prāppa abhicārāya yojayet | 
prāyaścitāya gāyatrīṃ laṃkṣaṃ japtvā ca sādhakaḥ | 
tadaṃte pāyasairmmaṃtrī ayutaṃ homamācaret | 
api prayoga karttṛṇāṃ śāṃtiḥ syānnaiva cānyathā || 

[iti śrīgautamīye'ṣṭādaśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 18 ||

karmmāṃtaramatho vakṣye śṛṇuṣvāvahito'nagha | 
yaṃ kṛtvā mandabhāgyo'pi labhenmaṃtra phalāni vai | 
praṇavadvayamadhyasthaṃ japedyutasaṃkhyayā | 
trirātra japa mātreṇa vṛhaspati samo bhavet | 
vyākhyātā sarvaśāstrāṇāṃ vedānāmapi jāyate | 
śanivāre'śvaśya vṛkṣamālabhyāṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ | 
bhūyo bhūyo bhavecchāṃtirjjīvedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ | 
tasya śāṃtirbhavena nyūnaṃ yamuddiśya kṛtā kriyā | 
āśukairarccayet kṛṣṇaṃ māsamātraṃ tu nirmmalaiḥ | 
mucyate malinaiḥ kṛcchraiḥ pāpairghoratarairapi | 
paṭṭavastre yajedbhaktyā saṃpatti maṇḍalāṃ bhavet | 
vikramaiḥ pūjayan kṛṣṇaṃ trailokyaṃ vaśamānayet | 

<pṛ0 54ba> māṇikyaiḥ pūjayan bhaktyā sarve bhauma samo bhavet |
ṣadmarāgairyajet kṛṣṇaṃ rājā bhavati niścayaṃ |
kṣatriyaḥ sārvabhaumaḥ syāt sādhayet sakalāṃ mahīṃ | 
gārutmatamayai ratnaiḥ pūjayan jñānavān bhavet | 
api hīrakaratnena pūjayan kiṃ na sādhayet | 
suvarṇapuṣpairabhyarccya māsabhakti parāyaṇaṃ | 
kubera sama sampattiṃ saṃprāpya modate ciraṃ | 
dehāṃte haritāṃ prāpya nirvāṇa pada mṛcchati | 
ravivāre'rkapuṣpaiśca kahlāraiḥ somavārake | 
maṃgale raktapuṣpaiśca budhe tagara sambhavaiḥ | 
campakairguruvāre tu śukte mukunda sambhavaiḥ | 
śanivāre śamīpuṣpaiḥ pūjayedbhaktito yatiḥ | 
ravivāre ghṛtātraṃ tu payo'bhyaktaṃ nivedayet | 
somavāre piṣṭakādi sitayā saha yojayet | 
maṃgale guḍasaṃmiśraṃ annaṃ bahuguṇānvitaṃ | 
budhavāre yāvakaṃ tu gurave pūpasambhavaiḥ | 
dugdhānnaṃ śukravāre tu śanau saghṛtapāyasaṃ | 
vaiśākhe māsi vidhivat tarpayeddhimavajjalaiḥ | 
jyaiṣṭhe māsi prayatnena phalaiḥ saṃpūjayeddhariṃ | 
āṣāḍhe bhāsi vidhivat pavitraiḥ pūjayedvibhuṃ | 
ekaikaṃ svarṇasūtrāṇi graṃthi yuktāni kārayet | 
athavā paṭṭasūtrāṇi padmasūtrāṇi vā punaḥ | 
pūjāṃte deva devāya mahiṣībhyo nivedayet | 
mithunebhyastathā dattvā mahāṃtamutasavaṃ caret | 
toṣayedbhakṣabhojyaistu brāhmaṇān saṃśita bratān | 
evaṃ samvatsare maṃtrī kṛtvābhīṣṭamavāpnuyāt | 
natredvarṣa kṛtā pūjā vāstorbhakṣaya kalpate | 
śrāvaṇe māsi kṛṣṇaṃ taṃ pūjayet ketakodbhavaiḥ | 
candra candana kastūrī kuṃkumādi suvāsitaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 55a> elālavaṃga kakkola phalāni bahudhārpayet | 
bhādre māsi yajet kṛṣṇaṃ bhakṣairbahurguṇānvitaiḥ | 
iṣe māsi yajedbhaktyā bhakṣairbhojyaiḥ suvistaraiḥ | 
kārpāsanirmmitairvastrairnānābharaṇasaṃyutaiḥ | 
tulāsthe bhāskare kṛṣṇaṃ pūjayenmāsamātrakam | 
rātrau pradīpairhome (* * * * * * * * *) |
ghṛtadīpamavicchinnaṃ dadyānmāsaṃ mahojjvalaṃ | 
ekādaśyāmupoṣyaiva dvādaśyāṃ pāraṇā dine | 
śuklāyāṃ viṣṇumabhyarccyeṭvastrālaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ | 
asyāntithau ca matimān varṣatotasavamācaret | 
bhojyāni bahubhakṣyāṇi brāhmaṇebhyo nivaidayet | 
evaṃ kṛte devatāsya tuṣṭā ceṣṭaṃ prayacchati | 
saṃtalokamavāpnoti punarāvṛttivarjjitaṃ | 
mārgaśīrṣe yajeddevaṃ navānnairghyaṃ janaiḥ śubhaiḥ | 
nyarikela phalakṣodaṃ miśritaṃ guḍajīrakaiḥ | 
srehapakvaṃ ca devāya bhaktyā tasmai nivedayet | 
pauṣe māsi ca māṣaṃ vai pūtapūpaiḥ prapūjayet | 
māghe māsi yajet kṛṣṇamakṣataiḥ suśubhaiḥ sitaiḥ | 
dugdhārthaṃ śarkarāyuktaṃ miṣṭānnaṃ ca nivedayet | 
asminmāsi śubhadine vastreṇāchādayedvibhuṃ | 
phālguṇe devakīputraṃ pūjayet svarṇapuṣpakaiḥ | 
cūta(ghṛta>saugandhikusumairdhūpairdīpaiḥ suvistaraiḥ | 
caitre māsi vāsudevaṃ sarva puṣpaiḥ samarccayet | 
paurṇamāsyāṃ yajedbhaktyā madanaiśca sagucchakaiḥ | 
asmin dine ratiṃ kāmaṃ pūjayedbhaktitatparaḥ | 
na cet sāmvatsarī pūjā vṛthā bhavati niścitam || 

<pṛ0 55ba> bhasmībhūtaṃ smaraṃ dṛṣṭvā ruditāsya ratiḥ satī | 
tāṃ dṛṣṭvā kṛpayā viṣṭovaraṃ dātu svayaṃ śivaḥ | 
pratyuvāca ratistviyaṃ subhagatvamavāpnuyāt | 
sundaraḥ sarvalokeṣu krīḍārthaṃ vrajasundari | 
tato'bhavat krandajavalāt puṣpaṃ madanakaṃ śubhaṃ | 
tena pūjanamātreṇa samvatsara phalaṃ labhet | 
homayellakṣamātraṃ yaḥ piṣṭakairghṛtabharjjitaiḥ | 
tāvat saṃkhyaṃ manuṃ japtvā kṛṣṇaṃ paśyati maṃtravit | 
iti te kathitaṃ samyak pūjanaṃ vārṣikodbhavaiḥ | 
kṛtvānena vidhānena kiṃ na sādhyati bhūtale | 
puṇyastriyo gṛhasthāśca munayo brahmacāriṇaḥ | 
vanasthāśca tathā kṛtvā vāṃchitaṃ prāpnuyaḥ kṣaṇāt | 
striyaḥ śūdrāśca vidhivat kṛtvā phalamavāpnuyaḥ | 
iha bhuktā varān bhogān na bhūyo bhava sambhavaḥ | 
evaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ yajan bhaktyā yatkṛtaṃ janmakoṭibhiḥ | 
tat pāpairna vilipyeta padmapatra mivāmbhasā || 

[iti śrīgautamīye ūnaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 19 ||

gautama uvāca 
vistareṇa mama brahman kṛṣṇamaṃtrān bravīhi māṃ | 
bhakto'haṃ tava śiṣyo'haṃ yogyo'smi śravaṇe guro | 

nārada uvāca 
śrṛṇu brahman kṛṣṇamaṃtrān sarvadevaika sammatān | 
yadeka jñānamātreṇa punarjjanma na vidyate | 
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya namastadanucoccaret | 
kaustubhāyeti saṃprocya manuraṣṭākṣaraḥ paraḥ | 
etadvijñānamātreṇa sākṣādviṣṇurbhavedyatiḥ | 
ṣaḍadīrghasvarasaṃbhedya kāmenāṃga kriyāmatā | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ śaṃkha cakra gadāmbujaṃ | 
aneka ratnasaṃchannaṃ kaustubhodbhāsi vakṣasaṃ | 

<pṛ0 56a> tāra hārāvalīramyaṃ garuḍopari saṃsthitaṃ | 
dhyātvaivaṃ paramānandaṃ daśalakṣaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
homayettaddaśāṃśena sādhitairyūṣapāyasaiḥ | 
puraścaraṇamaṃgaṃ yaccheṣamanyat samāpayet | 
ya enaṃ bhajate maṃtrī bhogamokṣaikakāraṇaṃ | 
kara praceyāḥ sarvārthā aṃte tat paramaṃ vrajet | 
daśākṣara samānaṃ hi pūjanaṃ samudīritaṃ | 
athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi ṣaḍvarṇaṃ maṃtrarājakaṃ | 
yasya vijñānamātreṇa jīvanmukto mahīṃcaret | 
trimātraṃ namasāyuktaṃ caturthyā kṛṣṇā ityapi | 
ṣaḍakṣara manuḥ prokto dṛṣṭādṛṣṭa phalapradaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ prokto gāyattrī chanda ucyate | 
kṛṣṇo'pi devatā sākṣād durgādhiṣṭhātṛ devatā | 
vimātraṃ bījamityuktaṃ namaḥ śakti rudīritā | 
kṛṣṇāya kīlakaṃ cāsya maṃtrarājasya kīrttitaṃ | 
viniyogo'sya maṃtrasya puruṣārtha catuṣṭayaṃ | 
paṃcāṃgāni manorasya ācakrādyairurdaryyate | 
nīlajīmutasaṃkāśaṃ kiṃkinī jālamālinaṃ | 
sarvābharaṇasaṃdīptaṃ raktapadmopari sthitaṃ | 
sanakādyairmmunivaraiḥ stutaṃ dhyāyeddigambaraṃ | 
ālola kuṇḍalodbhasi mukhacandra virājitaṃ | 
śaśaraktādharaṃ rakta pāṇipādavirājitaṃ | 
karābhyāṃ pāyasaṃ ślakṣṇa sadyohaiyaṃgatīyakaṃ | 
dadhataṃ ciṃtayeddevaṃ bhogamokṣa phalapradaṃ | 
dhyātvaivaṃ paramātmānaṃ daśalakṣaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
japāṃte pāyasaiḥ śuddhai semaṃ kuryyāt saśarkaraiḥ | 
tarpayettaddaśāṃśena jalaiḥ karpūra vāsitaiḥ | 
abhiṣekaṃ daśāṃśena daśāṃśairviprabhojanaṃ | 
tadaṃte dakṣiṇāṃ dattvā sādhayeddhitamātmanaḥ | 
bhikṣāhāro japenmaṃtraṃ varṣamekaṃ vrato sthitaḥ | 

<pṛ0 56ba> kavirvāgmīsamṛddhaśca sarvajño jāyate dhruvaṃ | 
javanītāśanaṃ devaṃ dhyātvā lakṣajapāt sudhīḥ | 
divyajñānamavāpnoti trilokīṃ prāpya modate | 
ya evaṃ maṃtrarājaṃ tu bhajate bhaktitatparaḥ | 
iha bhuktā varān bhogān dehāṃte paramaṃ viśot | 
athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi ṣoḍaśārṇaṃ mahāmanuṃ | 
yasya vijñānamātreṇa kṛṣṇātma paramaṃ viśet | 
praṇavaṃ manasāyuktaṃ kṛṣṇā govindakau tathā | 
śrīpūrvaṃ ṅentamuccāryya huṃ phaṭ svāheti kīrtitaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktaśchando'nuṣṭavudāhṛtaṃ | 
paramātmā harirddevo bhukti mukti phalapradaḥ | 
daśārṇaka ca devāsya japa homau prakīrttitau | 
prayogastatsamaḥ prokto bījaśaktī ca tat same | 
ya enaṃ cintayenmaṃtraṃ so'dhīte śruti catuṣṭayaṃ | 
anena sadṛśo maṃtro jagatsvapi na vidyate | 
anenārādhitaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ prasīdatyeva tatkṣaṇāt | 
atha saṃttāna saṃsiddhyaivāladaṃ maṃtranāyakaṃ | 
yasya vijñānamātreṇa maṃtrāḥ sidhyaṃti maṃtriṇaḥ | 
devakīputra śabdāṃto govinda padamīrayet | 
vāsudeva padāṃte tu tato brūyājjagadguro | 
dehi me tanayaṃ deva tvāmahaṃ padamīrayet | 
śaraṇaṃgata ityuktā manuścānuṣṭubhāvyayaḥ | 
nārado'sya ṛṣiśchando gāyatrī kathitaṃ budhaiḥ | 
santānado hariḥ sākṣāddevatā ca prakīrtyate | 
vāstaiḥ samastairaṃgāni kṛtvā devaṃ viciṃtayet | 
nīlotpaladala śyāmaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
caturbhujaṃ śaṃkha cakramūrddhapāṇidvaye sthitaṃ | 
adhaḥ pāṇidvaye veṇuṃ vādayaṃtaṃ mudānvitaṃ | 

<pṛ0 57a> anekaratna sannaddha kirīṭojjvalavigrahaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ garuḍopari saṃsthitaṃ | 
vedastotraṃ paṭhennityaṃ munibhiḥ pariveṣṭitaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvārccayet kṛṣṇa paṃcāṃgaḥ paramāvṛttiḥ | 
indrādibhirdvitīyā syāt tṛtīyā tu tadāyudhaiḥ | 
evamabhyarccya deveśaṃ lakṣamātraṃ japen manuṃ | 
putrajīvendhanacite tatphalairayutaṃ hunet | 
anaṃtaraṃ daśāṃśen tarpaṇādīni cācaret | 
ya evaṃ prabhajenmaṃtrī saṃtānākhyaṃ mahāmanuṃ | 
putrapautrervinasyeta dehānte paramaṃ brajet | 
avicchinnaṃ bhavedvaṃśaṃ yāvadāhuta saṃplavaṃ | 
daśabhyāṃ śuklapakṣe tu niśīthe svasti maṇḍale | 
harimāvāhya vidhivat pūjayedupacārakaiḥ | 
evamarccanamātreṇa vatsarāt putravān gṛhī | 
dīrghāyurapratihata balavīryya samanvitaṃ | 
vatsarāllabhate putraṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ mayoditaṃ | 
yasyārthe kurute maṃtrī prayogaṃ saptaputravān | 
bandhyā'pi labhate putrān śatahāyana jīvitān | 
prāptavācaṃ yamānārī bodhi drumadale jalaṃ | 
maṃtrayitvāṣṭottaraśataṃ pivet putrī yati dhruvaṃ | 
evaṃ prayogamāśaṃsettanayaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ | 
anena maṃtritaṃ tvājyaṃ putrasiddhi karaṃ paraṃ | 
anena jalapānena bandhyā varṣāllabhet prajāṃ || 

[iti gautamīye viṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 20 ||

gautama uvāca 
sarvaṃ jānāmi tvaṃ vidvan svayambhū saduśa prabho | 
tvadudīritamākarṇya kṛtārtho'haṃ na cānyathā | 
tapastaptvā purā brahman prārthito harimīśvaraḥ | 
tenaivoktaṃ na cedainaṃ kathitavyamakhaṇḍitaṃ | 
tadārabhya purā brahman tava darśana lālasaḥ | 
gaṃgo pravāhaṇaṃ maṃtraṃ śrottumicchāmi tattvataḥ | 

<pṛ0 57ba> nārada uvāca 
bahavaḥ kathitā maṃtrā mayā te munisattama | 
tanmaṃtraṃ kathayāmādya yena jñānaṃ prasīdati || 
yasya vijñānamātrena bhaktiḥ syāt pema lakṣaṇā | 
caturvidhaṃ ca pāṇḍityaṃ jñānamātreṇa sidhyati | 
mandabhāyodariśe'pi śaṭho mūḍho'ti pātakī | 
upāsya maṃtrarājaṃ tu vāgīśa sumatāṃ vrajet | 
mayāpyevaṃ purāpṛṣṭaṃ padmayoniryathāvadat | 
tathā te kathayiṣyāmi guhyadguhyataraṃ mune | 
dvāviśandakṣaro maṃtro vāgīśatvapavarttakaḥ | 
sarvataṃtreṣu gupto'yaṃ gopanīyastvayā mune | 
vedaḥ prādurabhūdasye maṃtreṇānena vedhasaḥ | 
kavīndra tvaṃ bhārgavaśca vāgīśatvaṃ bṛhaspatiḥ | 
śriyamiṃtrādayo devā jñānaṃ ca sanakādayaḥ | 
saubhāgyaṃ candramāḥ prāpat kubero'pi dhaneśatāṃ | 
imaṃ maṃtravaraṃ jñātvā sarvajño bhavati dhruvaṃ | 
adṛṣṭā śruta śāstrasya vyākhyātā śilpago bhavet | 
mahākavirmahāprājño vākpateḥ samatāṃ brajet | 
jñānaṃ tu paraṃ labdhvā viṣṇoḥ sayujyatāṃ vrajet | 
yaṃ yaṃ kāmamabhidhyāyan manuṣye bhajate manuṃ | 
taṃ taṃ kāmamavāpnoti bhuvisvarge rasātale | 
asyoddhāramahaṃ vakṣye mama sārvajñakāraṇaṃ | 
kṛṣṇā govinda kauṅentau tathā gopījanāṃ tataḥ | 
vallabho'gnipriyā sargīha pūrvaḥ samanusvaraḥ | 
nāmnāmādau kramāt kāma māyālakṣmīrniyojayet | 
dvāviṃśatyakṣaro maṃtro vāgbhavādyaḥ prakīrttitaḥ | 
ahamasya muniśchando gāyattrī devatā manoḥ | 
gaṃgāpravāhaṇaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ sarvadeva namaskṛtaḥ | 
gaṃgāpravāhavadvāṇī jāyate tena tattathā | 
gaṃgāpravāhaṇo nāma kīrtyate paramārthataḥ | 

<pṛ0 58a> bījaṃ tu mānmathaṃ proktaṃ śaktiḥ patnī havirbhujaḥ | 
kṛṣṇāya kāmabījābhyāṃ hṛdayaṃ parikīrtitaṃ | 
govindāya śirastadvanmāyādyo'sau mahāmanuḥ | 
gopījana śikhā tadvat śrībījādyena vinyaset | 
vallabhāyeti kavacaṃ astraṃ jāyā havirbhujaḥ | 
śeṣa bījena sahitāḥ paṃcāga manavaḥ smṛtāḥ | 
mūrddhiṇ bhāle bhruvormadhye netre karṇe tathā nasi | 
āsye kaṃṭhe ca dormūle hṛdayodara nābhiṣu | 
liṃgamūle tathā dhāre ūvvojjānvośca gulphayoḥ | 
samastena ca maṃtreṇa vyāpakaṃ nyasya ciṃtayet | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ pūrṇacandranibhānanaṃ | 
barhibarhakṛtottaṃsaṃ vanamālinamīśvaraṃ | 
kirīṭahārakeyura ratnakuṇḍala maṃḍitaṃ | 
śrīvatsavakṣaḥ saṃbhrājat kaustubhodbhāsito rasaṃ | 
yuvatīveśa lāvaṇya ramaṇīya tanuṃ hariṃ | 
divya pītāmbaradharaṃ cāruhāra vibhūṣitaṃ | 
smerāruṇādharanyasta veṇuṃ trailokyamohanam | 
ūrddhavedamayaṃ veṇuṃ vādayaṃtaṃ caturbhūjaṃ | 
sphāṭikīmakṣamālāṃ ca vidyāmūrddhakaradvaye | 
dadhataṃ puṇḍarīkākṣaṃ divyagāna parāyaṇaṃ | 
atulyānalpasaundaryyaṃ mohayaṃtaṃ jagattrayaṃ | 
tapanīya lasatkāṃtyā cīṇākamalahastayā | 
nirīkṣyamāṇa caraṇaṃ vāmapārśvasthayā śriyā |
haimasiṃhāsane ramye sarvaratnopaśobhite | 
rukmiṇyādi mahiṣībhirniṣevita manārataṃ | 
candramaṇḍala saṃkāśa śvetachatropaśobhitaṃ | 
nāradādyairmunigaṇairjñānārthibhirupāsitaṃ | 
indrādi devatāvṛndaiḥ praṇataṃ parameśvaram | 

<pṛ0 58ba> sarvajñaṃ jagadīśānaṃ dhyātvā hṛdayapaṃkaje | 
japedevaṃ manuvaraṃ dhyātvā lakṣacatuṣṭayaṃ | 
svādvaktaiḥ kusumairbrahmavṛkṣajairhomamācaret | 
daśāṃśena ca maṃtro'yaṃ siddho bhavati nānyathā | 
pūjā daśākṣare pīṭhe aṃgāvṛttiranantaraṃ | 
mahīṣībhirdvitīyāpi tṛtīyā digadhīśvaraiḥ | 
caturthī tat praharaṇaiścaturāvṛttirīritā | 
prātaḥ prātaḥ pivettoyaṃ maṃtreṇānena maṃtritaṃ | 
vāgīśvara samo bhūtvā kāvyakarttā mahān bhavet | 
anena maṃtritaṃ nityaṃ brahmā pātraṃ prarakṣayet | 
maṇḍalādeva bhatimān mahāśruti dharo bhavet | 
brāhmī kuṣṭhavacākalkaṃ ghṛtena dviguṇena ca | 
caturguṇaṃ bhave dugdhaṃ pācitaṃ ghṛtamuttamaṃ | 
avatāryya japedatra ayutaṃ japamādarāt | 
varṣamekaṃ prātareva bhakṣayenmaunamāsthitaḥ | 
etadbhakṣaṇamātreṇa bṛhaspati samo bhavet | 
hastamāropya jihvāyāṃ japedayutamādarāt | 
pratibhā jāyate divyā sarvalokaika bhāvitā | 
dhavalairupacāraistu yadi devaṃ prapūjayet | 
divyajñānamavāpnoti pratibhā viśvajitvarī | 
śrīvidyāyāṃ yadā japtvā tadā lakṣmīracaṃcalā | 
kāmādyaṃ japanādeva sarvalokavaśaṃ nayet | 
māyādi japanādeva vāk siddhirjāyaṃte'cirāt | 
śaktibījādiko maṃtro nirvāṇamacirāddiśet | 
puṭanāt praṇavābhyāṃ tu mokṣamāpnoti niścitaṃ | 
evaṃ manuvaraṃ japtvā kiṃ na sidhyati maṃtravit | 
evaṃ maṃtravaraṃ yastu bhajate bhakti tatparaḥ | 
iha bhuktā varān bhogān samasta ṛddhi saṃyutān | 
sampattiṃ paramāṃ labdhā bhūyādaṃte paraṃ padaṃ | 
kāmendrādyā parā śakti nadivindusamanvitā | 

<pṛ0 59a> kathitaḥ kṛṣṇamaṃtroyaṃ maṃtrāṇāṃ maṃtranāyakaṃ | 
ṛṣirbrahmā samākhyātā virāṭchanda udīritaṃ | 
trailokyamohanādeva śrīkṛṣṇaḥ parikīrttitaḥ | 
kala ṣaḍdīrghabījena ṣaḍaṃgaḥ parikīrttitaḥ | 
aṃśālambita vāmakuṇḍaladharaṃ mandollasat bhrūtalaṃ | 
kiṃcit kuṃcita komalādhara puṭaṃ sāci prabhā vekṣaṇaṃ | 
ālolāṃgulipallavairmurali kāmā pūrayaṃtaṃ mudā | 
mūle kalpatarostribhaṃgalalitaṃ dhyāyejjaganmohanaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japenmaṃtraṃ śraddhayā daśalakṣakaṃ | 
taddaśāṃśena juhuyāt pāyasairathavāmbujaiḥ | 
daśākṣarodite pīṭhe pūjayettadvidhānataḥ | 
prayogānapi sarvatra taduktenāpi kārayet | 
athavā bālakṛṣṇaṃ ca nīlendīvarasannibhaṃ | 
ratnābharaṇasaṃdīptaṃ dvibhujaṃ nīlakuntalaṃ | 
pāyasaṃ navanītaṃ ca karābhyāṃ dadhataṃ smaret | 
lakṣamekaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ pāyasairhomayet śubhaiḥ | 
daśāṃśaṃ vidhivadbhaktyā pūjāṃgendrādikāyutaiḥ | 
homayedayutaṃ maṃtrī ghṛtabharjitapiṣṭakaiḥ | 
alakṣirnaśyati kṣipraṃ kāṃtiṃ tejaśca vindati | 
palāśakusumairhutvā vāksiddhiṃ labhate dhruvaṃ | 
paṃkajairjuhuyānmaṃtrī ayutaṃ śriyamāpnuyāt | 
navanītasya homena kavirvāgmī prajāyate | 
vāsudeva padaṃ coktāni gaḍācchādanāya ca | 
vāsudeva dvayaṃ coktā svāheti tanmanurmmataḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktacchando'ṣṭuvudāhṛtaṃ | 
nigaḍacchedano lakṣmīrvāsudevo'sya devanā | 
paṃcāṃgāni manorasya ācakrādyaistu kalpayet | 
rājamaṇḍalamadhye tu kaṃsaṃ nipātya helayā | 

<pṛ0 59ba> jñātīnāṃ varddhayan harṣaṃ ānīya pitarau svayaṃ | 
nigaḍānmocitau bhaktyā praṇamya ca punaḥ punaḥ | 
bāhye saṃsthāpya vidhivaddevakīṃ vīkṣitairnṛpaiḥ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japellakṣaṃ jahuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ | 
aṃganyasādikaṃ sarvaṃ tadagravacanoditaṃ | 
ya evaṃ ciṃtayenmaṃtrī sasamyak sampadāṃ nidhiḥ | 
rājadurgabhayādibhyo mucyate smaraṇāt kṣaṇāt | 
nirguṇḍīmūla homena mucyate bandhanādibhiḥ | 
rājadvāre bhaye ghore smaraṇānmucyate bhayāt || 

[iti śrīgautamīye ekaviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 21 ||

gopālaṃ piṇḍasaṃjña ca kathayāmi mune śṛṇu | 
yadākarṇya gurorbhaktyā paratrehavamodate | 
anena sadṛśo maṃtro jagatsvapi na vidyate | 
paṃcātako dharāsaṃsthaḥ sabinduka manusvaraḥ | 
kathito maṃtrarājo'yaṃ bhukti mukti phalapradaḥ | 
ṛṣirbrahmāsya gāyatrī chandaḥ śrīkṛṣṇa devatā | 
galābhyāṃ bījaśaktī tu kīlakaṃ leṣamucyate | 
ṣaḍdīrghabhājā bījena ṣaḍaṃgāni prakalpayet | 
vṛndāvanagataṃ kṛṣṇaṃ ratnasiṃhāsana sthitaṃ | 
kadambamūla deśe tu gopikājana veṣṭitaṃ | 
nāradādyai munivarairdivyagānāvasanvakaiḥ | 
sahitaṃ parayā bhaktyā vanamālinamīśvaraṃ | 
ratnālaṃkārasandīptaṃ śaṃkha cakra lasat karaṃ | 
śabda brahmamayaṃ veṇumadhaḥ pāṇi dvayoritaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā manuvaraṃ lakṣamātraṃ japedvaśī | 
sitānvitaiḥ pāyasaistu yutaṃ homaṃ samācaret | 
ya enaṃ bhajate maṃtrī siddhayastasya hastagāḥ | 
dhavalaiḥ kusumairhomādvāksiddhiṃ labhate'cirāt | 

<pṛ0 60a> karṇikārasya homena lakṣmīḥ sarvavidhā bhavet | 
anena maṃtritaṃ toyaṃ prātaḥ prātaḥ pivejjalaṃ | 
kavirvāgmī śrutidharaḥ sarvajño jāyate'cirāt | 
asyopāsanamātreṇa kiṃ na sidhyati maṃtraṇaḥ | 
iha bhuktā varān bhogān puttrapauttraiḥ samanvitaḥ | 
aṃte tat paramaṃ dhāma maṃtrī yāti nirāmayaṃ | 
atha vakṣye mahāmaṃtraṃ sarvepsita phalapradaṃ | 
yasya dhāraṇamātreṇa kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale | 
bījaṃ trikoṇamālikhya ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tadbahirlikhet | 
ṣaḍakṣaraṃ likhettatra vṛttaścāṣṭadalaṃ likhet | 
aṣṭākṣareṇa saṃyuktaṃ tadvahiḥ ṣoḍaśacchādaṃ | 
ṣoḍaśārṇaṃ kṛṣṇā manuṃ vahidarśadalānvitaṃ | 
daśākṣareṇa saṃyuktaṃ āṣṭādaśadalaṃ tataḥ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇaṃ tanmadhyedvahirdvātriṃśadambujaṃ | 
devakīsuta ityādi tatraiva vṛttamālikhet | 
piṇḍabījaṃ veṣṭattamālikhet |
piṇḍabījaṃ veṣṭakatvena yaṃtrasya ca sarvataḥ | 
tadvahirvṛttaṃ niṣpādya mātṛkāṃ tatra veṣṭayet | 
vṛttadvayaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā śāpāṃkuśena veṣṭayet | 
tadvahirvṛttamekaṃ tu caturasraṃ sa vajrakaṃ | 
etaduktaṃ mahāyaṃtraṃ kṛpayā munisattama | 
suvarṇapatre bhūrjje vā nityaṃ yaḥ susamāhitaḥ | 
aṣṭagandhairmasīṃ kṛtvā likhet svarṇa śalākayā | 
asya dhāraṇamātreṇa sākṣādbhūmi purandaraḥ | 
mucyate maline kṛcchra duḥkhairghoratarairapi | 
śāṃtiṃ ca śāśvatīṃ labdhāyāti tat paramaṃ padaṃ | 
strīṇāṃ vāma bhuje nityaṃ dhāraṇāt kiṃ na sidhyati || 

<pṛ0 60ba> bandhyāpi labhate puttraṃ śatahāyana jīvakaṃ | 
dīrghāyurapratihata balavīryya samanvitaṃ | 
rāśicakraṃ vilipyātha kumbhaṃ saṃsthāpya pūrvavat | 
vikṣipya yaṃtraṃ tanmadhye sekāt sarvaṃ hi sādhayet | 
nityadarśī bhavedvipro mahīṃ śāsti mahīpatiḥ | 
vaiśyaḥ samṛddhimān bhūyāt labhet śūdro yathepsitaṃ | 
etattu kathitaṃ yaṃtraṃ puruṣārthaika sādhanaṃ | 
kevalaṃ tat prayatnena gopayasva mune svayaṃ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye dvāviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 22 ||

atha vakṣye manuvaraṃ samasta puruṣārthadaṃ | 
yajña jñānāt siddhayaḥ sarvā bhavaṃti kara saṃsthitāḥ | 
lakṣmīrmāyākāmabījaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ kṛṣṇapadaṃ tathā | 
svāheti maṃtrarājo'yaṃ bhukti mukti phalapradaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktaśchando'nuṣṭubudāhṛtaṃ | 
devatā kṛṣṇa ityuktaḥ samasta puruṣārthadaḥ | 
ṣaḍaṃgaṃ kāmabījena ṣaḍdīrghabhedanena tu | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ vṛndāvana gataṃ hariṃ | 
gopa gopī gavāvītaṃ pītavastra yugāvṛtaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ kaustubhodbhāsi vakṣasaṃ | 
sanakādyairmuniśreṣṭaiḥ saṃstutaṃ parayāmudā | 
śaṃkha cakra lasadbāhuṃ veṇuṃ hastadvayeritaṃ | 
dhyātvaivaṃ paramātmānaṃ caturllakṣaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
daśāṃśaṃ juhuyānmaṃtrī kusumairbrahmavṛkṣajaiḥ | 
bhaktyā trisandhyaṃ ca yajedaṃgairindrādibhistataḥ | 
tathā prayoge kurvīta dharmmārtha kāma muktaye | 
pāyasairayutaṃ hutvā divyajñānamavāpnuyāt | 
tadvacca lavaṇairhutvā lokānākarṣayed dhruvaṃ | 
palāśapuṣpairjuhuyāt kavirvāgmī ca jāyate | 
matsyaṇḍī kadalī dugdha ghṛta pāyasaṃ taddhiyā | 

<pṛ0 61a> tarpayedayutaṃ maṃtrī gāṃge yena jalena vai | 
maṇḍalādīhitā siddhirbhavennaivātra saṃśayaḥ | 
vāgabhavādyena jāyena vāgīśa samatāṃ vrajet | 
brāhmī tat kusumairhutvā nidhimāpnotpaya vrataḥ | 
śrīvṛkṣaphalahomena rājyaiśvaryyamavāpnuyāt | 
evaṃ te kathitaṃ bhaktyā durllabhaṃ maṃtranāyakaṃ | 
satsaṃpradāyakaṃ prāptaṃ kiṃ na siddhati maṃtriṇaḥ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇo mārāṃto maṃtraḥ suta dhanapradaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniśchando gāyattrī kathitaṃ budhaiḥ | 
bālakṛṣṇo devatāsya samastārtha phalapradaḥ | 
ṣaḍadīrghabhājā kāmena bījenāṃga kriyā matā | 
indīvara samābhāsaṃ bālaṃ trailokyamohanaṃ | 
lasadratnamayairddīptainmaṇḍitaṃ bahubhūṣaṇaiḥ | 
nānāratnamayodbhāsi brāhma kāmāṃkuśāgalaṃ | 
kuṃtalāṃta samudbhāsi sphuranmakara kuṇḍalaṃ | 
hasti hastakarābhyāṃ ca navamī taṃ ca pāyasaṃ | 
dadhataṃ devavṛndaiśca veṣṭitaṃ gopabālakaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japenmaṃtrī dvātriṃśallakṣamānataḥ | 
japāṃte juhuyādagnau pāyasaistaddaśāṃśataḥ | 
tarpaṇādīni sarvāṇi pūrvavat samupācaret | 
sādhayet sarvakarmmāṇi siddhenānena maṃtravit | 
raktapadmāyutaṃ hutvā dvijo jñānamavāpnuyāt | 
sarvalokaikaśāstā ca kṣattriyo nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
anyeṣāṃ yadyadiṣṭaṃ syāt sādhayenmanunāmunā | 
ratnapadmopari dhyātvā śarkarā pṛthulājakaiḥ | 
kadalī guḍa budhyā ca jalaiḥ saṃtarpya keśavam | 
vatsarāllabhate puttraṃ sarvaloka namaskṛtaṃ | 
anena ca yadyadiṣṭaṃ japamātreṇa sādhayet | 

<pṛ0 61ba> māyā ramā kāmabījaśriyāḍhyo daśavarṇakaḥ | 
trayodaśakṣaro maṃtro dṛṣṭādṛṣṭaphalapradaḥ | 
ṛṣirasya svayaṃ brahmā chando'nuṣṭuvudīritaṃ | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā prokto mahadaiśvaryyadāyakaḥ | 
kuryyādasya manormmaṃtrī hrīmādyairaṃgapaṃcakaṃ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma pāśāṃkuśa lasat karaṃ | 
karābhyāṃ veṇumādāya dhamaṃtaṃ sarvamohanaṃ | 
sūryyāyuta samābhāsaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ ravimaṇḍala saṃsthitaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japenmaṃtraṃ caturlakṣamananyadhīḥ | 
japāṃte taddaśāṃśena pāyasairhomayeddvijaḥ | 
pūjayenmaṃtraṃrājena vakṣyamāṇena vartmanā | 
madhye kṛṣṇaṃ samāvāhya ṣaḍaṃgavidhinārccayet | 
vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ pradyumnaṃ cāniruddhakaṃ | 
digdaleṣu samabhyarccya bahirasya vidigdale | 
sarasvatīṃ tathā lakṣmīṃ ratiṃ prītimanaṃtaraṃ | 
svadikṣu lokapālāṃśca tadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ | 
evamabhyarccya vidhivat sādhayecca yathepsitān | 
viṃśatyarṇoditān vipraḥ prayogānapi sādhayet | 
ya enaṃ bhajate maṃtrī bhaktyā ca paripūjayet | 
rājyaiśvaryyamavāpyānte bhūyāttat paramaṃ mahaḥ | 
kāma māyā ramā pūrvo daśārṇo maṃtranāyakaḥ | 
ramā māyā kāma pūrvo daśārṇaḥ saprakīrttitaḥ | 
anayormmaṃtrayormmaṃtrī ācakrādyaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgataḥ | 
kṛtvā daśārṇavat samyag dhyāna pūjādikaṃ sudhīḥ |
saparyyāṃ ca rate yastu maṃtrayorevamāśritaḥ | 
iha bhuktā varān bhogān mahaiśvaryya samanvitān | 
puttraiḥ pauttraiḥ prapauttraiśca brāhmaṇo haritāṃ vrajet || 

<pṛ0 62a> atha vakṣye śṛṇu mune pratipatiṃ jagatpateḥ | 
indrādipramukhairddevaiḥ svaguptāṃ kriyate tu yā | 
kubero'pi ca yāṃ kṛtvā tapasyan brahmaṇo mukhāt | 
maheśa sakhitāṃ prāpya dhaneśatvamavyaptarān | 
indro'pi yā mupāsyaiva devarājatvamāptavān | 
trailokyavijayī bhūtvā deva daityaika śāsakaḥ | 
māyāramādikāścāṣṭādaśārṇā viṃśadarṇakāḥ | 
anena sadṛśo maṃtrastriṣu lokeṣu durllabhaḥ | 
ṛṣirbrahmā samuddiṣṭo gāyattrī chanda eva ca | 
devatā devatā vṛnda vandyaḥ śrīkṛṣṇa īritaḥ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇavat kuryyānmaṃtrārthairaṃgapaṃcakaṃ | 
dvāravatyāṃ mahājñāne dīrghikā śata maṇḍite | 
pārijātavane ramye suvarṇabhūmi madhyataḥ | 
sarvaratnamaye citre sumeru nibha maṇḍape | 
siṃhāsane samāsīnaṃ sūryyakoṭi samaprabhaṃ | 
raktotpala samābhāsa pāṇipādāmbujaṃ smaret | 
dakṣiṇaṃ caraṇāmbhojaṃ ratnapūrṇa ghaṭopari | 
vāmapādāmbujaṃ divyaṃ svastikākārakāritaṃ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma lasadbāhucatuṣṭayaṃ | 
sarvāṃga sundaraṃ devaṃ sarvābharaṇa bhūṣitaṃ | 
samuddhṛtya sarvaratnai ratnanadyāśca rocitaṃ | 
rukmiṇī satyabhāmā syāt rādhikākhyā ca tiṣṭhati | 
ratnakumbhena ratnena siṃcaṃtī parayā mudā | 
kālindī ṛkṣajā ratnaṃ diśaṃtau kalasau tayoḥ | 
nāgnajīti sunandā ca mitravindā sulakṣaṇā | 
ānīya ratnakalasaṃ ratnanadyāḥ samuddhṛtaṃ | 
diśaṃtyaḥ sarvamāṃgalya saṃgatyā mahiṣīrharet | 
tataḥ ṣoḍaśasahasryaṃ siṃcaṃtyaḥ paritaḥ priyāḥ | 
gītairnṛtyeśca vādyaiśca śatārddhaḥ sarvadevatāḥ | 

<pṛ0 62ba> evaṃ hariṃ smarenmaṃtrī caturllakṣaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
japāṃte pāyasairdivyairjjuhuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ | 
tarpayettaddaśāṃśena bhaktitaptedumajjalaiḥ | 
abhiṣicya daśāṃśena brahmaṇāmapi pūjayet | 
karṇikāyāṃ likhedbījaṃ sasādhyaṃ tadvahirlikhet | 
śeṣa saptadaśārṇena vahnergeha yugaṃ tataḥ | 
vṛttādvahiraṣṭadalaṃ caturasraṃ savajrakaṃ | 
caturdvāra samāyuktaṃ yaṃtrametat sulakṣaṇaṃ | 
pūrvadakṣiṇapāścātya koṇe māyāṃ vilikhya ca | 
śrībījamanyato lekhyaṃ ṣaḍarṇaṃ koṇagaṃ tathā | 
patre tu kāmaṃ gāyattrīṃ triśastriśo vibhāgaśaḥ | 
kāmadevāya vidmahe puṣpabāṇāya dhīmahi tanno'naṃgaḥ pracodayāt | 
ityuktā kāma gāyattrī samastajana mohinī | 
kāmādyajāpādasyāstu sarvakarmmāṇi sādhayet | 
dalamadhye likhet kāma manuṃ ṣaṭśakrameṇa tu | 
namo'nte kāmadevāya sarvajana priyāya ca | 
sarvasaṃmohanayeti | jvalayugmaṃ prajjvaleti ca | 
sarvajanasya śabdāṃte hṛdayaṃ mama saṃvadet | 
vaśaṃ kuru yugaṃ proktā svāhāṃto manurīritaḥ | 
proktā gopāla yaṃtro'yaṃ kāmādyaḥ sādhiko mune | 
hāṭakāracite pātre bhojyairvā pravilikhya ca | 
dhārayet sādhitaṃ yaṃtraṃ japasekasamanyayāt | 
asyādhāraṇamātreṇa kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale | 
rājāno vaśatāṃ yāṃti dāsavacchatra saṃkulaṃ | 
trailokyamohano maṃtraḥ sarvalokaika pūjitaḥ | 
asmin thaṃtre samāvāhya rājarājeśvaraṃ hariṃ | 
pūjayedbhaktito maṃtrī sarvarājopacārakaiḥ | 

<pṛ0 63a> koṇaṣaṭke ṣaḍaṃgaṃ tu tadvahiśca vidigdale | 
vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ pradyumnaṃ cāniddhakaṃ | 
sarasvatīṃ tathā lakṣmīṃ ratiṃ prītiṃ ca digdale | 
tadvahiraṣṭa mahiṣī rukmiṇyādyāḥ prapūjayet | 
indranīla mukundākhyān makarānanda kacchapān | 
śaṃkha padma nidhī cāpi tadvahiḥ pūjayettataḥ | 
indrādīn sva sva dikṣvavaṃ vajrādīṃstadanaṃtaraṃ | 
iti ṣaṣṭhāvṛtairyuktamacyutaṃ bhaktito'rccayet | 
saṃsāra sāgaraṃ ghoraṃ vāsanānakrasaṃkulaṃ | 
santīryya paramaṃ dhāma maṃtrīyāti na cānyathā | 
caturlakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ daśāṃśaṃ pāyasairhunet | 
athavā paṃkajaiḥ phullaiḥ śeṣamanyat samāpayet | 
tadā svahṛdaye viṣṇuṃ maṃtra nyāsān yathoditān | 
tanmayo viharetmaṃtrī tīrṇa saṃsāra sāgaraḥ | 
ayutaṃ raktapadmaistu hutvā viśvaṃ vaśaṃ nayet | 
tadbhasma dhārayedbhāle yaṃ spṛśed yaṃ nirīkṣayet |
yairvāte bhavaṃtyasya kiṃ karāḥ |
ārakta hayamāraistu rājāno dāsavadvaśe | 
śuklādi vastralābhāya śuklādi kusumairhunet | 
huneddhānya samṛddhaiśca ārakta dhānyamaṃjarī | 
śrīvṛkṣakusumairhomāt samā lakṣmīḥ prasīdati | 
bilvapatraiśca juhuyāt puttrapauttrānuyāyinīṃ | 
labhe lakṣmīṃ prasannāṃ tat phalai rājyamavāpnuyāt | 
kevalaṃ ghṛtahomena brāhmyaṃ tejaśca jāyate | 
āyurvṛddhiṃ yaśo lakṣmīṃ vaśyatāṃ sarvayoṣitāṃ | 
labhate nātra sandehaḥ sukhaṃ sarvātiśāyinaṃ | 
ghṛta taṇḍula homena balavān jāyate'cirāt | 

<pṛ0 63ba> bhakṣya bhojyādikaṃ hutvā bhogī syādayāvadāyuṣaḥ | 
aṣṭādaśārṇadaśayoḥ prayogaṃ nātra cācaret | 
ādravitaḥ prayogastu dvābhyāmekaṃ tu kārayet | 
ratnābhiṣekaṃ gopālaṃ yo yena vidhinā bhajet | 
savaiśvaryyasamṛddho'pi sarvabhuk sarvakārakaḥ | 
dehatyāge hariṃ yā yādityevaṃ munayo jaguḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye trayoviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 23 ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi rukmiṇī vallabhaṃ manuṃ | 
yajña jñānāt sarvalokānāṃ vallabho bhuvi jāyate | 
namo'nte bhagavān ṅyento rukmiṇī vallabhastathā | 
svāhāṃto bhāvasaṃyuktaḥ ṣoḍaśārṇo mahāmanuḥ | 
asya jñānāttathā maṃtrī jñānavān jāyate'cirāt | 
dhānyādaṣṭāṃga yogasya phalamāpnoti niścitaṃ | 
smaraṇādasya maṃtrasya sarvatīrtha phalaṃ labhet | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktacchando'nuṣṭavudīritaṃ | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā cāsya rukmiṇī vallabhā hvayaḥ | 
vyastaiḥ samastairaṃgāni padaiḥ kuryyāt ṣaḍaṃgavit | 
atasī kusuma śyāmaṃ pītavastra yugāvṛtaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ kaustubhāyukta vakṣasaṃ | 
śrīvatsalāṃchana śrīmadratnābharaṇa bhūṣitaṃ | 
dvārakāvara gehasthaṃ ratnasiṃhāsane śubhe | 
rukmiṇyālāpamadhuraṃ śaṃkha cakra gadā dharaṃ | 
dhyātvaivaṃ paramātmānaṃ lakṣamekaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
tadaṃte juhuyānmaṃtrī tilairmadhurasaṃplavaiḥ | 
pūjayedvaiṣṇave pīṭhe daśākṣara vidhānataḥ | 
palāśaiḥ kusumairhutvā divyajñānamavāpnuyāt | 
pūrvavattarpaṇaṃ kuryyāt sarvābhīṣṭāni sādhayet | 

<pṛ0 64a> puṇḍarīkākṣataṃ hutvā śriyamāpnotya yatnataḥ | 
kevalaṃ ghṛtahomena jīvedvarṣaśataṃ sukhī | 
ityevaṃ rukmiṇīnātha vidyānaṃ munipūjitaṃ | 
bhogamokṣa karaṃ yatnānmūne tvamapi gopayā | 
praṇavaṃ jamasaścāṃte vadedbhava gate padaṃ | 
nandaputra padaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ vadennandavapustathā | 
bhūtyaṃte daśavarṇaśca manuḥ sarvārthasiddhidaḥ | 
nārado munirākhyātaśchanda uktaṃ virāḍapi | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā cātra caturvarga phalapradaḥ | 
paṃcāṃgāni manorasya ācakrādyaiḥ prakalpayet | 
dhyāyedvṛndāvane ramye gopa gopī gaṇā vṛtaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
sarva priyakaraṃ devaṃ kiśora śyāma vigrahaṃ | 
dorbhyāṃ veṇu pādayaṃtaṃ bhuvanaika guruṃ paraṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā manuvaraṃ lakṣamekaṃ japettathā | 
tilaiśca svāduyuktaiśca juhuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ | 
daśākṣarodite pīṭhe pūjayettadvidhānataḥ | 
ya evaṃ cintayenmaṃtrī bhogamuktyoḥ sabhājanaṃ | 
bilvapatrāyutaṃ hutvā sarvakāmān prasādhayet | 
aṣṭauttaraśataṃ japtvā sabhāyāṃ vijayī bhavet | 
sarvalokaika subhagaḥ sarvaiśvaryya samanvitaḥ | 
dehāṃte tatpadaṃ yāti yata prāptvāja nivarttate | 
nandaputra padaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ śyāmalāṃga padaṃ tathā | 
amṛtaṃ mukhavṛttaṃ ca māṃsāṃ caiva vapustathā | 
daśākṣarastu prokto'yaṃ manuḥ sarvasamṛddhidaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktacchando'nuṣṭavudīritaṃ | 
devatā bālakṛṣṇo'sya munibhiḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 

<pṛ0 64ba> kalpayet pūrvavanmaṃtrī cakrādyairaṃgapaṃcakaṃ | 
atasī kusuma śyāmaṃ śaṃkha cakra lasat karaṃ | 
dorbhyāṃ veṇuṃ vādayaṃtaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ bhāva hāṣa virājitaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā yajeddevaṃ paṃcāṃgaiśca diśo'dhipaiḥ | 
tadastrairapi saṃpūjya japellakṣaṃ vrate sthitaḥ | 
daśāṃśaṃ juhuyānmaṃtrī pāyasairmmadhurāplutaiḥ | 
evaṃ saṃsiddhamaṃtrastu sarvakarmmāṇi sādhayet | 
tilājyairakṣataṃ hutvā graha rogān vināśayet | 
palāśakusumairhutvā vāgīśa samatāṃ brajet | 
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccāryya namo bhagavate padaṃ | 
nandaputra padaṃ ṅentaṃ bhūdharo mukha vṛttayuk | 
vapuḥ padaṃ tathā ṅentamūṇaviṃśati varṇakaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ prokto virāṭchanda udīritaṃ | 
devatā nanda tanayaḥ sarvalokaika nandanaḥ | 
paṃcāṃgāni manorasya cakrādyaiḥ parikalpayet | 
navīna vārida śyāmaṃ padmapatra nibhe kṣaṇaṃ | 
muktādāmalasat kaṃṭha keyūrāṃgadabhūṣaṇaṃ | 
aneka ratna saṃbaddha sphura kara kuṇḍalaṃ | 
uddāma kaustubhodbhāsi vakṣaḥ śrīvatsa lāṃchanaṃ | 
barhivarha kṛtottaṃ saṃ gopa gopī gavāvṛtaṃ | 
dhyātvaivaṃ paramātmānaṃ japenmanuravaṃ tataḥ | 
caturlakṣajapānte tu daśāṃśaṃ raktapaṃkajaiḥ | 
homayeccheṣamanyattu pūrvavat samupācaret | 
daśārṇayaṃtre viśveśaṃ samāvāhya prapūjayet | 
prathamāvṛttiraṃgaiḥ syānmahiṣībhardvitīyikā | 
tṛtīyādigadhīśaistu vajrādyaistu caturthikā | 
evaṃ yaḥ prapūjayet kṛṣṇaṃ caturāvṛtti saṃyutaṃ | 

<pṛ0 65a> dharmmārthakāmamokṣāṇāṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ labhate phalaṃ | 
pāyasairayutaṃ hutvā mahādhanapatirbhavet | 
pūrṇāyurlabhate maṃtrī ayutaṃ ghṛtahomataḥ | 
dūrvayā lakṣahomena jīvedvarṣaśataṃ sukhaṃ | 
ityeṣa kathito maṃtraḥ sarveṣāṃ sarvasiddhidaḥ | 
athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi manuṃ sarvasamṛddhidaṃ | 
yajñajñānānmunayaḥ sarve bhogamokṣaika bhūmayaḥ | 
līlādaṇḍadharaṃ cokttā gopījana tataḥ paraṃ | 
dorddaṇḍantu padaṃ coktā megha śyāma padaṃ tataḥ | 
viṣṇaḥ svāheti maṃtro'yaṃ samasta puruṣārthadaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktaśchando'nuṣṭuvudāritam | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā cāsya sarvaviśvānuśāsakaḥ | 
padaiḥ paṃcāṃga kaḷptiḥ syāttato dhyāyedathācyutaṃ | 
tāpiṃja kusuma śyāmaṃ sadā ṣoḍaśavārṣikaṃ | 
gopīmadhya sthitaṃ tābhyāṃ liṃgitaṃ kāma hṛcchayā | 
sarvālaṃkārasubhagaṃ pītāmbaradharaṃ paraṃ | 
bhuvanaika guruṃ dhyātvā lakṣamekaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
daśāṃśaṃ kamalairhutvā śeṣamanyat samāpayet | 
tarpayennityaśo devaṃ dugdha budhyā śubhairjjalaiḥ | 
maṇḍalādvāṃchitā siddhirmmahādhanapatirbhavet | 
yaṃ0 imaṃ bhajate nityaṃ japahomādi tatparaḥ | 
vāṃchitānī hitān labdhā dehāṃte tatpadaṃ vrajet | 
vedādika manā māyā kāmabījādatho vadet | 
śrīkṛṣṇaṃ ca padaṃ ṅentaṃ govindaṃ ca tathā vadet | 
gopījanā padasyāṃte vallabhaṃ ṅentamīrayet | 
kāmāṃtaṃ ca ramābījaṃ saṃprokto maṃtranāyakaḥ | 
siddhagopālamaṃtro'yaṃ sarvasiddhi prado nṛṇām | 

<pṛ0 65ba> bījaiḥ padaiśca paṃcāṃgaṃ kṛtvā dhyāyedathācyutaṃ | 
pakṣirājakṛtacchāyau suradrumatalāsinau | 
śaṃkheṃdu marutā bhāsau dadhyuttha pāyasāśinau | 
anekairāvṛtamukhairgrahayukto yathāvidhuḥ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagau kastubhau yukta kandarau | 
tārahārāvalī rabhyau sarvāścaryya mayau śiśu | 
trailaukyaśaraṇau śrīmadrāmakṛṣṇau smaran japet | 
lakṣamekaṃ manuvaraṃ daśāṃśaṃ śrīphalairhunet | 
homāṃte vidhivanmaṃtrī śeṣamanyat samāpayet | 
daśākṣarodite pīṭhe vakṣyamāṇena pūjayet | 
ṣaḍaṃgaṃ keśare yadvā digīśāḥ praharānapi | 
evaṃ trayāvṛttimayaṃ saṃpūjya puruṣottamaṃ | 
dugdha budhyā jalairnityaṃ tarpayediṣṭasiddhidaṃ | 
mukhe karaṃ samāyujya japādvāgmīkāvarbhavet | 
navanītā yutaṃ hutvā dharāpati vṛtye bhavet | 
ravivāre'śvatthamūle cāṣṭauttaraśataṃ japet | 
puttrairmmitraiśca sampanno mriyate nāpamṛtyutaḥ | 
athāparaṃ manuvaraṃ kathayāmi samṛddhidaṃ |
lakṣmī māyā kāmabījairdaśārṇāṃ pūṭayet kramāt | 
ṣoḍaśārṇo manuḥ sākṣānmahālakṣmīṃ prayacchati | 
brahmā ṛṣiḥ samuddiṣṭo gāyatrī chanda īritaṃ | 
mahāsampatpradaḥ śrīmān devatā kṛṣṇa īritaṃ | 
daśārṇavadaṃga kaḷptyā dhyāyeddevamananyadhīḥ | 
kālābhranicayaprakhyaṃ pāṇipādāmbujāruṇaṃ | 
tārahārāvalī ramyaṃ kaustubhāyukta vakṣasaṃ | 
kirīṭa keyūra graiveya kaṃkaṇormmi virājitaṃ | 
dhyāyedratna gṛhāntaḥsthaṃ raktapaṃkajamadhyagaṃ | 
caturllakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ pāyasairayutaṃ hunet | 

<pṛ0 66a> tarpaṇādīni sarvāṇi pūrvokta vidhinācaret | 
ya0 enaṃ bhajate maṃtrī lakṣmī gopāla vigrahaṃ | 
sasarva sampadaṃ labdhvā yātpanaṃ tama yatnataḥ || 

[iti śrīgautamīye caturviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 24 ||

athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi maṃtrarājaṃ sudurllabhaṃ | 
avāyuryena japena divya jñānaṃ munīśvarāḥ | 
bhraṣṭa rājyaṃ sureśreṣṭho hyavāpayadupāsanāt | 
anye'pi bahavo devāḥ svasvādhikāratāṃ gatāḥ | 
trimātra hṛdbhagavate govinda mukundāyeti tanmanuḥ | 
dvādaśākṣara ityukto maṃtraḥ sarvasamṛddhidaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ prokto virāṭ chanda udīritaṃ | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā proktaḥ sarvadeva namaskṛtaḥ | 
viniyogo'sya maṃtrasya puruṣārthaṃ catuṣṭaye | 
vyastaiḥ padaiḥ samastaśca paṃcāgāni prakalpayet | 
sṛṣṭi saṃhṛti sthityā ca karaśodhanamācaret | 
sthityaṃtaṃ daśatattvaṃ ca mātṛkā manu saṃpuṭam | 
tattvanyāsaṃ tathā kṛtvā keśavādi puraḥsaraṃ | 
janipālana saṃhāra vidhānaika viśāradaṃ | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ nīlendīvaralocanaṃ | 
aneka ratnābharaṇaṃ dīptyā viśvāvakāśakaṃ | 
tathaivāśanasuvāta pītavastra yugāvṛtaṃ | 
śrīvatsalakṣaṇaṃ devaṃ kaustubhodbhāsi vakṣasaṃ | 
veṇuvādya ninādena mohayaṃtaṃ carācaram | 
munivṛndairddevavṛndai ṛṣivṛndaistu (stu) saṃstutam | 
āvṛtaṃ mahiṣī vṛndairnidhibhiḥ pariṣevitaṃ | 
athavā taptahemābhaṃ kāṃtyākrāṃtaṃ jagattrayaṃ | 
kalpadruma lalatāsīnaṃ ratnasiṃhāsanopari | 
dhyātvā japenmanu varaṃ lakṣadvādaśamādarāt | 
vārttā karṇā na mātraṃ hi svīṇāṃ kṛtvā vrate sthitaḥ | 
payomūla phalāśinā pūrvoktācārapālakaṃ | 

<pṛ0 66ba> daśāṃśaṃ juhuyādbhakto kusumairbrahmavṛkṣajaiḥ | 
tataḥ pūrvoktavidhinā śeṣa manyat samāpayet | 
goṣṭhe pratiṣṭhitaṃ devaṃ puṇyāvaṇye'thavā tathā | 
prāsāde vā pratiṣṭhāpya pūjayan bhoga mokṣa bhāk | 
vṛndāvana gataṃ dhyāyenmahāmāṇikyamaṇḍapaṃ | 
sāmānyārghyaṃ viśodhyātha pūjaye dvārapālakān | 
dvārāgre'vanipīṭhe ca pakṣīndraṃ paripūjayet | 
japaṃ ca vijayaṃ caiva balaprabalasaṃjñakau | 
caṇḍaṃ pracaṇḍamatha ca dhātāraṃ ca vidhātaraṃ | 
dvāro pūrvādiṣu tān prādakṣiṇyena pūjayet | 
dvārordhe dvāraśriyaṃ ca dehalyāṃ dehalaṃ jayet | 
dvārasya pārśveyostadvad gaṃgāṃ ca yamunāṃ tathā | 
vighneśaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ ca tayoḥ pārśve prapūjayet | 
dūrvākṣatān samādāya vighnānutsāryya vāhyataḥ | 
pādāghātakarā sphoṭa samudaṃ cita vaktrakaiḥ | 
vighnaṃ trividhamutsāryya astramaṃtreṇa maṃtravit | 
koṇeṣu vighnaṃ durgāṃ ca vāṇīṃ kṣetreśa marccayet | 
arccayedvāstupuruṣaṃ gṛhamadhye samāhitaḥ | 
tāraṃ śāṃrgapadaṃ ṅe'staṃ sa pūrvaṃ ca savāsanaṃ | 
huṃ phaṭa nama iti proktā madrayāgre sthito hareḥ |
vidheya metat sarvatra sthāpitokta viśeṣataḥ | 
āsaneṣūpatiṣṭhettu tanmaṃtreṇa vidhānavit | 
nyāsānnāsya svadehe ca ātmavāgāvasānakaṃ | 
daśākṣarokta vidhinā pīṭhaṃ saṃpādya pūjayet | 
nāradādi gurūṃstadvadiṣṭvā bhāgavatān yajet | 
gukāraṃ maraṇaṃ vidyādrukārastadvirodhakaḥ | 
gururityeva munibhiḥ proktaḥ kṛṣṇaikya yogataḥ | 
nāradaḥ parvataṃ jiṣṇuṃ niśaṭhoddhava dārukaṃ | 

<pṛ0 67a> viśvaksenaṃ ca śaileyaṃ vāyvādīśāṃtamarccayet | 
gurūn paragurūṃścāpi parameṣṭhi gurūṃstathā | 
parāparagurūṃstadvat pūrvasiddhānanaṃtaraṃ | 
sanakaśca sanatkumāra saṃjñakaḥ sanātanaśca ityādi parān bhāgatāṃstathā | 
gurunāmnā prakṛtyaiva pādukābhyo namo vadet | 
āpāyāṃ pāti niyataṃ duḥśaṃkāddurnimittakāt | 
kāmitārtha pradānāśca pādukā parikīrttitā | 
gatyarthe caradhāntastuṇaścāpyānanda ucyate | 
ānandaṃ prāpayed yasmāttasmāccāraṇamucyate | 
pīṭhapūjāṃ vidhāyātha tatrāvāhya hariṃ yajet | 
sarvopacārān kṛtyāṃte ṣaḍaṃgāvṛttimarccayet | 
rukmiṇīṃ satyabhāmāṃ ca dakṣavāme prapūjayet | 
vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ pradyumnaṃ cāniruddhakaṃ | 
kālindī nāgnajitākhyā suśīlā ca sanandakā | 
ṛkṣajā lakṣaṇā caiva ityaṣṭo mahiṣīḥ smṛtāḥ | 
kaumodakīṃ pāṃcajanyaṃ vasudevaṃ ca devakīṃ | 
nandagopaṃ yaśodāṃ ca saṃpūjya tadanaṃtaraṃ | 
kiṃkiṇīṃ ca tathābhyarccya dāmādīṃśca pūṣū jayet | 
digardhāśān svadikṣvavaṃ gajānaṣṭau tathārccayet | 
kumudaḥ kumudākhyaśca puṇḍarīko'thavā manaḥ | 
śaṃkukarṇaḥ sarvanetraḥ sumukhaḥ supratiṣṭhitaḥ | 
ekakālaṃ dvikālamvā trikālaṃ addhayānvitaḥ | 
mandravit kṛṣṇamabhyarccya bhogamuktyośca bhājanaṃ | 
goṣṭhe vā śaila śṛṃge vā puṇyāraṇye nadītaṭe | 
prāsāde sthāpayan kṛṣṇaṃ tīrtha koṭīphalaṃ labhet | 
koṭi koṭi mahādānāt koṭitīrtha paribhramāt | 
tatphalaṃ labhate bhaktyā saṃpratiṣṭhāpya keśavaṃ | 
mahāmaṃtra koṭi jāpāt yat phalaṃ labhate punaḥ | 

<pṛ0 67ba> tat phalaṃ samavāpnoti saṃsthāpya puruṣottamaṃ | 
koṭiyajñena yatpuṇyaṃ puṇyāraṇya niṣevaṇāt | 
yatphalaṃ labhate martya(-)stacca saṃsthāpya keśavaṃ | 
yāvajjanma harernāma grahaṇād yat phalaṃ labhet | 
tat phalaṃ samavāpnoti saṃsthāpya puruṣottamaṃ | 
sūryyagrahe kurukṣetre godānāyuta yat phalaṃ | 
tat phalaṃ labhate bhaktyā saṃsthāpya puruṣottamaṃ | 
sadyaḥ sārgi samāyuktaḥ kāmaḥ paṃcasvarānvitaḥ | 
māṃsāṃte nāthāya vadenna mohaṃto maṃtra īritaḥ | 
nārado'sya muniḥ proktaśchando'nuṣṭuvudāhṛtaṃ | 
gopavallabhaḥ śrīkṛṣṇo devatā parikīrttitā | 
paṃcāṃgāni manorasya ācakrādyāni kalpayet | 
dhyāye vṛndāvane kṛṣṇāṃ gopa śiśu gaṇāvṛtaṃ | 
hastābhyāṃ veṇu śṛṃgaṃ ca śyāmalaṃ viśvamohanaṃ | 
bahuratnasamāvaddha kiṃkiṇī hāra nūpuraṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā japenmaṃtraṃ lakṣamātraṃ samāhitaḥ | 
homayettaddaśāṃśena pāyasairmmadhurānvitaiḥ | 
aṃgendra vajrādi mukhairityarccana vidhiḥ smṛtaḥ | 
ya evaṃ labhate maṃtrī śrīgopālavallabhaṃ hariṃ | 
sagogaṇavarairāṭyaṃ sarvaiśvaryya samṛddhimān | 
dehāṃte bhagavaddhāma prāpnuyānnātra saṃśayaḥ | 
ūrddhadaṃta yutaḥ khāṃto nāṃto māṃsa dvayaṃ tathā | 
bhīṣaṇāmukhavṛttena vīti hotra samānvitā | 
sarvārthasādhakaḥ prokto namo'nto'ṣṭākṣaro manuḥ | 
kāmabījaṃ mukhe dadyāt sarvārthaḥ saṃpradāyakaḥ | 
kuṇḍalīśāśca ye maṃtrā gopālasya kvacit kvacit | 
kāmabījaṃ mukhe teṣāṃ dadyāt sarvārtha siddhaye | 
nārado'sya muniḥ prokto'nuṣṭupchandaḥ samīritaṃ | 

<pṛ0 68a> śrīkṛṣṇo devatā cāsya samasta puruṣādarthaḥ | 
paṃcāgāni manorasya ācakrādyaiḥ prakalpayet | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ nīlendīvaralocanaṃ | 
nānālaṃkarasubhagaṃ vālaṃtaṃ paṃcahāyanaṃ | 
dadhyutthapāya saṃsphītaṃ karābhyāṃ dadhataṃ hariṃ | 
tārahārāvalīramyaṃ gopa gopī gavāvṛtaṃ | 
dhyācaivaṃ paramātmānaṃ sṛṣṭisthityaṃta kāriṇaṃ | 
arkalakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ daśāṃśaṃ pāyasai hunet | 
athavā paṃkarhutvā siddha maṃtro bhavet sukhī | 
daśākṣarodite pīṭhe tadvidhānena pūjayet | 
athavāṃgendra vajrādi pūjā cāsya samīritā | 
navanītākṣataṃ hutvā sarvasiddhīśvaro bhavet | 
puttrāptiśca syakairhutvā pāṭalai rājapaśyatā | 
atrādyairhomato nityaṃ lakṣmīstasya gṛhe sthirā | 
pūrvokta tarpaṇe naiva sarvābhīṣṭāni sādhayet || 

[iti gautamīye paṃcaviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 25 ||

kāmaścāṣṭasvarārūḍhaḥ sargavān maṃtranāyakaḥ | 
kṛṣṇeti dyakṣaraḥ proktaḥ kāma pūrvo guṇākṣaraḥ | 
kāmādyaṃtaścaturvarṇaścaturvarga phalapradaḥ | 
ṅentaḥ kṛṣṇo namo'ntaśca paṃcavarṇo mahāmanuḥ | 
sa eva kāma pūrvaśceta ṣaḍakṣara manuḥ smṛtaḥ | 
evaṃ japtvā trikālajñaḥ śātā tapa munīśvaraḥ | 
asya saṃsmaraṇādeva sārvajñaṃ kavitāṃvarāṃ | 
labhate nātra sandehaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ hi madvacaḥ | 
kṛṣṇa govindakau ṅe'ntau kāmādyaścāṣṭavarṇakaḥ | 
ādyaṃte kāmabījaścennavākṣaramanurmmataḥ | 
suprasantātmane vahni vallabhā saptavarṇakaḥ | 
kāmabījaṃ dharā bījaṃ punaḥ kāmaṃ samuddharet | 

<pṛ0 68ba> śyāmalāṃga padaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ namo'nto'yaṃ daśākṣaraḥ | 
śivo'nto bāla vapuṣe kṛṣṇā yānyo manurmmataḥ | 
ṅe'ntaṃ bālavapuḥ kāmaḥ kṛṣṇo ṅe'ntaḥ śivo'ntakaḥ | 
kṛṣṇāyeti svaradvandva madhye paṃcākṣaro'paraḥ | 
ekādaśākṣaro maṃtro bhajatāṃ vāṃchitārthadaḥ | 
gopālāyāgnijāyābhyāṃ ṣaḍakṣara udāhṛtaḥ | 
yasya saṃsmaraṇā devaki malabhyaṃ jagattraye | 
eteṣāṃ manuvaryyāṇāṃ nārado munirīritaḥ | 
uktaṃ chandastu gāyattrī bālakṛṣṇaśca devatā | 
ṣaḍdīrghabhājā kāmena ṣaḍaṃgāni samācaret | 
nīlapadmasamānākṣaṃ bālaṃ śyāmala vigrahaṃ | 
nānāratnasamāvaddhā vicittrābharaṇanvitaṃ | 
raktapadma samāsīnaṃ dadhyutthaṃ pāpa saṃvaraṃ | 
dadhataṃ kara padmābhyāṃ gopāla śiśu saṃvṛtaṃ | 
evaṃ viciṃtya prajaphellakṣamekaṃ yathāvidhi | 
aṃte juhuyādvidhivaddaśāṃśaṃ śrīphalairnavaiḥ | 
daśākṣarodite pīṭhe vidhinā pūjayeddhariṃ | 
ṣaḍagāvṛttirādyāsyāddvitīyādigadhīśvaraiḥ | 
tṛtīyā praharai ruktā samarpyā sarvakāmadā | 
ayutaṃ bilvapatraistu havanāllabhate naraḥ | 
tejo bījaṃ tathā kāṃtiṃ lakṣmīṃ sarvāniśāyinīṃ | 
raktapadmāyutahomādrājānaścāsya kiṃkarāḥ | 
bilvapatraistathā hutvā labhedrājyamakaṃṭakaṃ | 
eteṣāṃ manuvaryyāṇāṃ ekaṃ yo bhajate sudhīḥ | 
ihabhyuktā varān bhogān dehāṃte tat padaṃ vrajet | 
athā evaṃ manuvaraṃ vakṣye sarvasamṛddhidaṃ | 
smaraṇād yasya maṃtrajño vāgīśa samatāṃ vrajet | 
devānāmīśvaraḥ śakro dhanado dhananāyakaḥ | 
smaraṇādasya maṃtrasya kiṃ na sidhyati bhūtale | 

<pṛ0 69a> vāgbhavaṃ kāmabījaṃ ca māyāṃ lakṣmīmanaṃtaraṃ | 
daśavarṇaṃ manuvaraṃ caturddaśākṣaro manuḥ | 
vāgbhavādyo yathā cāyaṃ maṃtrī vākpatisannibhaḥ | 
veda vedāṃta vedāṃga siddhāṃtamatirujjvalaḥ | 
amṛtaspandanīrvācaḥ kavitā sarvajitvarī | 
sarvavāṅmayavettā ca sarvajño jāyate'cirāt | 
saṃvidādyaṃ yadā maṃtraṃ sādhako yadi vā bhyaset | 
acirāt sarvasiddhīnāmadhīpo jāyate sudhīḥ | 
rājāno vaśyate yāṃti sāmānyaiḥ saparicchadaiḥ | 
devāḥ sarve namasyaṃte kiṃ paraḥ kathyate paraṃ | 
śrībījādyaṃ yadā japyād bhaktito maṃtranāyakaṃ | 
alabhyagāra mātasya mandire sampadāvahā | 
tasya vaṃśe sthirā lakṣmīryāvadāhūta saṃplavaṃ | 
kāma pūrvo yadā maṃtro japyate sādhakottamaiḥ | 
trailokyaṃ vaśatāmeti manovākkāya karmmabhiḥ | 
strīṇāṃ kandarpa sadṛśo darśanādeva mohakṛta | 
camatkārakaro loke jīvedvarṣaśataṃ sukhī | 
ṛṣirbrahmāsya maṃtrasya gāyatrī chandaḥ īritaṃ | 
devatā sarvajagatāṃ mohanaḥ kṛṣṇa īritaḥ | 
paṃcāṃgāni manorasya ācakrādyaiḥ prakalpayet | 
sṛṣṭisaṃhārasthitibhirddaśavarṇān kare nyaset | 
tārasaṃpuṭitān kṛtvā namo madhyagatānmune | 
daśārṇāṃga nyāsadeśe daśavarṇaṃ vinirddiśet | 
keśavādi tathā tattvaṃ daśatattvaṃ kramāt kramāt | 
ṛṣyādi nyāsamāpādya ṣaḍaṃganyāsamācaret | 
kāmākṣaraṃ paraṃ bījaṃ svāhā prakṛtirīśvarī | 
kevalaṃ cit parāśaktirmmaṃtrādhiṣṭātṛ devatā | 
dhyāyedvṛndāvane ramye kāṃcanī bhūmi madhyage | 

<pṛ0 69ba> nānāpuṣpalatākīrṇe vṛkṣaṣaṇḍaiśca maṇḍite | 
kalpāṭavī kule samyak śrīmanmāṇikyamaṇḍape | 
devakinnaragandharvamunibhiḥ pariṣevite | 
nāradādyairmmuniśreṣṭaiḥ stutibhiḥ samupasthite | 
ratnasiṃhāsane dhyāyet āsīnaṃ kamalopari | 
sajala jalada śyāmaṃ raktapadmadale kṣaṇaṃ | 
raktapadmanibhaṃ pādaṃ pāṇibhyāṃ parimaṇḍitāṃ | 
navaratna samāvaddha bhūṣaṇaiḥ paribhūṣitaṃ | 
veṇuṃ dhamaṃtaṃ pāṇibhyāṃ jītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
āraktavakṣasi śrīmatkaustubhodbhāsitāmbaraṃ | 
tārahārāvalī ramyaṃ śrīvatsāṃkita vakṣasaṃ | 
rocanā tilaka prāṃte kuṇḍala bhramarāyitaṃ | 
kandarpa cāpasadṛśa cillī maṇi virājitaṃ | 
aneka ratnasambaddha sphurannūpurakuṇḍalaṃ | 
varhivarhakṛtottaṃsaṃ sarvāṃgaṃ sarvavedibhiḥ | 
upāsitaṃ munigaṇairupatiṣṭeddhaviṃ sadā | 
evaṃ dhyātvā manuvaraṃ daśalakṣaṃ vrate sthitaḥ | 
daśākṣara vidhānena japāt siddho bhavenmanuḥ | 
siddhenānena manunā sarvābhīṣṭāni sādhayet | 
daśākṣarodite pīṭhe tadvidhānena pūjayet | 
ayutaṃ juhuyānmaṃtrī kusumairbrahmavṛkṣajaiḥ | 
mahākavirmmahāprājño bhavenmaṃtrī na saṃśayaḥ | 
mālatīkusumairhutvā vāksiddhimatulāṃ labhet | 
tagaraiḥ kṣīrasiktaiśca homāt sarvajñatāṃ vrajet | 
vakulaprasavairhomācchriyamāpnoti īpsitāṃ | 
bhakṣyabhojyādi homena samṛddhimatulāṃ labhet | 
kevalaṃ ghṛtahomena brahma tejaḥ prajāyate | 
śrīphalasya dalairhutvā rājyamāpnotya yatnataḥ | 
tat phalairmmaṃtrasiddhiḥ syād dūrvābhirāyuṣe hunet | 

<pṛ0 70a> tarpaṇaṃ pūrva vihitaṃ kṛtvā sarvaṃ prasādayet | 
daśākṣaroditaṃ sarvaṃ prayogamanunā caret || 

[iti śrīgautamamīye ṣaḍviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 26 ||

athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi maṃtraṃ sarvārthasādhanaṃ | 
kṛṣṇeti tryakṣaraṃ maṃtraṃ madhyasthaṃ kāmabījayoḥ | 
sadyaḥ phalapradaṃ maṃtraṃ kathitaṃ bhaktitastava | 
asyāvadhānataḥ śakraḥ sureśatvamavāptavān | 
ṛṣirbrahmāsya maṃtrasya gāyatrī chanda īritaṃ | 
devatā jagatāmādirmmunibhiḥ kṛṣṇa īritaḥ | 
dīrghaṣaṭkena kāmena ṣaḍaṃgavidhinācaret | 
evamaṃgavidhiṃ kṛtvā maṃtraṃ dhyāyedathācyutaṃ | 
kalāya kusuma śyāmaṃ drutahema nibhaṃ bhuvā |
pārijāta vane ratna siṃhāsanopari sthitaṃ | 
dehottha svaprabhābhiśca bhāsayaṃtaṃ digaṃtaraṃ | 
śiśuveśadharaṃ devaṃ vāsudevaṃ jaganmayaṃ | 
nānālaṃkāra subhagaṃ gopībhiḥ parivīkṣitaṃ | 
kalpavṛkṣaviniṣkrāṃtaṃ ratnaudyaiḥ parisiṃcitaṃ | 
tārahārāvalī ramyaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtaṃ | 
caturlakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ vratasthaḥ sādhakottamaḥ | 
daśāṃśaṃ juhuyādaṃte śrīphalaiḥ sarvasiddhaye | 
aṣṭacchadāmbuje devamāvāhya paripūjayet | 
aṣṭa ṣaṭkāvṛte vāṃtaṃ pūjayeddigadhīśvarān | 
tadastāṇyapi cāṃte ca saparyyaiṣā samīritā | 
navanītā kṣamaṃ hutvā śriyamāpnotya ninditām | 
śrīphalāyutaṃ home narānayāptirmmaṃtriṇo bhavet | 
dhānyasya maṃjarīṃ hutvā dhanavān jāyate'cirāt | 
annavān puṣpahomena ghṛtahomāchriyaṃ labhet | 

<pṛ0 70ba> ya enaṃ bhajate maṃtrī japahomādi tatparaḥ | 
sutu samyak śriyaṃ labdhvā dehāṃte tatpadaṃ brajet | 
cūḍāmaṇimatho vakṣye maṃtrarājaṃ sudurllabhaṃ | 
yajñajñānānmunayaḥ sarve bhṛgustrailokyadarśinaḥ | 
caturvarṇasya maṃtrasya kāmādho vahṇiyogataḥ | 
ayaṃ śikhāmaṇiḥ proktastrailokyadarśana kṣamaḥ | 
nārado'sya ṛṣiḥ prokto virāṭchanda udāhṛtaṃ | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā cāsya munibhiḥ parikīrttitaḥ | 
ṣaḍdīrghayukta kāmena bījenāṃga kriyā matā | 
maṃtrasaṃpuṭitaṃ kṛtyā varṇanyāsaṃ puṭitaṃ kṛtyā varṇanyāsaṃ tathā caret | 
daśatattvaṃ tato nyasya karāṃganyāsamaṃ tataḥ | 
vṛndāvanagataṃ dhyāyet kalpakoṭyānamadhyagaṃ | 
dolāyamānaṃ gopībhiḥ suvarṇadolikāgataṃ | 
sūryyāyuta samābhāsaṃ lasanmakarakuṇḍalaṃ | 
nānāratnaparibhrājannānālaṃkāramaṇḍitaṃ | 
paṃcavarṣāvadhiṃ vāle kuṃtalollāsi sanmukhaṃ | 
hasatodāra kāṃtyā ca bhāsayaṃtaṃ digaṃtaraṃ | 
iti dhyātvā caturllakṣaṃ japenmanu śikhāmaṇiṃ | 
taddaśāṃśena juhuyāt palāśairathavāmbujaiḥ | 
aṃgendra vajrāvṛttībhiḥ strībhiḥ pūjanamīritaṃ | 
brahmavṛkṣottha kusumairhumedayutamādarāt | 
trikālajño bhavenmaṃtrī navanīta hutādapi | 
śrīphalasya phalairhomādrājyaṃ prāpnotya kaṃṭakaṃ | 
lakṣmī puṣpaṃ hutānmaṃtrī caiva lakṣmīmavāpnuyāt | 
mūla trikoṇamadhye tu jyotīrūpaṃ vicintayan | 
lakṣajāpānmanorasya trikālajño bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
karasthāmala kanyāyādviśvavṛttaṃ ca paśyati | 
hṛdi sthitaṃ japānāṃ ca sarvaṃ paśyati cukṣuṣā | 

<pṛ0 71a> ravivāre'śvatthamūle śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet | 
evaṃ ca niyataṃ kṛtvā mriyatenāpamṛtyutaḥ | 
vasaṃstatra lakṣa japāt sarvajño jāyate'cirāt || 

[iti śrīgautamīye saptaviṃśatitamo'dhyāyaḥ] || 27 ||

gautama uvāca 
ekākṣaraṃ manuvaraṃ viṣṇuṃ trailokyamohanaṃ | 
śravaṇe yadi yogyo'smi mune brūhi ca tattvataḥ | 

nārada uvāca 
samasta kṛṣṇamaṃtrāṇāmuddīpana karaṃ padaṃ | 
kevalaṃ tat prayatnena kathayāmi mune śṛṇu | 
kāmākṣaraṃ dharā saṃsthaṃ śāṃti bindu vibhūṣitaṃ | 
trailokyamohanaṃ viṣṇuṃ kathitaṃ tava yatnataḥ | 
ānanda nāradaścāsya ṛṣi chando virāḍapi | 
trailokyamohanaḥ prokto devatā viṣṇuravyayaḥ | 
sarveṣu kṛṣṇamaṃtreṣu maṃtro'yaṃ maṃtranāyakaḥ | 
sṛṣṭisthiti daśatattvaṃ mātṛkāṃ manu saṃpuṭāṃ | 
ṣaḍadīrghabhājā bījena nyāsaṃ karāṃgayorapi | 
mūrddhṇibhāle hṛdi guhye pādayośca yathākramaṃ | 
paṃcabāṇasya bījāni nyasya dhyāyedathāyutaṃ | 
thāṃtau repha samāyuktau anaṃta śāṃti bhūṣitau | 
bindunādasamāyuktau bījau trailokyamohanau | 
kāmabījaṃ tataḥ paścajjalaṃdharā samanvitaṃ | 
paṃcama svarasaṃyuktaṃ bindunāda samanvitaṃ | 
bījānyetāni cāṃte ca candraḥ sarga samanvitaḥ | 
śodhana mohana sandīpana tāpanonmādanādatha | 
nāmānurūpa phaladān paṃcārṇa manurapyasau | 
bhaṃga vidrumasaṃkāśa sarvatejo mayaṃ vapuḥ | 
kirīṭinaṃ kuṇḍalinaṃ keyūravalayānvitaṃ | 
muktālī ratnasambandha tulā koṭi yugānvitaṃ | 
nānālaṃkārasubhagaṃ pītāmbara yugāvṛtam | 

<pṛ0 71ba> garuḍopari sambadha raktapaṃkaja madhyagam | 
uttapta hemasaṃkāśāṃ lakṣmīṃ rāmoru saṃsthitāṃ | 
sarvālaṃkārasubhagāṃ śuklavāsa yugānvitāṃ | 
sakāmāṃ līlayā devaṃ mohayaṃtīṃ punaḥ punaḥ | 
śaṃkha cakra gadā padma pāśāṃkuśadhanuḥ śarān | 
dhārayaṃtaṃ jagannāthaṃ raktapadmāruṇe kṣaṇaṃ | 
lakṣmīṃ padmakarāṃ vāme dakṣiṇā liṃgitaṃ patiṃ | 
saṃsthitāṃ ciṃtayenmaṃtrī mohinīṃ bimbamātaraṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā jagannāthaṃ viṃśatyakṣara pīṭhake | 
samāvāhya yajenmaṃtrī upacārairaśeṣataḥ | 
nyāsa krameṇa vidhivad gandhapuṣpādibhiryajet | 
lakṣmīstadvāmataḥ pūjyā śrībījena vidhānavit | 
kaustubhaṃ gala deśe ca kirīṭaṃ kuṇḍala dvayaṃ | 
śrīvatsaṃ vakṣaḥ deśe ca vanamālā galopari | 
sarvatejo mayā yeti kirīṭāya nama(-)ityatha |
nāma maṃtreṇa vidhivat kaustubhādīn samarccayet | 
layāṃgamevamabhyarccya bhogāṃgamatha pūjayet | 
pakṣāndramagre saṃpūjya kurvaṃtaṃ stuti mādarāt | 
keśareṣu ṣaḍaṃgāni koṇamadhye ca dikṣu ca | 
agnyādi dalamūle ca vāṇāni purato vibhoḥ | 
pura ādi dalāgneṣu pradakṣiṇa kramād yajet | 
lakṣmīṃ sarasvatīṃ caiva ratiṃ prīti manaṃtaraṃ | 
kīrti kāṃti tuṣṭi puṣṭīstathāstyādi karāgrataḥ | 
vahirindrādayaḥ pūrvāstadastrāṇi ca tadvahiḥ | 
evaṃ yaḥ pūjayenmaṃtrī bhaktyā śrīpuruṣottamaṃ | 
karapracetāḥ sarvārthāstasyāṃte tat padaṃ vrajet | 
ravi lakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ jahuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ | 

<pṛ0 72a> amṛtatraya siktena pāyasena vidhānacit |  
athavā ravi sahasraṃ tu hunettāvacca tarpaṇaṃ | 
raktapadmā yutaṃ hutvā trailaukyaṃ vaśamānayet | 
kevalaṃ ghṛtahomena jīvedvarṣaśataṃ sukhī | 
palāśa lakṣahomena bhavet vākpati sannibhaḥ | 
vratasthaḥ koṭi jāpena kaivalyaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ | 
daśāṣṭādaśavarṇokta karmma cānena sādhayet | 
anena sadṛśo maṃtraḥ kṛṣṇamaṃtreṇa vidyate | 
asau samasta maṃtrāṇāṃ jīvanaṃ kathitaṃ mune | 
nirviryyāye ca maṃtro vai śaktihīnāśca kuṃṭhitāḥ | 
aripakṣa sthitā ye ca kevalā varṇarūpiṇaḥ | 
etadādyena japtena jīvaṃti ca punaṃti ca | 
hṛṣīkeśa padaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ namo'ntaḥ kāmapūrvakaḥ | 
aṣṭākṣara manuḥ proktaḥ samasta puruṣārthadaḥ | 
ṛṣi chando daivatāni pūjā prayoga karmma ca | 
ekākṣara viṣṇavat sarvaṃ kuryyāt sarvārtha siddhaye | 
trailokya mohanetyuktā vidmahe tadanaṃtaraṃ | 
kāmadevāya dhīmahī tanno viṣṇuḥ pracodayāt | 
kathitā viṣṇu gāyatrī samastajana raṃjinī | 
kāmādi japamātreṇa trailokyavaśakāriṇī | 
sarvapāpa praśamanī sarvāyat parimocanī | 
maṃtrasiddhiṃ karī puṃsāṃ prāyaścitta viśodhanī || 

[iti śrīgautamīye'ṣṭāviṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 28 ||

athāparaṃ maṃtravaraṃ vakṣye sarvasamṛddhidaṃ | 
yamupāsya surāṇāṃ tu pālako'bhūcchata kratuḥ | 
sadyaḥ śauracchāṃtajāṃtau krameṇa sahasaṃyutāḥ | 
śāṃti bindu samārūḍhāḥ proktaṃ bīja catuṣṭayaṃ | 
jaya kṛṣṇaṃ dvidhā proktā nityāṃte krīḍā saṃśaktaṃ | 

<pṛ0 72ba> tataḥ pramudita cetase nitya priyāya proktā vai | 
kṛṣṇaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ tataḥ proktā kāmāṃte daśavarṇakaḥ | 
vāk śaktiḥ kamalā bījaiḥ saṃpuṭo maṃtranāyakaḥ | 
sarveṣāṃ kṛṣṇa maṃtrāṇāmayaṃ maṃtraḥ śikhāmaṇiḥ | 
dharmmārthakāmamokṣāṇāmālayaṃ saṃpradāyataḥ | 
saṃpradāya vihīnā ye maṃtrāste niṣphalā matāḥ | 
ānanda nārada ṛṣirvirāṭ chanda udīritaṃ | 
śrīkṛṣṇo devatā cāsya bhakti mukti phalapradaḥ | 
padmaṣaṭkena matimān bījādyenāṃga kalpanaṃ | 
pūrvavannyāsajālaṃ hi kṛtvā karāṃga śodhanaṃ | 
tataśca vividhannyāsa mātṛkāṃ manu saṃpuṭāṃ | 
ṛṣi chando devatāni mūrddhiṇ mukhe hṛdi nyaset | 
dhyāyet śitamatirmmaṃtrī carācara guruṃ hariṃ | 
kṣīrāmbho nidhi madhyasthaṃ kanakācala madhyataḥ | 
dhyāyet svarṇamayīṃ bhūmiṃ tanmadhye ratnamaṇḍapaṃ | 
aneka yojanamitaṃ vistīrṇaṃ bahuyojanaṃ | 
nānāratnamayastambha muktādāma virājitaṃ | 
lasatpheṇamayairvastraiścandrā tapa vicitritaṃ | 
haṃsa kāraṇḍa cākīrṇaṃ paṃkajot palaśālibhiḥ | 
maṇḍitaṃ dīrghikā śatairmmahāvāṭī pariskṛtaṃ | 
svarṇaprākāra vikṛte ratnatoraṇacitrite | 
tatra ratnāsane ramye saṃsthitaṃ parameśvaraṃ | 
rukmiṇī bhīṣmaka sute pārśvayordhṛta cāmare | 
nānālaṃkāra subhage vīkṣitaṃ parayā mudā | 
kālindī ṛkṣatanaye pṛṣṭato dhṛtavarhake | 
mahāmegha prabhaṃ śyāmaṃ padmapatrā ruṇe kṣaṇaṃ | 
pītāmbara lasachrīmachrīvatsakaustubhānvitaṃ | 
nānālaṃkā (*)(ra) subhagaṃ tārahāra virājitaṃ | 

<pṛ0 73a> dīptaratna kirīṭaṃ ca sphuranmakarakuṇḍalaṃ | 
gorocanāla (*)(sa)dbhāsa tilakaṃ nīlakuṃtalaṃ | 
nāradādyairmmunigaṇairāvṛtaṃ snigdhalokenaiḥ | 
hṛṣṭa puṣṭa janākīrṇairnagarairbahuvistaraiḥ | 
saudhairgṛhaiḥ samutkīrṇa patākaiḥ parimaṇḍitaiḥ | 
brahma kṣattriya viṭśūdrairākīrṇai rathapaṃktibhiḥ | 
rathapaṃkti dvīpavaraiḥ sarvatra parimaṇḍitaiḥ | 
brahma kṣattriya vidśūdra bhavanaiḥ parvatoyamaiḥ | 
kāminībhiḥ subhavyābhiḥ sarvatra parimaṇḍitaiḥ | 
nānāvicitracitraiśca maṇḍitābhiḥ samanvitaiḥ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā muniśreṣṭha lakṣamekaṃ japenmanuṃ | 
belvaiḥ phalaistrimadhvaktairjjuhuyāttadanaṃtaraṃ | 
tarpayettaddaśāṃśena maṃtrajño vipra mukhyakān | 
ratnābhiṣekā gopālapīṭhe devaṃ prapūjayet | 
ṣaḍaṃgāvṛti bāhye tu mahiṣīḥ patragāḥ yajet | 
rukmiṇyādyā mahāratna bhūṣitāḥ prakṛtayaḥ śubhāḥ | 
tadvahirindravajrādyā jātyadhipāḥ savāhanāḥ | 
evamabhyarccanaṃ kṛtvā sidhamaṃtro dvijottamaḥ | 
prayogān sādhayedyastu karttā harttā ca sarvataḥ | 
śrīpuṣpairlakṣamātreṇa homādbhūmi purandaraḥ | 
pālāśairlakṣahomena vāgīśa samatāṃ vrajet | 
hayāri raktakusumairjjagadraṃjanakārakaḥ | 
kenalaṃ ghṛtahomena jīvedvarṣaśataṃ sukhī | 
annahomena dhanavān paśumān dugdhahomataḥ | 
kāraskaraphalairhomāchatrūnyūccāṭayet kṣaṇāt | 
marīca homātmatimān mārayedripumātmanaḥ | 
puṇḍarīkāyutaṃ hutvā mucyate sarvapātakaiḥ | 
anvakṣamātrahomena rājyaiśvaryyamavāpnuyāt | 
ātmānaṃ kaṃsamathanaṃ ripuṃrkasātmakaṃ smaran | 

<pṛ0 73ba> dakṣiṇābhimukho bhūtvā daśasāhasra jāpataḥ | 
kruddhāśayastathā maṃtrī malino mārayedripuṃ | 
apyamṛtāsane nityaṃ śakra vaivasvatā tithiḥ | 
asya maṃtrāna tat kaścinnāstyeva bhuvanatraye | 
na śastaṃ māraṇaṃ karmma yataḥ syādvaiṣṇave manau |
brahman brahmāstramādāya śaśakādau namaścaret | 
yadi kuryyāt pramādena eṣu sthāneṣu saṃbhavet | 
(+ yadi kuryyāt pramādena eṣu sthāneṣu saṃbhavet |) 
pāpinehe kāyāpi śaṭhāya janatāpine | 
ātmavittaṃ gṛhakṣetra kalatrādvāpahāriṇe | 
abhicāreṇābhicarettadā doṣaurna lipyate | 
duṣṭānāṃ damanaṃ śastaṃ kathitaṃ tvayi gotama | 
ajaḥ svayaṃ prajāyete tat pathānāṃ vinigrahe | 
lakṣamekaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ prāyaścittāya deśikaḥ | 
tena pāpairvimukto'sau bhavet kalyāṇa saṃyutaḥ | 
sādhyaṃ saṃkṛtyakṛtyā ca sādhakaṃ bhoktumicchati | 
tenātmānaṃ sadā rakṣet kṛtyenānena deśikaḥ | 
mṛtyuṃjayaṃ cā prajapenmatrādau guruvaktrataḥ | 
sarvatra karmmasu sadā gurave ca hi kāraṇaṃ | 
guroranujñāmādāya sarvakarmmaṇi sādhayet || 

[iti gautamīye vanatriṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] (ekonatriṃśo'dhyāyaḥ)|| 29 ||

atha śṛṇu pravakṣyāmi maṃtraṃ śrīpuruṣottamaṃ | 
yaja jñānāt sādhakavaro bhogamuktyośca bhājanaṃ | 
samastasiddhi saṃyukto jīvanmukto mahīṃ caret | 
dehāṃte kevalaṃ dhāmayāti tat paramaṃ padaṃ | 
sarveṣu kṛṣṇamaṃtreṣu śreṣṭhaḥ śrīpuruṣottamaḥ | 
bhukti mukti karaḥ sākṣāt smaraṇādeva vai nṛṇāṃ | 
praṇavaṃ mārabījaṃ ca ramāṃte nama ityatha | 

<pṛ0 74a> puruṣottama padaṃ coktā tathā prahatarūpitaḥ | 
tato lakṣmī nivāsāṃte sakalāṃte jagattathā | 
kṣobhaṇeti padaṃ coktā samāhita manā bhavet | 
sarvastrī hṛdayopetā vidāraṇa padaṃ tathā | 
ulkā tatasti bhuvanamadonmādakaraṃ tathā | 
surāsurāṃte manuja sundarī janavallabhaṃ | 
manasi tāpaya dvandvaṃ dīpaya dvitayaṃ tataḥ | 
śośaya dvitayaṃ bhūyo māraya dvitayaṃ paraṃ | 
stambhaya dvitayaṃ paścānmohaya dvitayaṃ punaḥ | 
drāvaya dvitayaṃ paścāt khaḍgena tadanaṃtaraṃ | 
sarvabāṇaiśchindhi yugaṃ pāśeneti padaṃ tataḥ | 
kaṭṭa dvayāṃte cāṃkuśena tāḍaya dvitayaṃ punaḥ | 
turuśabdadvayaṃ mathokaṃ kiṃ tiṣṭhasi padaṃ punaḥ | 
tāvat yāvat padasyāṃte samāhita manaṃtaraṃ | 
tato me siddhirābhāṣya bhavatvaṃte ca ṭha dvayaṃ | 
jaiminirmmanirākhyātaśchandaścāmitamīritaṃ | 
samasta jagatāmādirddevatā puruṣottamaḥ | 
puruṣottama śabdāṃte vadettribhuvanaṃ punaḥ | 
madonmādakarāṃte huṃ hṛdayaṃ sakalaṃ tataḥ | 
jagat kṣobhaṇa śabdāṃte lakṣmī dayita huṃ śivaḥ |
manmathottama saṃyuktamaṃgaje kāmadāyinī | 
huṃ śikhā paramopeta subhagākṣara saṃyutaṃ | 
sarvasaubhāgyakaraṃ huṃ kavacaṃ parikīrttitaṃ |
manāṃsi hara yugmāṃte dāraya dvitayaṃ ca me |
vaśamānaya huṃ netraṃ tārābhyāṃ ṣaṭ namo'ntikāḥ |
aṃgamaṃtrāḥ samuddiṣṭā netrāṃtāstaṃtra vedibhiḥ |
trailokyamohanāṃte ca hṛṣīkeśa padaṃ tataḥ | 
paścāda pratirūpādi manmathānaṃtaraṃ punaḥ | 

<pṛ0 74ba> sarvādi svīpadaṃ coktā hṛdayākarṣaṇaṃ tataḥ | 
āgacchāgaccha maṃtro'yaṃ tārādyena samanvitaṃ | 
anena manunā kṛtvā vyāpakasya ca vāhuṣu | 
aṣṭavidhāni maṃtrāṇi maṃtraiḥ sārddhamviciṃtayet | 
kṣīrāmbho nidhi madhyasthaṃ niraṃtara suradrumaṃ | 
udyadarkendu kiraṇaṃ dūrīkṛta manoharaṃ | 
deva samāloka nṛtyatyadvarhi varha kadambakaṃ | 
utphullakusumāmoda praharṣādaṃgasaṃkulaṃ | 
kūjat kokilamaṃcena vā cālita digaṃtaraṃ | 
nānākusumasaurabhya vāhi gandhavahāṃcitaṃ | 
kalpavallī nikuṃjeṣu krīḍat siddha kadambakaṃ | 
deva gandharva nārībhirgāyaṃtībhiralaṃkṛtaṃ | 
aneka dīrghikā yuktaṃ udyānaṃ sumahādbhūtaṃ | 
tasya madhye maṇimaye maṇḍape toraṇāṃcite | 
ṛtubhiḥ ṣaḍbhiraniśaṃ sevitasya mahaujasaḥ | 
suradrumasya mūlasthe mahāsiṃhāsane śubhe | 
raktāravindamadhyasthaṃ garuḍopari saṃsthitaṃ | 
dhyāyeddarllabhayā sārddhaṃ jagannāthaṃ jaganmayaṃ | 
devaṃ śrīpuruṣottamaṃ kamalayā svāṃkasthayā | 
paṃkajaṃ vibhratyā pariṇaddhamambujarūcā | 
tasyāṃ niruddhe kṣaṇaṃ dhyāyeccetasi śaṃkha padma muṣalāṃścāpāri khaḍgān gadāṃ hastairaṃkuśamudvahaṃtamaruṇaṃ smerāravindānanaṃ | 
evaṃ dhyātvā śriyaḥ kāṃtaṃ manuṃ lakṣa catuṣṭayaṃ | 
japedvaśī vidhāyātha kuṇḍamarddhendusannibhaṃ | 
juhuyādvaiṣṇave vahnau puṣpairjjātī samudbhavaiḥ | 
puṣpairyavaiścakramukhe brāhmaṇānapi bhojayet | 
arccayiṣyan jagannāthaṃ gāyatryā pariśodhitaṃ | 
ātmānaṃ yāgavastūni yāgabhūmiṃ ca deśikaḥ | 

<pṛ0 75a> trailokyamohanāyeti vidmahe padamīrayet | 
smarāya dhīmahi paścāttanno viṣṇuḥ pracodayāt | 
gāyattrīyā samākhyātā vaiṣṇavī sarvasiddhidā | 
prāk prokta vaiṣṇave pīṭhe kalpayedāsanaṃ tataḥ | 
pakṣirājāya ca dvandvamasya maṃtraḥ prakīrttitaḥ | 
saṃkalpitāyāṃ mūlena mūrttau devamananyadhīḥ | 
āvāhyamanunā maṃtrī vyāpakena samarccayet | 
bhṛgurvāṃtayutaṃ sendubījaṃ devyāḥ prakīrttitaṃ | 
karṇikāyāṃ yajedādau vidyānenāṃga devatāḥ | 
dalamūleṣu pūjayellakṣyādyādhṛtacāmarāḥ | 
muktāhāralasatkāṃta payodhara bharālasāḥ | 
javākusumasaṃkāśā madavibhrama mantharāḥ | 
hrasva traya klīvasarga rahita svara śobhitaṃ | 
devī bījaṃ kramādāsāṃ maṃtramāhurmmanīṣiṇaḥ | 
dalāgreṣu yajecchaṃkhaṃ śāṃrgaṃ cakra masiṃ gadāṃ | 
aṃkuśaṃ muṣalaṃ pāśametānyastrāṇi śāṃrgiṇaḥ | 
svamudrābhiḥ svamamubhiḥ kathyaṃte manavaḥ kramāt | 
ādyo jalacarāyāṃte ṭhadvayaṃ munirīritaḥ | 
śāṃrgī yaśaḥ śavāyāṃte svāhāṃtaṃ paramo manuḥ | 
sudarśana mahācakre jāyāṃte syāddahadvayaṃ | 
sarvaduṣṭān tataḥ paścāt kuru chindhi yugaṃ pṛthak | 
vidāraya padadvandvaṃ paramaṃtrān grasa grasa |
bhakṣaya trāsadvaya dvandvaṃ pratyekaṃ rakṣa phaṭ dvayaṃ | 
cakrāya nama ityeṣa tṛtīyo maṃtra īritaḥ | 
khaḍga tīkṣṇa padāṃte syāt pratyekamasva phaṭ dvayaṃ | 
cakrāya nama ityasya dvitīyo manurīritaḥ | 
khaḍgatīkṣṇe padasyāṃte chindhi khaṇḍa yugaṃ pṛthak | 
caturtho'yaṃ manuḥ proktaḥ kaumodakī mahāmate | 
sarvāsurāṃtaka padaṃ prasīda yuga varmma phaṭ 

<pṛ0 75ba> svāhāṃto'yaṃ manuḥ proktaḥ sadbhiḥ kaumodakī paraḥ | 
aṃkuśāṃte kaṭṭadvayaṃ ṣaṣṭho'yaṃ manurīritaḥ | 
samvarttakāle mūṣalāyātha yadvitayaṃ punaḥ | 
huṃ phaṭ dviṭhāṃto maṃtro'yaṃ saptamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ | 
pāśabaddhadvayaṃ paścādākarṣaṇa pada dvayaṃ | 
vahṇijāyāvadhiḥ sadbhiḥ aṣṭamo manurīritaḥ | 
lokeśān pūjayet paścādvastrādyairāyudhaiḥ saha | 
itthamabhyarccayennityaṃ yathāvat puruṣottamaṃ | 
prāpnoti mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ saubhāgyamatulaṃ yaśaḥ | 
āyurārogyamanyāni mano'bhīṣṭāni vindati | 
hayāri kusumairddevamarccayitvā mathā vidhi | 
śaśiprasunairjjuhuyādaṣṭottarasahasrakaṃ | 
māsamātreṇa vaśagāstasya syuḥ sakalā nṛpāḥ | 
hutvā bilvaphalaiḥ patraiḥ śriyaṃ vindeda ninditāṃ | 
praphulairarūnāmbhojaistāmeva labhate naraḥ | 
hutvā jyotiṣmatī tailaṃ sahasraṃ vasusaṃjñakaṃ | 
subhago jāyate samyak sarveṣāṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
vidhānenāmunā maṃtrī mahārogāt pramucyate | 
aśvattha samidhā homaḥ parākṛta dhanāpahaḥ | 
ājyākta durvāhomena mucyate mṛtyuto bhayāt | 
yasma nāma yutaṃ maṃtraṃ japedayutaṃ saṃkhyayā | 
sabhaveddāsavattasya nātra kāryyā vicāraṇā | 
bahunā kimihoktena manunā sādhakottamaḥ | 
sādhayet sakalān kāmān sākṣādviṣṇu śivā parān | 
atha maṃtraṃ pravakṣyāmi dṛṣṭādṛṣṭa phalapradaṃ | 
pūrvottaraṃ bhuvaṃ bhītvā sūtraṃ nava navaṃ nyaset | 
jāyate tatra koṣṭhāṇi catuṣaṣṭi prabhedataḥ | 
īśānādrākṣasaṃ yāvadrākṣasādvāyukoṇagaṃ | 
vilikhenmaṃtravarṇāni anuṣṭubha bhavāni ca | 

<pṛ0 76a> yaṃtrametat samākhyātaṃ sarvatobhadra saṃjñakam | 
sarvaroga pramathanaṃ samastapuruṣārthadam | 
likhitaṃ bhūrjjapatrādau yaṃtrametad yathāvidhi | 
vidhṛtaṃ vāhunā nityaṃ sarvakāma phalapradaṃ | 
phalake khādire kḷpte gavāṃ goṣṭhe niveśitaṃ | 
rakṣa kṛccauramārīghraṃ savatsānāṃ gavāṃhitaṃ | 
kṣīrago ga gokṣīra rakṣamā kṣa kṣamākṣara gonāmo gagaṇo nāgo pakṣa ga kṣaya |
ityevaṃ yaṃ tatvaṃ ca kathitaṃ tava suvrata | 
kevalaṃ tat prayatnena kimanyat śrotu marhasi || 

[iti śrīgautamīye trīṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 30 ||

gautama uvāca 
sarvajña sarvatatvajña sarvatattvārtha pāraga | 
svāyambhuve namastubhyaṃ kṛpāṃ kuru kṛpā kara | 
tavanāviditaṃ kiṃcit trailokye sa carācare | 
idānīṃ kathaya brahman maṃtrasiddhestu lakṣaṇaṃ | 
siddhyupāyaṃ katividhaṃ kathaya svānukampayā | 

nārada uvāca 
manorathā nāma kleśaṃ siddheruttamakāraṇaṃ | 
mṛtyunāṃ haraṇaṃ tadvaddevatādarśanaṃ tathā | 
prayogināṃ kleśasiddhiḥ siddhestu kṣaṇaṃ paraṃ | 
parakāya praveśaṃ ca purapraveśanaṃ tathā | 
urddhot krameṇa caivaṃ hi carācare mure gatiḥ | 
khecarī melanaṃ caiva tat kathā śravaṇādikaṃ | 
bhūchidrāṇi ca vakṣyāmi cādhamasya ca lakṣaṇaṃ | 
khātirvāhana bhūṣādirlābhaḥ sucirajīvanaṃ | 
nṛpāṇāṃ tadgaṇānāṃ ca vaśīkaraṇamuttamaṃ | 
sarvatra sarvalokeṣu camatkāra karaṃ sukhī | 
rogāpaharaṇaṃ dṛṣṭyā viṣāpaharaṇaṃ tathā | 
pāṇḍityaṃ labhate maṃtrī caturvidhaṃ prayatnataḥ | 
vairātpaṃca mumukṣvatvaṃ tyāgitā sarvavaśyatā | 

<pṛ0 76ba> aṣṭāṃga yogābhyasanaṃ bhogecchā parivarttanaṃ | 
sarvabhūteṣvānukampā sarvajñādi guṇodayaḥ | 
ityādi guṇa sampatti matha siddhestu lakṣaṇaṃ | 
khyātirbhūṣaṇa vāhādi labhaḥ sucira jīvanaṃ | 
nṛpāṇāmaṃganānāṃ ca vātsalyaṃ loka vaśyatā | 
mahaiśvaryyaṃ dhanitvaṃ ca puttradārādi sampadaḥ | 
adhamāḥ siddhayaḥ proktā maṃtrī prathama bhūmikāḥ | 
siddhamaṃtrastu yaḥ sākṣāt sa śivo nātra saṃśayaḥ | 
siddhalakṣaṇamityuktaṃ tadupāyamihocyate | 
pitṛ mātṛ viśuddhā ye śuddhācārā jitendriyāḥ | 
saṃpradāyenopadiṣṭāsteṣāṃ siddhirdrutaṃ bhavet | 
malinā malasaṃchannāḥ pāpinastaralāśayāḥ | 
devārccanādi vimukhā gurave śaṭhavṛttayaḥ | 
teṣāṃ kṛtastena sidhyaṃti maṃtra japa hutvādibhiḥ | 
ye maṃtrā malasaṃchannā kevalā varṇarūpiṇaḥ | 
nijīrvāḥ sattahīnā ye kuṃṭhitāśca tiraskṛtāḥ | 
aripakṣe sthitā ye ca pāpādigaṇasaṃyutāḥ | 
ye maṃtrāśca vidhi prāptā ye ca siddhāṃta varjitāḥ | 
ityādi doṣa duṣṭāśca siddhidānālpayogataḥ | 
paśubhāve sthitā maṃtrāḥ kevalā varṇarūpiṇaḥ | 
sauṣumna dhvanyuccaritāḥ prabhutvaṃ prāpnuvaṃtu te | 
vakṣyāmi carame'dhyāye tadupāyaṃ tavānagha | 
saṃskārādathakalpāṃte yena maṃtrasya siddhayaḥ | 
svalpayogena vidhivattāṃśca vakṣyāmi tattvataḥ | 
jananaṃ jīvanaṃ paścāttāḍanaṃ bodhanaṃ tathā | 
athābhiṣeko vimalīkaraṇāpyāyane punaḥ | 
tarpaṇaṃ dīpanaṃ goptirdaśaitā maṃtra saṃskriyāḥ | 
svarṇādipātre saṃlikhya mātṛkā yaṃtramuttamaṃ | 
kāśmīra candranenātha bhasmanā cātha suvrata | 

<pṛ0 77a> kāśmīraṃ śakti saṃskāre candranaṃ vaiṣṇave manau | 
śaive bhasma samākhyātaṃ mātṛkāyaṃtra lekhane | 
maṃtrāraṇāṃ mātṛkā madhyāduddhāro jananaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
paṃkti krameṇa vidhinā munibhistaṃtraniścayaiḥ | 
praṇavāṃtaritān kṛtvā maṃtravarṇān japet sudhīḥ | 
pratyekaṃ śatavāraṃ tu jīvanaṃ tadudāhṛtaṃ | 
maṃtravarṇān samālikhya tāḍayeccandanāmbhasā | 
pratyekaṃ vāyubījena pūrvavattāḍanaṃ mataṃ | 
bhasmanā kusumenātha candanenāthavā punaḥ | 
śaivādi taṃtrabhedena proktaṃ dravyatrayaṃ śubhaṃ | 
vilikhya maṃtra piṇḍaṃ tu prasūnaiḥ karavīrajaiḥ | 
tanmaṃtravarṇa saṃkhyākairhatyādrepheṇa bodhanaṃ | 
tattanmaṃtrokta vidhinā abhiṣekaḥ prakīrttitaḥ | 
aśvaṣyapallavaiḥ siṃcenmaṃtrī maṃtrārṇa saṃkhyayā | 
saṃciṃtya manasā maṃtraṃ suṣumnāmūla madhyataḥ | 
jyotirmmaṃtreṇa vidhivaddahenmalatrayaṃ patiḥ | 
tāraṃ vyomāgnimaruyug daṇḍīte patirmmanurmmataḥ | 
mārjanaṃ kuśatoyena puṣpatoyena vā tathā | 
tena maṃtreṇa vidhivadāpyāyana vidhiḥ smṛtaḥ | 
dīpayet sarvamaṃtrāṇā yogatastāva kāmayoḥ | 
dīpyamānaṃ ca maṃtraṃ ca gopayet sarvasiddhidaṃ | 
adhunā śakti taṃtraiṣu vaiṣṇave cendumajjalaiḥ | 
śaive ghṛtena dugdhena tarpaṇaṃ samyagīritaṃ | 
ete ca kathitāstubhyaṃ daśaitā maṃtrasaṃskriyāḥ | 
yān kṛtvā sampradāyena maṃtrī vāṃchitamaśnute || 

athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi maṃtrāṇāṃ siddhilakṣaṇaṃ | 
yat kṛtvā manuvit samyak śuddhimāpnotya yatnataḥ | 
nirvīryyā manavo ye ca teṣu bījāni yojayet | 

<pṛ0 77ba> kāmaṃ vā viṣabījaṃ vā japanāt siddhido manuḥ | 
athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi siddhyupāyaṃ mune śṛṇu | 
sthānasthāvaradāmaṃtrā dhyānasthāśca phalapradāḥ | 
sthāna dhyāna vihīnā ye koṭijāpāt phalaṃ nahi | 
athāto'nyat pravakṣyāmi maṃtrasiddhestu lakṣaṇaṃ | 
mātṛkā puṭitaṃ kṛtvā svamaṃtra prajapet sudhīḥ | 
varṇagraṃthātya vṛtyāhyā dvāralakṣaṃ samāpyate | 
niścitaṃ maṃtrasiddhiḥ syādityuktaṃ taṃtravedibhiḥ | 
atha saṃkṣepato vakṣye puraścaraṇamuttamaṃ | 
candra sūryya grahe caiva śuciḥ pūrvamupoṣitaḥ | 
nadyāṃ samudra gāmityāṃ nābhimātra jale sthitaḥ | 
grāsāvadhivimokṣāṃtaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ samāhitaḥ | 
homayettaddaśāṃśena taddaśāṃśena tarpaṇaṃ | 
abhiṣiṃceddaśāṃśena daśāṃśaṃ vipra bhojanaṃ | 
ityevaṃ paṃcakṛttena siddhamaṃtro bhavennaraḥ | 
athavā mūrddhi्ṇadeśe ca guruṃ saṃcintya vāgyataḥ | 
pūrvāgre nivasenmaṃtrī maṃtroktaṃ japamācaret | 
anaṃtaraṃ daśāśena kramāddhomādikaṃ caret | 
evaṃ kṛtvā siddhamaṃtro bhavenmaṃtrī na cānyathā | 
guru saṃtoṣamātreṇa siddhiḥ syādapavargadā | 
nā japtaḥ sidhyate maṃtrī jāhutaśca kadācana | 
nā pūjitaśca vidhivannātarpito nā bhojitaḥ | 
paṃca tattamate maṃtre kālasaṃkhyā na vidyate | 
kṛte cokta japāt siddhistretāyāṃ dviguṇo japaḥ | 
dvāpare triguṇāccaiva kalau saṃkhyā caturguṇā | 
kṛṣṇamaṃtreṇa devarṣe yugasaṃkhyā na vidyate | 
japa homa tarpaṇādyaiḥ sidhyate kṛta saṃkhyayā | 
siddhamaṃtra tayānātra yugasevā pariśramaḥ || 

<pṛ0 78a> [iti śrīgautamīye ekatriṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 31 ||

athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi siddhyupāyaṃ mahādbhūtaṃ | 
yena siddhena manuvit sṛṣṭi sthityaṃta kārakaḥ | 
tattatkarmmānurūpeṇa tattadyogaṃ prayojayet | 
grathanādi prabhedaśca maṃtrāṇāṃ vakṣyate'dhunā | 
grathitaṃ saṃpuṭaṃ grastaṃ samastaṃ ca vidarbhitaṃ | 
tathā cākrāṃta mādyaṃtaṃ garbhasthaṃ sarvato vṛtaṃ | 
tathā mukti vidarbhaṃ ca vidarbha grathitaṃ tathā | 
ityekādaśadhā maṃtrāḥ prayuktāḥ kāryyā siddhidāḥ | 
sādhyanāmārṇamekakaṃ maṃtrāṃte saṃprayojitaṃ | 
grathitaṃ tat samākhyātaṃ vaśyākṛṣṭikaraṃ paraṃ | 
maṃtramādau vadet sarvaṃ sādhyasaṃjñamanaṃtaraṃ | 
viparītaṃ punaścāṃte maṃtraṃ tat saṃpuṭaṃ smṛtaṃ | 
śāṃti puṣṭi karaṃ jñeyaṃ trailokyaiśvaryyadāyakaṃ | 
arddhamardhaṃ tathāḍhyaṃte maṃtraṃ kuryyādvicakṣaṇaḥ | 
madhye cāsya bhavet sādhyaṃ grastamityabhidhīyate | 
abhigrastaistathā maṃtrairmmāraṇoccāṭaneṣu ca | 
abhidhānaṃ vadet pūrvaṃ paścānmaṃtraṃ tathā vadet | 
etat samastamityuktaṃ śatrūccāṭana kārakaṃ | 
dvau dvau maṃtrākṣarau yatra ekaikaṃ sādhyavarṇaṃkaṃ | 
vidarbhitaṃ tu saṃproktaṃ duṣṭaghna vaśyalakṣaṇaṃ | 
maṃtrārṇaṃ taritaṃ sarvaṃ sa maṃtrāttiṣṭhate yadi | 
ākrāṃtaṃ tadvijānīyāt sadyaḥ sarvārthadāyakaṃ | 
kṣobhaḥ stambhaḥ samāveśa vaśyoccāṭana karmmasu | 
sakṛt pūrvaṃ vadenmaṃtramaṃte caiva tathā punaḥ | 
madhye cāsya bhavet sādhyamādyaṃtamiti tadviduḥ || 

<pṛ0 78ba> anyo'nyaṃ pratiyuktānāṃ vidveṣaṇa karaṃ paraṃ | 
ādau cāṃte tathā maṃtraṃ ddhivāraṃ saṃprayojayet | 
sādhya nāma sakṛnmadhye garbhasthaṃ tu tadocyate | 
māraṇoccāṭanaṃ vaśyaṃ prayuktaṃ kārayennṛṇāṃ | 
hetinau saumyadhīrgarbhaṃ stambhayecca gate tathā | 
tridhāmaṃtraṃ vadet pūrvantathaivāṃte punastridhā | 
sakṛt sādhyaṃ bhavenmadhyaṃ taṃ vidhāt sarvato vṛttaṃ | 
sarvābhicāra śamanaṃ mahāmṛtyunivāraṇaṃ | 
sarvasaubhāgyajananaṃ mṛtānāma mṛtapradaṃ | 
ādau maṃtraṃ tato nāma sādhyākṣaramathā likhet | 
evamevaṃ tridhā kṛtvā bhavenmukti vidarbhitaṃ | 
sarvavyādhiharaṃ proktaṃ bhūtāpasmāramarddanaṃ | 
ekaikaṃ varṇamadhyaṃ tu kṛtvā maṃtra vidarbhitaṃ | 
pūrvavat kathitaṃ cānyattasyādāṃte prakalpayet | 
vidarbha grathitaṃ nāma maṃtrarāmanuttamaṃ | 
sarva karmmakaraṃ proktaṃ sarvaiśvaryya phalapradaṃ | 
evamete prayogāḥ syuḥ siddhamaṃtrasya siddhidāḥ | 

athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi maṃtrasiddhestu lakṣaṇam | 
yajjñātvā sādhakaśreṣṭho maṃtraṃ siddhiṃ labheddhruvaṃ | 
sabhyaganuṣṭhito maṃtro yadi siddhirna jāyate | 
punastenaiva karttavyaṃ tataḥ siddho bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
punaranuṣṭito maṃtro yadi sidhirna jāyate | 
punastenaiva karttavyaṃ tataḥ siddho na saṃśayaḥ | 
punaḥ so'nuṣṭhito maṃtro yadi siddhirna jāyate | 
upāyāstatra kartavyāḥ saptaśaṃkara bhāṣitaḥ | 
bhrāmaṇaṃ bodhanaṃ vaśyaṃ pīḍanaṃ śoṣapoṣaṇaṃ | 
dahanāṃtaṃ kramāt kuryyāt tataḥ siddho bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
bhrāmaṇaṃ vāruṇe bīje grathanaṃ kramayogataḥ | 

<pṛ0 79a> rocanā guru saṃmiśraṃ elā karpūra kuṃkumaiḥ | 
uśīracandanābhyāṃ tu maṃtraṃ saṃgrathitaṃ likhet | 
kṣīrājya madhutoyānāṃ madhye tallikhitaṃ kṣipet | 
pūjanājjapanāddhomād bhrāmitaḥ siddhido bhavet | 
bhrāmito yadi sidhyeta bodhanaṃ tasya kārayet | 
bhramaṇaṃ kāmabījena saṃpuṭīkṛtya saṃjapet | 
evaṃ ruddho bhavet siddho nacede tadvaśī kuru | 
alaktaṃ candanaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ haridrā sadanaṃ śilāḥ | 
etaistu maṃtramālikhya bhūrjjapatre suśobhane | 
dhāryyā kaṃṭhe bhavet siddhaḥ pīḍanamvāpi kārayet | 
adharottara yogena padena parijāpya vai | 
dhyāpīta devatāṃ tadvadadharottara rūpiṇīṃ | 
vidyāmāditya dugdhena likhitvā kramya cāṃghriṇā | 
tathā bhūteti maṃtreṇa homaḥ kāryyo dine dine | 
pīḍite lajjayā viṣṭaḥ sadā tadatha poṣayet | 
vālāyāstṛtīyaṃ bījamādyaṃte tasya yojayet | 
gokṣīramadhunā lipya vidyāṃ pāṇau vidhārayet | 
poṣito'yaṃ bhavet siddho na cet kurvī na śoṣaṇaṃ | 
dvābhyāṃ ca māthayā bījaṃ dhārayet kara kaṃṭhayoḥ | 
eṣā vidyā game dhāryyā balavīryya samanvitā | 
śoṣito'pi na siddhiśceddahanīyo'gnibījataḥ | 
agne yena tu bījena maṃtrādya karamakṣaraṃ | 
ādyaṃ tu madhya urddhaṃ tu ye godohanna karmmaṇi | 
brahmavṛkṣasya mūlena kṛtvā darbhamayaṃ tataḥ | 
śubhe deśe tate maṃtraḥ siddhaḥ syācchaṃkaroditaṃ | 
ityevaṃ kathitaṃ samyak kevalaṃ tava bhaktitaḥ | 
ekaina tu kṛtārthaḥ syādbahubhiḥ kiṃ ca suvrataḥ | 

<pṛ0 79ba> athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi maṃtrauṣadhi mahādbhutāṃ |  
yaḥ prayoga vidhānena sadyaḥ siddho bhaveddhruvaṃ | 
karavīrasya mūlena piṣṭena madhu pāṇinā | 
talliptāṃgā kṛtaḥ kaṃṭhe manuṃ sadyaḥ prasīdati | 
vimukta sarvapāpaughaḥ kṛṣṇaṃ paśyati catuṣā | 
jīvanmukto bhavenmaṃtrī satyaṃ satyaṃ mayoditaṃ | 
yatra vā kutraciddeśe gaṃtu kāmo yathā bhavet | 
athavā bhūtale maṃtrī pātāle vāpi kautukāt | 
tatkṣaṇāttaprayātyeva sarvasiddhiśvaro bhavet | 
ityevaṃ kathitaṃ samyak maṃtrasiddhestu lakṣaṇaṃ | 
tadupāyaṃ tadā brahman kevalaṃ tava bhāgyataḥ | 
aneka taṃtra saṃproktamaneka muni sammataṃ | 
idānīṃ tu punarbrahman kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchasi || 

[iti śrīgautamīye mahātaṃtre sarvataṃtrottame dvātriṃśo'dhyāyaḥ] || 32 || 
[samāptaḥ śubham] || 
